# BOOK	002	EXO	Exodus	U-Eksodusi
002	EXO	001	001	La ngamabizo amadodana ka-Israyeli aya eGibhithe loJakhobe, munye ngamunye lemuli yakhe:
002	EXO	001	002	uRubheni, uSimiyoni, uLevi loJuda;
002	EXO	001	003	u-Isakhari, uZebhuluni loBhenjamini,
002	EXO	001	004	uDani loNafithali; uGadi lo-Asheri.
002	EXO	001	005	Inzalo yonke kaJakhobe yayingamatshumi ayisikhombisa. UJosefa wayevele eseseGibhithe.
002	EXO	001	006	Kwathi uJosefa labo bonke abafowabo kanye lasosonke lesosizukulwane sebefile,
002	EXO	001	007	abako-Israyeli bazalana banda kakhulu, okokuthi ilizwe lonke lagcwala ngabo.
002	EXO	001	008	Kwasekusiba lenye inkosi eyayingazi lutho ngoJosefa, yaba ngumbusi eGibhithe.
002	EXO	001	009	Yathi ebantwini bayo, “Khangelani, abantu bako-Israyeli sebebanengi kakhulu kulathi.
002	EXO	001	010	Asiboneni amacebo esingawenza ngabo funa bande kakhulu kuthi lapho kuqhamuka impi, babambane lezitha zethu, balwe lathi, besebesuka elizweni.”
002	EXO	001	011	Ngakho babeka izinduna zezigqili ukuthi zibasebenzise kanzima, bakha iPhithomi leRamesesi aba ngamadolobho eziphala zikaFaro.
002	EXO	001	012	Kodwa kwathi ngokuhlutshwa kwabo ngamandla, labo banda kakhulu basabalala; okwenza amaGibhithe abesaba abako-Israyeli
002	EXO	001	013	asebasebenzisa ngochuku.
002	EXO	001	014	Enza impilo yabo yaba nzima kakhulu betshaya izitina lokuvoxa udaka besenza leminye yonke imisebenzi yemasimini. Kuyo yonke imisebenzi enzima amaGibhithe abasebenzisa ngochuku.
002	EXO	001	015	Inkosi yaseGibhithe yathi kubabelethisi bamaHebheru okwakuthiwa nguShifira loPhuwa,
002	EXO	001	016	“Nxa libelethisa abafazi bamaHebheru, lingabona kuzelwe umfana kufanele limbulale; kodwa nxa kuyinkazana, liyiyekele iphile.”
002	EXO	001	017	Kodwa ababelethisi babemesaba uNkulunkulu, ngakho abakwenzanga lokho ababekutshelwe yinkosi yaseGibhithe.
002	EXO	001	018	Sekube njalo, inkosi yaseGibhithe yababiza ababelethisi yathi kubo, “Kungani lenze lokhu? Kungani liyekele abafana baphila?”
002	EXO	001	019	Ababelethisi bamphendula uFaro bathi, “Abafazi bamaHebheru abafani labafazi bamaGibhithe; balamandla baphanga babelethe ababelethisi bengakafiki.”
002	EXO	001	020	Ngakho uNkulunkulu waba lomusa kubo ababelethisi, abantu banda baba banengi kakhulu.
002	EXO	001	021	Njalo njengoba ababelethisi bamesaba uNkulunkulu, wabapha ezabo izimuli.
