004	NUM	033	035	Basuka e-Abhurona bayamisa e-Eziyoni-Gebheri.
004	NUM	033	036	Basuka e-Eziyoni-Gebheri bayamisa eKhadeshi, eNkangala yaseZini.
004	NUM	033	037	Basuka eKhadeshi bayamisa eNtabeni yaseHori, emngceleni wase-Edomi.
004	NUM	033	038	Ngokulaya kukaThixo, u-Aroni umphristi wakhwela eNtabeni yaseHori, lapho afela khona ngosuku lwakuqala lwenyanga yesihlanu yomnyaka wamatshumi amane emva kokuphuma kwabako-Israyeli eGibhithe.
004	NUM	033	039	U-Aroni wayeseleminyaka elikhulu elileminyaka engamatshumi amabili lemithathu yokuphila ekufeni kwakhe eNtabeni yaseHori.
