006	JOS	018	028	iZela, iHayelefi, idolobho lamaJebusi (okuyikuthi iJerusalema), iGibhiya leKhiriyathi, amadolobho alitshumi lane kanye lemizana yawo. Leli kwakuyilifa likaBhenjamini lensendo zakhe.
006	JOS	019	001	Inkatho yesibili yawela esizwaneni sikaSimiyoni ngensendo zaso. Ilifa labo laliphakathi kwelizwe likaJuda.
006	JOS	019	002	Laligoqela: iBherishebha (noma Shebha), iMolada,
006	JOS	019	003	iHazari-Shuwali, iBhala, i-Ezema,
006	JOS	019	004	i-Elitholadi, iBhethuli, iHoma,
