006	JOS	019	022	Umngcele wawugudla iThabhori, iShahazuma leBhethi-Shemeshi wasukhawula eJodani. Kwakulamadolobho alitshumi lesithupha lemizana yawo.
006	JOS	019	023	Amadolobho la lemizi yawo kwakuyilifa lesizwana sika-Isakhari lensendo zakhe.
006	JOS	019	024	Inkatho yesihlanu yawela esizwaneni sika-Asheri ngensendo zakhe.
006	JOS	019	025	Ilizwe labo laligoqela: iHelikhathi, iHali, iBhetheni, i-Akhishafi,
