009	1SA	020	009	UJonathani wathi, “Hatshi bo! Kambe aluba bengilolwazi oluncane ukuthi ubaba uzimisele ukwenza okubi kuwe, kade ngingasoze ngikutshele na?”
009	1SA	020	010	UDavida wabuza wathi, “Ngubani ozangitshela nxa uyihlo ekuphendula kubi na?”
009	1SA	020	011	UJonathani wathi, “Woza, kasiye egangeni.” Ngakho baya khonale bobabili.
