012	2KI	025	011	UNebhuzaradani umlawuli wabalindi wathatha bonke abantu ababesele edolobheni wabasa ekuthunjweni, ndawonye labo bonke abantu lalabo abasebeye enkosini yaseBhabhiloni.
012	2KI	025	012	Kodwa umlawuli wamabutho watshiya inengi labantu ababengabayanga bokucina elizweni ukuba basebenze ezivinini lasemasimini.
012	2KI	025	013	AbeBhabhiloni baphahlaza izinsika zethusi lezinti zezibane loLwandle lwethusi, okwakusethempelini likaThixo. Bathwalela ithusi lelo eBhabhiloni.
012	2KI	025	014	Bathatha njalo imbiza, lamafotsholo, lezindlawu, lezinditshi lazozonke izitsha zethusi ezazisetshenziswa enkonzweni yasethempelini.
012	2KI	025	015	Umlawuli wabalindi besigodlo wathatha indengezi lemiganu yokuchela, konke okwakwenziwe ngegolide elicengekileyo loba isiliva.
012	2KI	025	016	Ithusi elalivela ensikeni ezimbili, loLwandle kanye lelezidindi ezisusekayo, konke okwakwenzelwe ithempeli likaThixo nguSolomoni, kwakulesisindo esasingelinganiswe.
012	2KI	025	017	Ubude bensika ngayinye babuzingalo ezilitshumi lasificaminwembili. Isiduku sethusi phezu kwenye insika sasizingalo ezintathu ubude baso njalo siceciswe ngomeluko lamaphomegranathi ethusi nxazonke. Eyinye insika kanye lomeluko wayo layo yayinjalo.
012	2KI	025	018	Umlawuli wabalindi wathumba uSeraya induna yabaphristi, loZefaniya umsekeli wakhe kanye labalindi bomnyango abathathu.
012	2KI	025	019	Kulabo ababelokhu besedolobheni, wathatha isikhulu esasiphethe amadoda okulwa labacebisi besikhosini abahlanu. Wathatha lonobhala owayeyinduna eyayiphethe ukubuthwa kwabantu bengeniswa emabuthweni kanye lamadoda angamatshumi ayisithupha ayelawo atholakala phakathi komuzi.
012	2KI	025	020	UNebhuzaradani umlawuli wabathatha bonke wabasa enkosini yaseBhabhiloni eRibhila.
012	2KI	025	021	Khonale eRibhila, elizweni laseHamathi, inkosi yathi kabaqunywe. Ngakho abakoJuda baya ekuthunjweni kude lelizwe labo.
012	2KI	025	022	UNebhukhadineza inkosi yaseBhabhiloni wakhetha uGedaliya indodana ka-Ahikhami, oyindodana kaShafani, ukuba aphathe abantu ababesele koJuda.
012	2KI	025	023	Kwathi zonke izikhulu zabalawuli bamabutho lamabutho sebezwile ukuthi inkosi yaseBhabhiloni yayisibeke uGedaliya ukuba nguSibalukhulu, beza kuGedaliya eMizipha izikhulu kungu-Ishumayeli indodana kaNethaniya, uJohanani indodana kaKhareya, uSeraya indodana kaThanihumethi umNethofa, uJazaniya indodana kaMahakhathi, labantu babo.
012	2KI	025	024	UGedaliya wafunga isifungo ebathembisa labantu babo wathi: “Lingesabi izikhulu zaseBhabhiloni. Hlalani elizweni lisebenzele inkosi yaseBhabhiloni, konke kuzalilungela.”
012	2KI	025	025	Kodwa ngenyanga yesikhombisa u-Ishumayeli indodana kaNethaniya, indodana ka-Elishama, owayezalwa esikhosini, weza lamadoda alitshumi bafika babulala uGedaliya lamadoda akoJuda kanye laweBhabhiloni ayekade elaye eMizipha.
012	2KI	025	026	Ngenxa yalokhu, abantu bonke kusukela kubantukazana kusiya kwabaphakemeyo, kanye lezikhulu zamabutho, babalekela eGibhithe ngokwesaba abeBhabhiloni.
012	2KI	025	027	Ngomnyaka wamatshumi amathathu lesikhombisa wokuthunjwa kukaJehoyakhini inkosi yakoJuda, ngomnyaka u-Evili-Merodakhi aba yinkosi eBhabhiloni, wakhulula uJehoyakhini entolongweni ngosuku lwamatshumi amabili lesikhombisa lwenyanga yetshumi lambili.
012	2KI	025	028	Wakhuluma laye ngomusa, wamnika isihlalo esihloniphekayo esasingaphezu kwezamanye amakhosi ayelaye eBhabhiloni.
012	2KI	025	029	Ngakho uJehoyakhini wakhupha izigqoko zakhe zasentolongweni, wadla lenkosi izikhathi zonke okwempilo yakhe yonke.
012	2KI	025	030	Nsuku zonke inkosi yayinika uJehoyakhini isabelo esimisiweyo malanga wonke, empilweni yakhe yonke.
#
# BOOK	013	1CH	1 Chronicles	1 Imilando
013	1CH	001	001	U-Adamu, uSethi, u-Enoshi,
013	1CH	001	002	uKhenani, uMahalaleli, uJaredi,
013	1CH	001	003	u-Enoki, uMethuzela, uLameki, uNowa.
013	1CH	001	004	Amadodana kaNowa ayeyila: uShemu, uHamu loJafethi.
013	1CH	001	005	Amadodana kaJafethi ayeyila: uGomeri, uMagogi, uMadayi, uJavani, uThubhali, uMesheki loThirasi.
013	1CH	001	006	Amadodana kaGomeri ayeyila: u-Ashikhenazi, uRifathi kanye loThogarima.
013	1CH	001	007	Amadodana kaJavani ayeyila: u-Elisha, uThashishi, uKhithimi loRodanimu.
013	1CH	001	008	Amadodana kaHamu ayeyila: uKhushi, uMizirayimi, uPhuthi loKhenani.
013	1CH	001	009	Amadodana kaKhushi ayeyila: uSebha, uHavila, uSabhitha, uRahama loSabhitheka. Amadodana kaRahama ayeyila: uShebha loDedani.
013	1CH	001	010	UKhushi wayenguyise kaNimrodi, owakhula waba liqhawe elilamandla emhlabeni.
013	1CH	001	011	UMizirayimi wayenguyise wamaLudi, ama-Anami, amaLehabhi, amaNafithuhi,
013	1CH	001	012	amaPhathrosi, lamaKhasiluhi (okwadabuka khona amaFilistiya) lamaKhafithori.
013	1CH	001	013	UKhenani wayenguyise kaSidoni izibulo lakhe, amaHithi,
013	1CH	001	014	amaJebusi, ama-Amori, amaGigashi,
013	1CH	001	015	amaHivi, ama-Arikhi, amaSini,
013	1CH	001	016	ama-Avadi, amaZemari kanye lamaHamathi.
013	1CH	001	017	Amadodana kaShemu ayeyila: u-Elamu, u-Ashuri, u-Afazadi, uLudi lo-Aramu. Amadodana ka-Aramu ayeyila: u-Uzi, uHuli, uGetha loMesheki.
013	1CH	001	018	U-Afazadi wayenguyise kaShela, uShela wazala u-Ebha.
013	1CH	001	019	Amadodana amabili ayezalwa ngu-Ebha ayeyila: Omunye wayenguPhelegi, ngoba ngezinsuku zakhe umhlaba wawudabuke phakathi; umfowabo kwakuthiwa nguJokithani.
013	1CH	001	020	UJokithani wayenguyise ka-Alimodadi, uShelefi, uHazarimavethi, uJera,
013	1CH	001	021	uHadoramu, u-Uzali, uDikila,
013	1CH	001	022	u-Obhali, u-Abhimayeli, uShebha,
013	1CH	001	023	u-Ofiri, uHavila kanye loJobhabhi. Bonke laba babengamadodana kaJokithani.
013	1CH	001	024	UShemu, u-Afazadi uShela,
013	1CH	001	025	u-Ebha, uPhelegi, uRewu
013	1CH	001	026	uSerugi, uNahori, uThera
013	1CH	001	027	lo-Abhrama (u-Abhrahama).
013	1CH	001	028	Amadodana ka-Abhrahama ayeyila: u-Isaka lo-Ishumayeli.
013	1CH	001	029	Laba babeyinzalo yabo: uNebhayothi izibulo lika-Ishumayeli, uKhedari, u-Adibheli, uMibhisamu,
013	1CH	001	030	uMishima, uDuma, uMasa, uHadadi, uThema,
013	1CH	001	031	uJethuri, uNafishi kanye loKhedema. La yiwo ayengamadodana ka-Ishumayeli.
013	1CH	001	032	Amadodana azalwa nguKhethura, umfazi ka-Abhrahama oweceleni, ayeyila: uZimirani, uJokishani, uMedani, uMidiyani, u-Ishibhaki loShuwa. Amadodana kaJokishani ayeyila: uShebha loDedani.
013	1CH	001	033	Amadodana kaMidiyani ayeyila: u-Efa, u-Eferi, uHanokhi, u-Abhida lo-Elida. Bonke laba babeyizizukulwane zikaKhethura.
013	1CH	001	034	U-Abhrahama wayenguyise ka-Isaka. Amadodana ka-Isaka ayeyila: u-Esawu lo-Israyeli.
013	1CH	001	035	Amadodana ka-Esawu ayeyila: u-Elifazi, uRuweli, uJewushi, uJalamu loKhora.
013	1CH	001	036	Amadodana ka-Elifazi ayeyila: uThemani, u-Omari, uZefi, uGathamu loKhenazi; ekaThimina kungu-Amaleki.
013	1CH	001	037	Amadodana kaRuweli ayeyila: uNahathi, uZera, uShama loMiza.
013	1CH	001	038	Amadodana kaSeyiri ayeyila: uLothani, uShobhali, uZibhiyoni, u-Ana, uDishoni, u-Ezeri loDishani.
013	1CH	001	039	Amadodana kaLothani ayeyila: uHori loHomami. UThimina wayengudadewabo kaLothani.
013	1CH	001	040	Amadodana kaShobhali ayeyila: u-Alivani, uManahathi, u-Ebhali, uShefo lo-Onami. Amadodana kaZibhiyoni ayeyila: u-Ayiya lo-Ana.
013	1CH	001	041	Indodana ka-Ana yayingu: uDishoni. Amadodana kaDishoni ayeyila: uHemirani, u-Eshibhani, u-Ithirani loKherani.
013	1CH	001	042	Amadodana ka-Ezeri ayeyila: uBhilihani, uZavani lo-Akhani. Amadodana kaDishoni ayeyila: u-Uzi lo-Arani.
013	1CH	001	043	La ayengamakhosi abusa e-Edomi kungakabusi inkosi yako-Israyeli: uBhela indodana kaBheyori, idolobho lakhe lalibizwa ngokuthi yiDinihabha.
013	1CH	001	044	UBhela esefile, uJobhabhi indodana kaZera waseBhozira wathatha umbuso waba yinkosi.
013	1CH	001	045	UJobhabhi esefile, uHushamu waselizweni lamaThemani wathatha umbuso waba yinkosi.
013	1CH	001	046	UHushamu esefile, uHadadi indodana kaBhedadi owanqoba uMidiyani elizweni laseMowabi, wathatha umbuso waba yinkosi. Idolobho lakhe lalibizwa ngokuthi yi-Avithi.
013	1CH	001	047	UHadadi esefile, uSamila waseMasirekha wathatha umbuso waba yinkosi.
013	1CH	001	048	USamila esefile, uShawuli waseRehobhothi phezu komfula wathatha umbuso waba yinkosi.
013	1CH	001	049	UShawuli esefile, uBhali-Hanani indodana ka-Akhibhori wathatha umbuso waba yinkosi.
013	1CH	001	050	UBhali-Hanani esefile, uHadadi wathatha umbuso waba yinkosi. Idolobho lakhe labizwa ngokuthi yiPawu, njalo ibizo lomkakhe lalinguMehethabheli indodakazi kaMathiredi, indodakazi kaMe-Zahabhi.
013	1CH	001	051	UHadadi laye wafa. Izinduna zase-Edomi kwakuyilezi: uThimina, u-Aliva, uJethethi,
013	1CH	001	052	u-Oholibhama, u-Ela, uPhinoni,
013	1CH	001	053	uKhenazi, uThemani, uMibhizari,
013	1CH	001	054	uMagidiyeli lo-Iramu. Lezi kwakuzinduna ze-Edomi.
013	1CH	002	001	Amadodana ka-Israyeli ayeyila: uRubheni, uSimiyoni, uLevi, uJuda, u-Isakhari, uZebhuluni,
013	1CH	002	002	uDani, uJosefa, uBhenjamini, uNafithali, uGadi lo-Asheri.
013	1CH	002	003	Amadodana kaJuda yila: ngu-Eri, lo-Onani kanye loShela. Laba bobathathu wabazala lowesifazane ongumKhenani, indodakazi kaShuwa. U-Eri, izibulo likaJuda, wayeyisigangi phambi kukaThixo, ngalokho uThixo wambulala.
013	1CH	002	004	UThamari, umalukazana kaJuda wamzalela uPherezi loZera. UJuda wayelamadodana amahlanu.
013	1CH	002	005	Amadodana kaPherezi yila: nguHezironi loHamuli.
013	1CH	002	006	Amadodana kaZera yila: nguZimri, lo-Ethani, loHemani, loKhalikholi kanye loDarida. Bonke babebahlanu.
013	1CH	002	007	Indodana kaKhami yile: ngu-Akhari, owaletha inhlupheko ko-Israyeli ngesiphambeko asenza ngalokho okungcwelisiweyo.
013	1CH	002	008	Indodana ka-Ethani yile: ngu-Azariya.
013	1CH	002	009	Amadodana azalwa nguHezironi yila: nguJerameli, loRamu kanye loKhalebi.
013	1CH	002	010	URamu wayenguyise ka-Aminadabi, njalo u-Aminadabi enguyise kaNahashoni, umkhokheli wabantu bakoJuda.
013	1CH	002	011	UNahashoni wayenguyise kaSalimoni, uSalimoni enguyise kaBhowazi.
013	1CH	002	012	UBhowazi enguyise ka-Obhedi, u-Obhedi enguyise kaJese.
013	1CH	002	013	UJese wayenguyise ka-Eliyabi izibulo lakhe; indodana yesibili kungu-Abhinadabi, eyesithathu kunguShimeya,
013	1CH	002	014	eyesine kunguNethaneli, eyesihlanu kunguRadayi,
013	1CH	002	015	eyesithupha kungu-Ozemu, eyesikhombisa kunguDavida.
013	1CH	002	016	Odadewabo kwakunguZeruya lo-Abhigeli. Amadodana amathathu kaZeruya kwakungu-Abhishayi, loJowabi kanye lo-Asaheli.
013	1CH	002	017	U-Abhigeli wayengunina ka-Amasa, oloyise okwakuthiwa nguJetha umʼIshumayeli.
013	1CH	002	018	UKhalebi indodana kaHezironi wayelabantwana abazala kumkakhe u-Azubha (lakuJeriyothi). Amadodana ka-Azubha ayeyila: nguJesheri, loShobhabi, kanye lo-Adoni.
013	1CH	002	019	Ekufeni kuka-Azubha, uKhalebi wathatha u-Efrathi, owamzalela uHuri.
013	1CH	002	020	UHuri wayenguyise ka-Uri, njalo u-Uri enguyise kaBhezaleli.
013	1CH	002	021	Muva, uHezironi wembatha lendodakazi kaMakhiri uyise kaGiliyadi (ayemthethe eseleminyaka engamatshumi ayisithupha ubudala bakhe), yena wamzalela uSegubi.
013	1CH	002	022	USegubi wayenguyise kaJayiri, owayephethe imizi engamatshumi amabili lantathu eGiliyadi.
013	1CH	002	023	(Kodwa uGeshuri lo-Aramu bathumba iHavothi-Jayiri, kanye leKhenathi lezindawana eziyimizana eseduzane, imizi engamatshumi ayisithupha.) Bonke laba babeyisizukulwane sikaMakhiri uyise kaGiliyadi.
013	1CH	002	024	Ngemva kokufa kukaHezironi eKhalebi-Efratha, u-Abhija umkaHezironi wamzalela u-Ashuri uyise kaThekhowa.
013	1CH	002	025	Amadodana kaJerameli izibulo likaHezironi yila: nguRamu izibulo lakhe, loBhuna, lo-Oreni, lo-Ozemu kanye lo-Ahija.
013	1CH	002	026	UJerameli wayelomunye umfazi owayethiwa ngu-Athara unina ka-Onami.
013	1CH	002	027	Amadodana kaRamu izibulo likaJerameli yila: nguMazi, loJamini kanye lo-Ekheri.
013	1CH	002	028	Amadodana ka-Onami yila: nguShamayi loJada. Amadodana kaShamayi yila: nguNadabi lo-Abhishuri.
013	1CH	002	029	Umka-Abhishuri kwakungu-Abhihayili, owamzalela u-Ahibhani loMolidi.
013	1CH	002	030	Amadodana kaNadabi yila: nguSeledi lo-Aphayimi. USeledi wafa engelabantwana.
013	1CH	002	031	Indodana ka-Aphayimi yile: ngu-Ishi, uyise kaSheshani. USheshani wayenguyise ka-Ahilayi.
013	1CH	002	032	Amadodana kaJada, umfowabo kaShamayi yila: nguJetha loJonathani. UJetha wafa engelabantwana.
013	1CH	002	033	Amadodana kaJonathani yila: nguPhelethi loZaza. Laba babeyinzalo kaJerameli.
013	1CH	002	034	USheshani wayengelawo amadodana, wayelamadodakazi wodwa. Wayelesisebenzi saseGibhithe esasithiwa nguJariha.
013	1CH	002	035	USheshani wendisela isisebenzi sakhe lesi esinguJariha, indodakazi yakhe eyamzalela u-Athayi.
013	1CH	002	036	U-Athayi wayenguyise kaNathani, uNathani enguyise kaZabhadi,
013	1CH	002	037	uZabhadi enguyise ka-Efilali, u-Efilali enguyise ka-Obhedi,
013	1CH	002	038	u-Obhedi enguyise kaJehu, uJehu enguyise ka-Azariya,
013	1CH	002	039	u-Azariya enguyise kaHelezi, uHelezi enguyise ka-Eleyasa,
013	1CH	002	040	u-Eleyasa enguyise kaSisimayi, uSisimayi enguyise kaShalumi,
013	1CH	002	041	uShalumi enguyise kaJekhamiya, uJekhamiya enguyise ka-Elishama.
013	1CH	002	042	Amadodana kaKhalebi umfowabo kaJerameli yila: uMesha izibulo lakhe, onguyise kaZifi, lendodana yakhe uMaresha, uyise kaHebhroni.
013	1CH	002	043	Amadodana kaHebhroni yila: nguKhora, loThaphuwa, loRekhemu loShema.
013	1CH	002	044	UShema wayenguyise kaRahama, uRahama yena enguyise kaJokheyama. URekhemu wayenguyise kaShamayi.
013	1CH	002	045	Indodana kaShamayi kunguMawoni, uMawoni wayenguyise kaBhethi Zuri.
013	1CH	002	046	Umfazi weceleni kaKhalebi u-Efa wayengunina kaHarani, loMoza kanye loGazezi. UHarani wayenguyise kaGazezi.
013	1CH	002	047	Amadodana kaJahidayi yila: nguRegemi, loJothamu, loGeshani, loPhelethi, lo-Efa kanye loShafi.
013	1CH	002	048	UMahakha umfazi weceleni kaKhalebi wayengunina kaShebheri loThirihana.
013	1CH	002	049	Nguye njalo owazala uShafi uyise kaMadimana kanye loSheva uyise kaMakhibhena loGibhiya. Indodakazi kaKhalebi kwakungu-Akhisa.
013	1CH	002	050	Yibo laba abenzalo kaKhalebi. Amadodana kaHuri izibulo lika-Efrathi yila: nguShobhali uyise kaKhiriyathi-Jeyarimi,
013	1CH	002	051	loSalima uyise kaBhethilehema, loHarefi uyise kaBhethi-Gaderi.
013	1CH	002	052	Inzalo kaShobhali uyise kaKhiriyathi-Jeyarimi yile: nguHaro, ingxenye yamaManahathi,
013	1CH	002	053	labosendo lukaKhiriyathi-Jeyarimi kungama-Ithira lamaPhuthi lamaShumathi lamaMishirayi. Kulapho okwakudabuka khona amaZorathi lama-Eshithawoli.
013	1CH	002	054	Abenzalo kaSalima yilaba: nguBhethilehema, umNethofa, u-Athirothi-Bhethi-Jowabi, ingxenye yamaManahathi, amaZori,
013	1CH	002	055	losendo lwabalobi ababehlala eJabhezi: AmaThirathi lamaShimeya lamaSukhathi. Laba babengamaKheni beyinzalo kaHamathi ukhokho wamaRekhabi.
013	1CH	003	001	Nanka amadodana kaDavida awazala eHebhroni: Izibulo lakhe lalingu-Amnoni indodana ka-Ahinowama owaseJezerili; owesibili, uDanyeli indodana ka-Abhigeli waseKhameli;
013	1CH	003	002	owesithathu, ngu-Abhisalomu indodana kaMahakha indodakazi kaThalimayi inkosi yaseGeshuri; owesine, u-Adonija indodana kaHagithi;
013	1CH	003	003	owesihlanu, uShefathiya indodana ka-Abhithali; owesithupha, u-Ithireyamu amzuza ku-Egila, umkakhe.
013	1CH	003	004	Abayisithupha laba uDavida wabazalela eHebhroni, lapho abusa khona okweminyaka eyisikhombisa lezinyanga eziyisithupha. UDavida wabusa eJerusalema okweminyaka engamatshumi amathathu lemithathu,
013	1CH	003	005	njalo la yiwo amadodana awazalela khona: uShamuwa, uShobabi, uNathani loSolomoni. Amadodana amane la wawazala loBhathishebha indodakazi ka-Amiyeli.
013	1CH	003	006	Njalo kwaba lo-Ibhari, u-Elishama, u-Elifelethi,
013	1CH	003	007	uNoga, uNefegi, uJafiya,
013	1CH	003	008	u-Elishama, u-Eliyada kanye lo-Elifelethi, beyisificamunwemunye bonke.
013	1CH	003	009	Bonke laba babengamadodana kaDavida, ngaphandle kwamadodana akhe awazala labafazi bakhe beceleni. Udadewabo wamadodana la wayenguThamari.
013	1CH	003	010	Indodana kaSolomoni kwakunguRehobhowami, indodana yakhe kungu-Abhija, indodana yakhe kungu-Asa, indodana yakhe kunguJehoshafathi,
013	1CH	003	011	indodana yakhe kunguJehoramu, indodana yakhe kungu-Ahaziya, indodana yakhe kunguJowashi,
013	1CH	003	012	indodana yakhe kungu-Amaziya, indodana yakhe kungu-Azariya, indodana yakhe kunguJothamu,
013	1CH	003	013	indodana yakhe kungu-Ahazi, indodana yakhe kunguHezekhiya, indodana yakhe kunguManase,
013	1CH	003	014	indodana yakhe kungu-Amoni, indodana yakhe kunguJosiya.
013	1CH	003	015	Amadodana kaJosiya yila: nguJohanani izibulo, uJehoyakhimi indodana yesibili, uZedekhiya eyesithathu, uShalumi eyesine.
013	1CH	003	016	Abasala behlala esikhundleni sikaJehoyakhimi yilaba: nguJekhoniya indodana yakhe loZedekhiya.
013	1CH	003	017	Abosendo lukaJekhoniya owayethunjiwe yilaba: uSheyalithiyeli indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	003	018	uMalikhiramu, loPhedaya, loShenazari, loJekhamiya, loHoshama, kanye loNedabhiya.
013	1CH	003	019	Amadodana kaPhedaya yila: nguZerubhabheli loShimeyi. Amadodana kaZerubhabheli yila: nguMeshulami loHananiya. UShelomithi engudadewabo.
013	1CH	003	020	Babekhona njalo abanye abahlanu: uHashubha, u-Oheli, uBherekhiya, uHasadiya, loJushabi-Hesedi.
013	1CH	003	021	Abosendo lukaHananiya yilaba: nguPhelathiya loJeshaya, kanye lamadodana kaRefaya, ka-Anani, ka-Obhadaya kanye lokaShekhaniya.
013	1CH	003	022	Abosendo lukaShekhaniya yilaba: nguShemaya lamadodana akhe: uHathushi, lo-Igali, loBhariya, loNeyariya kanye loShafathi, beyisithupha.
013	1CH	003	023	Amadodana kaNeyariya yila: ngu-Eliyonayi, loHezekhiya, lo-Azirikhamu, bebathathu.
013	1CH	003	024	Amadodana ka-Eliyonayi yila: nguHodaviya, lo-Eliyashibi, loPhelaya, lo-Akhubi, loJohanani, loDelaya kanye lo-Anani, beyisikhombisa.
013	1CH	004	001	Abosendo lukaJuda kuyilaba: NguPherezi, loHezironi, loKhami, loHuri loShobhali.
013	1CH	004	002	UReyaya indodana kaShobhali wayenguyise kaJahathi, uJahathi onguyise ka-Ahumayi kanye loLahadi. Laba babengabosendo lwamaZorathi.
013	1CH	004	003	La ayengamadodana ka-Ethamu: uJezerili, lo-Ishima kanye lo-Idibhashi. Udadewabo kwakuthiwa nguHazeleliphoni.
013	1CH	004	004	UPhenuweli wayenguyise kaGedori, lo-Ezeri uyise kaHusha. Laba kungabosendo lukaHuri, izibulo lika-Efrathi uyise kaBhethilehema.
013	1CH	004	005	U-Ashuri uyise kaThekhowa wayelabafazi ababili, uHela loNara.
013	1CH	004	006	UNahara wamzalela u-Ahuzami, loHeferi, loThemeni kanye loHahashithari. Laba kwakungabosendo lukaNara.
013	1CH	004	007	Amadodana kaHela yila: nguZerethi, loZohari, lo-Ethinani,
013	1CH	004	008	loKhozi owayenguyise ka-Anubi loHazobhebha kanye labosendo luka-Ahareheli indodana kaHarumi.
013	1CH	004	009	UJabhezi wayelodumo kulabafowabo. Unina wayemuphe lelibizo lokuthi Jabhezi, ngoba esithi “Ngamzala kabuhlungu.”
013	1CH	004	010	UJabhezi wakhuleka kuNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli wathi: “Sengathi ungangibusisa uqhelise ilizwe lami! Isandla sakho kasibe lami, ungivikele ebubini, ngingehlelwa yibuhlungu.” UNkulunkulu wamnika lokho ayekucela.
013	1CH	004	011	UKhelubi, umfowabo kaShuha, wayenguyise kaMehiri, owayenguyise ka-Eshithoni.
013	1CH	004	012	U-Eshithoni wayenguyise kaBhethi-Rafa, loPhaseya kanye loThehina uyise ka-Iri Nahashi. Laba babengabantu bakaRekha.
013	1CH	004	013	Amadodana kaKhenazi yila: ngu-Othiniyeli loSeraya. Amadodana ka-Othiniyeli yila: nguHathathi loMeyonothayi.
013	1CH	004	014	UMeyonathayi wayenguyise ka-Ofira. USeraya wayenguyise kaJowabi, owayengukhokho wesizwe samaGe-Harashimi. Babizwa ngalelibizo ngoba babezingcitshi.
013	1CH	004	015	Amadodana kaKhalebi indodana kaJefune yila: ngu-Iru, lo-Ela kanye loNamu. Indodana ka-Ela yile: nguKhenazi.
013	1CH	004	016	Amadodana kaJehaleleli yila: nguZifi, loZifa, loThiriya kanye lo-Asareli.
013	1CH	004	017	Amadodana ka-Ezra yila: nguJetha, loMeredi, lo-Eferi kanye loJaloni. Omunye wabafazi bakaMeredi wazala uMiriyemu, loShamayi kanye lo-Ishibha uyise ka-Eshithemowa.
013	1CH	004	018	Laba kwakungabantwana bakaBhithiya indodakazi kaFaro, eyayendele kuMeredi. Umkakhe ongumJudakazi wamzalela uJeredi uyise kaGedori, uHebheri uyise kaSokho, loJekuthiweli uyise kaZanowa.
013	1CH	004	019	Amadodana omkaHodiya, udadewabo kaNahama, uyise kaKheyila owaseGami, lo-Eshithemowa waseMahakhathi.
013	1CH	004	020	Amadodana kaShimoni yila: ngu-Amnoni, loRina, loBheni-Hanani kanye loThiloni. Abosendo luka-Ishi yilaba: nguZohethi loBheni-Zohethi.
013	1CH	004	021	Amadodana kaShela indodana kaJuda yila: ngu-Eri uyise kaLekha, loLada uyise kaMaresha labantwana babeluki bamalembu amahle eBhethi-Ashibheya.
013	1CH	004	022	UJokhimu, lamadoda aseKhozeba, uJowashi loSarafi, owabusa amaMowabi loJashubi Lehemu. (Lokhu kutholakala emibhalweni yasendulo).
013	1CH	004	023	Laba kwakungababumbi ababehlala eNethayimi leGedera; behlala khona besebenzela inkosi.
013	1CH	004	024	Abosendo lukaSimiyoni yilaba: nguNemuweli, loJamini, loJaribhi, loZera kanye loShawuli;
013	1CH	004	025	uShalumi wayeyindodana kaShawuli, uMibhisamu indodana yakhe loMishima indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	004	026	Abosendo lukaMishima yilaba: nguHamuweli indodana yakhe, loZakhuri indodana yakhe loShimeyi indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	004	027	UShimeyi wayelamadodana alitshumi lesithupha lamadodakazi ayisithupha, kodwa abafowabo babengelabantwana abanengi, ngakho usendo lwabo lonke aluzanga lwande njengabantu bakaJuda.
013	1CH	004	028	Babehlala eBherishebha, eMolada, eHazari-Shuwali,
013	1CH	004	029	eBhiliha, e-Ezema, eTholadi,
013	1CH	004	030	eBhethuweli, eHoma, eZikhilagi,
013	1CH	004	031	eBhethi-Makhabhothi, eHazari Susimi, eBhethi-Bhiri laseShaharayimu. Yiyo eyayiyimizi yabo kwaze kwabusa uDavida.
013	1CH	004	032	Imizana eyayilapho kwakuyi-Ethamu, i-Ayini, iRimoni, iThokheni le-Ashani, imizi emihlanu
013	1CH	004	033	layo yonke imizana eyayiseduzane lalimizi kuze kuyefika eBhalathi. Lezi yizo izindawo abahlaliswa khona. Bagcina imibhalo yosendo lwabo.
013	1CH	004	034	UMeshobabi loJamuleki, loJosha indodana ka-Amaziya
013	1CH	004	035	loJoweli, loJehu indodana kaJoshibhiya, indodana kaSeraya, indodana ka-Asiyeli
013	1CH	004	036	kanye lo-Eliyonayi, loJakhobha, loJeshohaya, lo-Asaya, lo-Adiyeli, loJesimiyeli, loBhenaya,
013	1CH	004	037	kanye loZiza indodana kaShifi, indodana ka-Aloni, indodana kaJedaya, indodana kaShimiri, indodana kaShemaya.
013	1CH	004	038	Amadoda aqanjiweyo ngamabizo ngaphezulu ayengabakhokheli bosendo lwakwabo. Izimuli zabo zanda kakhulu,
013	1CH	004	039	zaqhela zayakwakha langaphandle kweGedori okuya ngempumalanga yesihotsha bedinga amadlelo emihlambi yabo.
013	1CH	004	040	Bathola umhlaba ovundileyo olamadlelo amahle, obanzi ophilileyo njalo uthule. Kwakuke kwahlala amanye amaHamu khonapho.
013	1CH	004	041	Amadoda alamabizo abhaliweyo afika ngezinsuku zikaHezekhiya inkosi yakoJuda. Bahlasela amaHamu emizini yawo kanye lamaMewuni ayelapho bawabhuqa du, njengoba kubonakala lalamuhla. Basebezihlalela besakha khonapho, ngoba kwakulamadlelo emihlambi yabo.
013	1CH	004	042	Abangamakhulu amahlanu alaba abakaSimiyoni, bekhokhelwa nguPhelathiya, uNeyariya loRefaya lo-Uziyeli amadodana ka-Ishi, bahlasela ilizwe lamaqaqa laseSeyiri.
013	1CH	004	043	Babulala ama-Amaleki ayephunyukile asala, njalo sebehlale kulindawo kuze kube lamuhla.
013	1CH	005	001	Amadodana kaRubheni izibulo lika-Israyeli (wayelizibulo, kodwa kwathi esengcolise umbheda kayise owomtshado, amalungelo akhe njengezibulo aphiwa amadodana kaJosefa indodana ka-Israyeli, ngakho kasalotshwanga emibhalweni yosendo njengelungelo lokuzalwa kwakhe,
013	1CH	005	002	lanxa uJuda wayelamandla amakhulu kulabo bonke abafowabo njalo enguye owazala umbusi, ilungelo lobuzibulo laya kuJosefa).
013	1CH	005	003	Amadodana kaRubheni izibulo lika-Israyeli ayeyila: nguHanokhi, loPhalu, loHezironi kanye loKhami.
013	1CH	005	004	Abenzalo kaJoweli yilaba: nguShemaya indodana yakhe, loGogi indodana yakhe, loShimeyi indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	005	005	loMikha indodana yakhe, loReyaya indodana yakhe, loBhali indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	005	006	kanye loBhera indodana yakhe, lowo uThigilathi-Philesa inkosi yase-Asiriya eyamthumba yamusa ezizweni. UBhera wayengumkhokheli wabakoRubheni.
013	1CH	005	007	Izihlobo zabo ngosendo lwabo, njengokulotshwe emibhalweni yosendo yilezi: nguJeyiyeli induna, loZakhariya, kanye
013	1CH	005	008	loBhela indodana ka-Azazi, indodana kaShema, indodana kaJoweli. Bakha bahlala emangweni osuka e-Aroweri kusiya eNebho laseBhali-Meyoni.
013	1CH	005	009	Empumalanga babehlezi emangweni ofika emaphethelweni enkangala etshaya khonale eMfuleni uYufrathe, ngoba izifuyo zabo zasezandile eGiliyadi.
013	1CH	005	010	Ngezinsuku zokubusa kukaSawuli balwa impi lamaHagari; bawanqoba basebehlala emizaneni yawo emangweni wonke ongempumalanga yeGiliyadi.
013	1CH	005	011	AbakaGadi babehlala phansi kwabo eBhashani, kuze kuyefika eSalekha:
013	1CH	005	012	UJoweli wayeyinduna, uShafamu emlandela, besekusiza uJanayi loShafathi, ngaseBhashani.
013	1CH	005	013	Izihlobo zabo, ngokuzalana kwabo, yilezi: nguMikhayeli, loMeshulami, loShebha, loJorayi, loJakhani, loZiya kanye lo-Ebha, beyisikhombisa sebendawonye.
013	1CH	005	014	Laba babengamadodana ka-Abhihayili indodana kaHuri, indodana kaJarowa, indodana kaGiliyadi, indodana kaMikhayeli, indodana kaJeshishayi, indodana kaJahido, indodana kaBhuzi.
013	1CH	005	015	U-Ahi indodana ka-Abhidiyeli, indodana kaGuni, wayeyinhloko yemuli yakwabo.
013	1CH	005	016	AbakaGadi babehlala eGiliyadi, eBhashani lemizaneni yakhona, kanye lasemadlelweni aseSharoni kuze kuyefika emaphethelweni awo.
013	1CH	005	017	Bonke laba balotshwa emibhalweni yosendo ngezinsuku zokubusa kukaJothamu inkosi yakoJuda loJerobhowamu inkosi yako-Israyeli.
013	1CH	005	018	AbakoRubheni, labakoGadi lengxenye yesizwana sakoManase babelamadoda ayeselungele ukubuthwa azinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amane lane lamakhulu ayisikhombisa lamatshumi ayisithupha amadoda ayeseqwahele esenelisa ukuphatha ihawu ahlome ngenkemba, atshoke ngemitshoko, ayesevele afundela ukulwa empini.
013	1CH	005	019	Bahlasela uHagari loJethuri loNafishi loNodabi.
013	1CH	005	020	Bahlonyulelwa ekulweni kwabo labo, njalo uNkulunkulu wanikela uHagari labanye bakhe ezandleni zabo, ngoba bakhuleka kuNkulunkulu empini. Wayiphendula imikhuleko yabo, ngoba bamethemba.
013	1CH	005	021	Bathumba izifuyo zakoHagiri ezibalisa amakamela azinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amahlanu, izimvu eziyizinkulungwane ezingamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amahlanu labobabhemi abazinkulungwane ezimbili. Bathumba njalo abantu abazinkulungwane ezilikhulu,
013	1CH	005	022	abanye abanengi babulawa, ngoba le kwakuyimpi kaNkulunkulu. Bona bahlala kulelolizwe kwaze kwaba yisikhathi bethunjwa.
013	1CH	005	023	Abantu ababeyingxenye yesizwana sikaManase babebanengi; bahlala elizweni kusukela eBhashani kusiya eBhali-Hemoni, kusitsho iSeniri (iNtaba yaseHemoni).
013	1CH	005	024	Laba yibo ababezinhloko zezimuli: u-Eferi, lo-Ishi, lo-Eliyeli, lo-Aziriyeli, loJeremiya, loHodaviya, kanye loJahidiyeli. Babengamadoda empi alezibindi, amadoda adumileyo, njalo bezinhloko zezimuli zabo.
013	1CH	005	025	Kodwa bona babengathembekanga kuNkulunkulu waboyise basebekhonza onkulunkulu bezizwe uNkulunkulu wabo ababhubhisa kulawomazwe bengakahlali khona.
013	1CH	005	026	Ngakho uNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli wadunga umoya kaPhuli inkosi yase-Asiriya (okuyikuthi, Thigilathi-Philesa inkosi yase-Asiriya), owathumba abakoRubheni, labakoGadi kanye lengxenye yesizwana sikaManase. Wabathatha wabasa eHala, leHabhori, leHara lasemfuleni uGozani, lapho abakhona lalamuhla.
013	1CH	006	001	Amadodana kaLevi yila: nguGeshoni, loKhohathi, kanye loMerari.
013	1CH	006	002	Amadodana kaKhohathi yila: ngu-Amramu, lo-Izihari, loHebhroni kanye lo-Uziyeli.
013	1CH	006	003	Abantwana baka-Amramu yilaba: ngu-Aroni, loMosi kanye loMiriyemu. Amadodana ka-Aroni yila: nguNadabi, lo-Abhihu lo-Eliyazari lo-Ithamari.
013	1CH	006	004	U-Eliyazari wayenguyise kaFinehasi, uFinehasi enguyise ka-Abhishuwa,
013	1CH	006	005	u-Abhishuwa enguyise kaBhukhi, uBhukhi enguyise ka-Uzi,
013	1CH	006	006	u-Uzi enguyise kaZerahiya, uZerahiya enguyise kaMerayothi,
013	1CH	006	007	uMerayothi enguyise ka-Amariya, u-Amariya enguyise ka-Ahithubi,
013	1CH	006	008	u-Ahithubi enguyise kaZadokhi, uZadokhi enguyise ka-Ahimazi,
013	1CH	006	009	u-Ahimazi enguyise ka-Azariya, u-Azariya enguyise kaJohanani,
013	1CH	006	010	uJohanani enguyise ka-Azariya; nguye lo owayengumphristi ethempelini elakhiwa nguSolomoni eJerusalema.
013	1CH	006	011	U-Azariya enguyise ka-Amariya, u-Amariya enguyise ka-Ahithubi,
013	1CH	006	012	u-Ahithubi enguyise kaZadokhi, uZadokhi enguyise kaShalumi,
013	1CH	006	013	uShalumi enguyise kaHilikhiya, uHilikhiya enguyise ka-Azariya,
013	1CH	006	014	u-Azariya enguyise kaSeraya, uSeraya enguyise kaJozadaki.
013	1CH	006	015	UJozadaki wathunjwa lapho uThixo athumba abakoJuda labaseJerusalema ngesandla sikaNebhukhadineza.
013	1CH	006	016	Amadodana kaLevi yila: nguGeshoni, loKhohathi kanye loMerari.
013	1CH	006	017	Nanka amabizo amadodana kaGeshoni: nguLibhini loShimeyi.
013	1CH	006	018	Amadodana kaKhohathi yila: ngu-Amramu, lo-Izihari, loHebhroni kanye lo-Uziyeli.
013	1CH	006	019	Amadodana kaMerari yila: nguMahili loMushi. Laba babelusendo lwabaLevi behlelwe ngoluhlu lwaboyise:
013	1CH	006	020	AbakaGeshoni yilaba: nguLibhini indodana yakhe, loJahathi indodana yakhe, loZima indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	021	loJowa indodana yakhe, lo-Ido indodana yakhe, loZera indodana yakhe kanye loJeyatherayi indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	006	022	Abosendo lukaKhohathi yilaba: ngu-Aminadabi indodana yakhe, loKhora indodana yakhe, lo-Asiri indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	023	lo-Elikhana lo-Ebhiyasafi indodana yakhe lo-Asiri indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	024	loThahathi indodana yakhe, lo-Uriyeli indodana yakhe, lo-Uziya indodana yakhe kanye loShawuli indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	006	025	Abosendo luka-Elikhana yilaba: ngu-Amasayi, lo-Ahimothi,
013	1CH	006	026	lo-Elikhana indodana yakhe, loZofayi indodana yakhe, loNahathi indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	027	lo-Eliyabi indodana yakhe, loJerohamu indodana yakhe, lo-Elikhana indodana yakhe kanye loSamuyeli indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	006	028	Amadodana kaSamuyeli ayeyila: uVashini izibulo lo-Abhija indodana yesibili.
013	1CH	006	029	Abosendo lukaMerari yilaba: nguMahili, loLibhini indodana yakhe, loShimeyi indodana yakhe, lo-Uza indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	030	loShimeya indodana yakhe, loHagiya indodana yakhe kanye lo-Asaya indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	006	031	Laba yibo abakhethwa nguDavida ukuphatha ukuhlabelela endlini kaThixo ngemva kokubekwa kwebhokisi lesivumelwano khona.
013	1CH	006	032	Bakhonza ngokuhlabelela phambi kwebhokisi lesivumelwano, iThente lokuHlanganela, uSolomoni waze wakha ithempeli likaThixo eJerusalema. Benza inkonzo yabo ngendlela okwakuqoqwe ngayo.
013	1CH	006	033	Bona ababekhethelwe lowomsebenzi kanye lamadodana abo yilaba: Kwabendlu kaKhohathi yilaba: nguHemani umhlabeleli, indodana kaJoweli, indodana kaSamuyeli
013	1CH	006	034	indodana ka-Elikhana, indodana kaJerohamu, indodana ka-Eliyeli, indodana kaThowa,
013	1CH	006	035	indodana kaZufi, indodana ka-Elikhana, indodana kaMahathi, indodana ka-Amasayi,
013	1CH	006	036	indodana ka-Elikhana, indodana kaJoweli, indodana ka-Azariya, indodana kaZefaniya
013	1CH	006	037	indodana kaThahathi, indodana ka-Asiri, indodana ka-Ebhiyasafi, indodana kaKhora,
013	1CH	006	038	indodana ka-Izihari, indodana kaKhohathi, indodana kaLevi, indodana ka-Israyeli.
013	1CH	006	039	U-Asafi umkhula kaHemani owasebenza laye ngasesandleni sakhe sokudla: U-Asafi indodana kaBherekhiya, indodana kaShimeya,
013	1CH	006	040	indodana kaMikhayeli, indodana kaBhaseya, indodana kaMalikhija,
013	1CH	006	041	indodana ka-Ethini, indodana kaZera, indodana ka-Adaya,
013	1CH	006	042	indodana ka-Ethani, indodana kaZima, indodana kaShimeyi,
013	1CH	006	043	indodana kaJahathi, indodana kaGeshoni, indodana kaLevi;
013	1CH	006	044	kanti njalo kubakhula babo amaMerari kwesenxele isandla sakhe yilaba: ngu-Ethani indodana kaKhishi, indodana ka-Abhidi, indodana kaMaluki,
013	1CH	006	045	indodana kaHashabhiya, indodana ka-Amaziya, indodana kaHilikhiya,
013	1CH	006	046	indodana ka-Amizi, indodana kaBhani, indodana kaShemeri,
013	1CH	006	047	indodana kaMahili, indodana kaMushi, indodana kaMerari, indodana kaLevi.
013	1CH	006	048	Abafowabo kubaLevi babephiwe yonke eminye imisebenzi ethabanikeleni, endlini kaNkulunkulu.
013	1CH	006	049	Kodwa u-Aroni labosendo lwakhe yibo ababesethula iminikelo yokutshiswa e-alithareni kanye lase-alithareni lempepha lakho konke okwakusenziwa eNdaweni eNgcwele kakhulu, becelela u-Israyeli umusa, njengalokhu uMosi inceku kaNkulunkulu yayitshilo.
013	1CH	006	050	Laba ngabosendo luka-Aroni: ngu-Eliyazari indodana yakhe, loFinehasi indodana yakhe, lo-Abhishuwa indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	051	loBhukhi indodana yakhe, lo-Uzi indodana yakhe, loZerahiya indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	052	loMerayothi indodana yakhe, lo-Amariya indodana yakhe, lo-Ahithubi indodana yakhe,
013	1CH	006	053	loZadokhi indodana yakhe kanye lo-Ahimazi indodana yakhe.
013	1CH	006	054	Imizi ababehlezi kiyo kuselizweni ababeliphiwe (yimizi eyayiphiwe abosendo luka-Aroni beyinzalo kaKhohathi, ngoba isabelo sakuqala sasingesabo) yile:
013	1CH	006	055	Babephiwe iHebhroni koJuda lamadlelo akhona.
013	1CH	006	056	Kodwa amasimu lemizana eyayiseduzane ledolobho kwaphiwa uKhalebi indodana kaJefune.
013	1CH	006	057	Ngakho abosendo luka-Aroni baphiwa iHebhroni (umuzi wokuphephela), leLibhina, leJathiri, le-Eshithemowa,
013	1CH	006	058	leHileni, leDebhiri,
013	1CH	006	059	le-Ashani, leJuta leBhethi-Shemeshi, ndawonye lamadlelo akhona.
013	1CH	006	060	Esizwaneni sikaBhenjamini baphiwa iGibhiyoni, leGebha, le-Alemethi le-Anathothi, kanye lamadlelo akhona. Imizi eyaphiwa amaKhohathi yayilitshumi lantathu.
013	1CH	006	061	Abaseleyo bamaKhohathi baphiwa imizi elitshumi beyingxenye yendlu yesizwana sikaManase.
013	1CH	006	062	Abosendo lukaGeshoni, indlu ngendlu, baphiwa imizi elitshumi lemithathu ezizwaneni zako-Isakhari, ko-Asheri lakoNafithali, kanye lengxenye yesizwana sikaManase esiseBhashani.
013	1CH	006	063	Abosendo lukaMerari, indlu ngendlu, baphiwa imizi elitshumi lambili esizwaneni sikaRubheni, lesikaGadi lesikaZebhuluni.
013	1CH	006	064	Ngakho yiyo imizi lamadlelo ayo eyaphiwa abaLevi ngama-Israyeli.
013	1CH	006	065	Esizwaneni sakoJuda, lesakoSimiyoni loBhenjamini baphiwa imizi esike yaqanjwa.
013	1CH	006	066	Amanye amaKhohathi aphiwa imizi elizweni lesizwana sika-Efrayimi.
