013	1CH	006	071	AmaGeshoni azuza lezindawo: Kwabosendo lwengxenye yesizwana sikaManase bazuza iGolani eBhashani kanye le-Ashitharothi, ndawonye lamadlelo akhona;
013	1CH	006	072	esizwaneni sika-Isakhari bazuza iKhedeshi, leDabherathi,
