015	EZR	002	011	esikaBhebhayi sasingamakhulu ayisithupha lamatshumi amabili lantathu,
015	EZR	002	012	esika-Azigadi sasiyinkulungwane elamakhulu amabili lamatshumi amabili lambili,
015	EZR	002	013	esika-Adonikhamu sasingamakhulu ayisithupha lamatshumi ayisithupha lasithupha,
015	EZR	002	014	esikaBhigivayi sasizinkulungwane ezimbili lamatshumi amahlanu lasithupha,
015	EZR	002	015	esika-Adini sasingamakhulu amane lamatshumi amahlanu lane,
