015	EZR	002	036	Abaphristi: esizukulwaneni sikaJedaya (ngosendo lukaJeshuwa) babengamakhulu ayisificamunwemunye lamatshumi ayisikhombisa lantathu,
015	EZR	002	037	kwesika-Imeri babeyinkulungwane lamatshumi amahlanu lambili,
