017	EST	009	028	Amalanga la kumele akhunjulwe njalo alandelwe kuzozonke izizukulwane zezimuli zonke, ezifundeni zonke lemadolobheni wonke. Akumelanga amalanga ePhurimi la ayekelwe ukuthakazelelwa ngamaJuda, loba ukuthi isikhumbuzo sawo sikhohlakale kumbe sitshabalale kuzizukulwane zawo.
017	EST	009	029	Ngakho, iNdlovukazi u-Esta, indodakazi ka-Abhihayili, kanye loModekhayi umJuda, babhala ngegunya langamandla amakhulu beqinisekisa incwadi yesibili eyayimayelana lePhurimi.
017	EST	009	030	UModekhayi wathumela izincwadi kubo bonke abangamaJuda ezifundeni ezilikhulu elilamatshumi amabili lesikhombisa embusweni ka-Ahasuweru, amazwi okubafisela ukuthula lokubaqinisa,
017	EST	009	031	ukuba lezinsuku zePhurimi ngezikhathi ezazimisiwe, njengokumemezela kukaModekhayi umJuda leNdlovukazi u-Esta, lanjengalokhu ababeziqalisele khona kanye lezizukulwane zabo mayelana lezikhathi zokuzila lokulila.
017	EST	009	032	Isimemezelo sika-Esta saqinisa imithetho le emayelana lePhurimi, kwalotshwa phansi emibhalweni.
017	EST	010	001	Inkosi u-Ahasuweru wenza isinqumo sokuthelisa abantu kuwo wonke umbuso lasemikhunjini ekhatshana.
017	EST	010	002	Zonke izenzo zamandla akhe amakhulu, kanye lemibhalo elandisa ngobukhulu bukaModekhayi inkosi eyayimphakamise ngabo, akulotshwanga na egwalweni lwemiLando yamakhosi aseMediya lasePhezhiya?
017	EST	010	003	UModekhayi umJuda wayelandela inkosi u-Ahasuweru esikhundleni embusweni, engumhlonitshwa omkhulu phakathi kwamaJuda, njalo eqakathekiswa ngabanengi kubaJuda bakibo, ngoba wayesebenzela ukuphila kuhle kwabantu bakibo njalo wayemela inhlalakahle yawo wonke amaJuda.
#
# BOOK	018	JOB	Job	UJobe
018	JOB	001	001	Elizweni lase-Uzi kwakuhlala indoda eyayithiwa nguJobe. Indoda le yayingelasici, iqotho; yayimesaba uNkulunkulu njalo ikuxwaya okubi.
018	JOB	001	002	Yayilamadodana ayisikhombisa lamadodakazi amathathu,
018	JOB	001	003	ilezimvu eziyizinkulungwane eziyisikhombisa, amakamela azinkulungwane ezintathu, izipani zenkabi ezingamakhulu amahlanu labobabhemi abangamakhulu amahlanu, njalo ilezisebenzi ezinengi. Yayinothile kulabo bonke abantu beMpumalanga.
018	JOB	001	004	Amadodana akhe ayesenza amazopha okwenza amadili okuthakazelela amalanga okuzalwa kwawo ezindlini zawo, anxuse odadewabo bobathathu ukuzakudla anathe labo.
018	JOB	001	005	Kwakusithi mhla idili liphela, uJobe wayewabiza azowahlambulula. Ekuseni kakhulu wayesenza umnikelo wokutshiswa wamunye ngamunye esithi, “Mhlawumbe abantwabami benzile isono bathuka uNkulunkulu ezinhliziyweni zabo.” Lo waba ngumkhuba wakhe uJobe.
018	JOB	001	006	Ngelinye ilanga izingilosi zeza ukuzezethula phambi kukaThixo, loSathane weza lazo.
018	JOB	001	007	UThixo wathi kuSathane, “Uvela ngaphi?” USathane wamphendula uThixo wathi, “Ngivela ekuzulazuleni emhlabeni, ngihambahamba ngisiya le lale.”
018	JOB	001	008	UThixo wasesithi kuSathane, “Usuke wayinanzelela yini inceku yami uJobe? Kakho emhlabeni onjengaye; kalasici, uqondile, indoda emesabayo uNkulunkulu, exwaya okubi.”
018	JOB	001	009	USathane waphendula wathi, “Kambe uJobe umesaba kungelasizatho na uNkulunkulu?
018	JOB	001	010	Kawumbiyelanga ngothango yini yena lendlu yakhe, kanye lakho konke alakho? Uwubusisile umsebenzi wezandla zakhe kuze kuthi imihlambi yakhe yezimvu leyenkomo igcwale ilizwe lonke.
018	JOB	001	011	Kodwa ake welule isandla sakho uchithe konke alakho, uzabona uzakuthuka ebusweni bakho.”
018	JOB	001	012	UThixo wathi kuSathane, “Kulungile, konke alakho kusezandleni zakho, kodwa yena ngokwakhe ungamthinti.” USathane wasesuka phambi kukaThixo.
018	JOB	001	013	Ngelinye ilanga amadodana kaJobe lamadodakazi akhe ayezitika ngokudla, enatha iwayini endlini yomnewabo omdala,
018	JOB	001	014	isithunywa safika kuJobe sathi, “Inkabi bezilima labobabhemi besidla eduze khonapho,
018	JOB	001	015	kwafika amaSabhini ahlasela aqhuba konke ahamba. Izisebenzi azicakazile ngenkemba kwasala mina ngedwa engisindileyo ukuzakubikela!”
018	JOB	001	016	Sisakhuluma esinye isithunywa safika sathi, “Umlilo kaNkulunkulu wehle uvela ezulwini wazitshisa izimvu lezisebenzi, kusele mina ngedwa engisindileyo ukuzakubikela!”
018	JOB	001	017	Elokhu esakhuluma kwafika esinye isithunywa sathi, “AmaKhaladiya abe ngamaqembu amathathu ehlela emakameleni akho awaqhuba ahamba lawo. Izisebenzi azicakazile ngenkemba kwasila mina ngedwa ukuzakubikela!”
018	JOB	001	018	Elokhu esakhuluma kwafika njalo esinye isithunywa sathi, “Amadodana lamadodakazi akho abesidla edilini enatha iwayini endlini yomnewabo omdala,
018	JOB	001	019	kwathi masinyane vungu isavunguzane siqhamuka enkangala saphekula amagumbi womane endlu. Yathi mbo phezu kwabo bahle bafa, kwasila mina ngedwa ukuzakubikela!”
018	JOB	001	020	Ekuzwa lokho uJobe wasukuma wadabula isembatho sakhe, waphuca ikhanda lakhe. Wazilahla phansi wakhonza
018	JOB	001	021	wathi: “Ngaphuma ngize esiswini sikamama, njalo ngizasuka ngize. UThixo wapha njalo usethethe; kalidunyiswe ibizo likaThixo.”
018	JOB	001	022	Phakathi kwakho konke lokhu uJobe kazange enze isono ngokubeka umlandu wokuthi athi uNkulunkulu wonile.
018	JOB	002	001	Kwelinye ilanga njalo izingilosi zeza phambi kukaThixo, loSathane laye weza lazo ukuzezethula kuye.
018	JOB	002	002	UThixo wasesithi kuSathane, “Uvela ngaphi?” USathane wamphendula wathi, “Ngivela ekuzulazuleni emhlabeni, ngihambahamba ngisiya le lale kuwo.”
018	JOB	002	003	UThixo wasesithi kuSathane, “Usuke wayinanzelela yini inceku yami uJobe? Kakho emhlabeni onjengaye; kalasici, uqondile, indoda emesabayo uNkulunkulu, exwaya okubi. Ulokhu emi kubo ubuqotho bakhe lanxa wangiphoqa ukuthi ngimdilize kungelasizatho.”
018	JOB	002	004	USathane waphendula wathi, “Isikhumba ngesikhumba! Umuntu anganikela loba yini alayo ukusiza impilo yakhe.
018	JOB	002	005	Kodwa yelula isandla sakho umtshaye inyama lamathambo akhe, uzabona uzakuthuka ebusweni bakho.”
018	JOB	002	006	UThixo wathi kuSathane, “Kulungile, usezandleni zakho, kodwa ungayithinti impilo yakhe.”
018	JOB	002	007	Ngakho uSathane wasesuka phambi kukaThixo wathela uJobe izilonda ezibuhlungu kusukela ngaphansi kwezinyawo zakhe kusiyafika esicholo sekhanda lakhe.
018	JOB	002	008	UJobe wasethatha ucezu lodengezi wazihwaya ngalo ehlezi esilotheni.
018	JOB	002	009	Umkakhe wathi kuye, “Ulokhu ubambelele kubo ubuqotho bakho na? Mthuke uNkulunkulu uzifele!”
018	JOB	002	010	Wamphendula wathi, “Ukhuluma njengomfazi oyisiwula. Sizakwamukela okuhle kuNkulunkulu singalwamukeli uhlupho na?” Kukho konke lokhu uJobe kenzanga isono ngakutshoyo.
018	JOB	002	011	Kwathi abangane bakaJobe abathathu, u-Elifazi umThemani, uBhilidadi umShuhi loZofari umNahama sebezwile ngazozonke inhlupho ezazimwele, basuka emakhaya abo bahlangana bavumelana ukuthi bahambe bayomqinisa njalo bamduduze.
018	JOB	002	012	Bathi bembona besesebucwala kabaze bamazi; baqhinqa isililo, badabula izembatho zabo, bathela uthuli emakhanda abo.
018	JOB	002	013	Basebehlala phansi laye okwensuku eziyisikhombisa lobusuku obuyisikhombisa. Kakho kubo owatsho ulutho kuye ngoba babona ubuhlungu obukhulu ayephakathi kwabo.
018	JOB	003	001	Ngemva kwalokho uJobe wavula umlomo wakhe waliqalekisa ilanga azalwa ngalo.
018	JOB	003	002	Wathi:
018	JOB	003	003	“Sengathi ilanga lokuzalwa kwami lingatshabalala, lalobobusuku okwathiwa, ‘Kuzelwe umfana!’
018	JOB	003	004	Lolosuku sengathi lungaphenduka ubumnyama; sengathi uNkulunkulu ophezulu angangalunanzi; lokukhanya kucime ngalo.
018	JOB	003	005	Sengathi ubumnyama lethunzi elikhulu kungaluginya njalo; sengathi iyezi lingalusibekela; sengathi umnyama ungalugubuzela.
018	JOB	003	006	Lobobusuku, sengathi ubumnyama bungabuthi jwamu; sengathi bungayekelwa ukubalwa kanye lezinsuku zomnyaka futhi bungangeniswa lakuyiphi inyanga.
018	JOB	003	007	Sengathi lobobusuku bungaba yinyumba; sengathi kungeze kwezwakala umsindo wentokozo ngalo.
018	JOB	003	008	Sengathi labo abaqalekisa insuku bangaluqalekisa lolosuku, labo abazimisele ukuhlokoza uLeviyathani.
018	JOB	003	009	Sengathi izinkanyezi zalo zokusa zingafiphala; lulindele imini kube yize lungayiboni imisebe yokuqala yokusa,
018	JOB	003	010	ngoba kaluyivalanga iminyango yesibeletho ngisiza ukufihla uhlupho emehlweni ami.
018	JOB	003	011	Kungani ngingafanga ngizalwa, ngahle ngacitsha ngisaphuma esiswini na?
018	JOB	003	012	Kungani kwaba lamadolo okungemukela lamabele okungimunyisa na?
018	JOB	003	013	Ngoba manje ngabe ngilele ekuthuleni; ngabe ngisebuthongweni ekuphumuleni
018	JOB	003	014	kanye lamakhosi lababusi bomhlaba, ababezakhele izindawo okwamanje sezingamanxiwa,
018	JOB	003	015	kanye lamakhosana ayelegolide, egcwalise izindlu zawo ngesiliva.
018	JOB	003	016	Kumbe kungani ngingathukuzwanga emhlabathini njengomphunzo na, njengosane oluvele lungazange lubone ukukhanya kosuku?
018	JOB	003	017	Khonale ababi kabasaxokozeli, njalo khonale abakhatheleyo basekuphumuleni.
018	JOB	003	018	Abathunjiweyo labo bazuza ukukhululeka; kabasakuzwa ukuhaladwa ngumtshayeli wabathunjiweyo.
018	JOB	003	019	Abantukazana lezikhulu bakhonale, lesigqili siyakhululwa enkosini yaso.
018	JOB	003	020	Kungani ukukhanya kuphiwa labo abasosizini na, lokuphila kulabo abalobuhlungu emphefumulweni,
018	JOB	003	021	kulabo abakhalela ukufa okungafikiyo, abakuthungathayo ukwedlula ingcebo efihliweyo,
018	JOB	003	022	abaphuphuma ngenjabulo bathokoza nxa sebefika engcwabeni?
018	JOB	003	023	Kungani impilo iphiwa umuntu ondlela yakhe ifihliwe, uNkulunkulu amhonqolozeleyo na?
018	JOB	003	024	Ngoba ukububula sokuphenduke ukudla kwami kwansukuzonke; ukugomela kwami kuthululeka njengamanzi.
018	JOB	003	025	Ebengikwesaba sekungehlele, obekungitshayisa ngovalo sekwenzakele kimi.
018	JOB	003	026	Kangilakho ukuchelesa, kangilakho ukuthula; kangilakuphumula, kodwa ukuhlupheka kuphela.”
018	JOB	004	001	Wasephendula u-Elifazi umThemani wathi:
018	JOB	004	002	“Nxa umuntu angaphosa ilizwi nje kuwe uzacunuka na? Kodwa ngubani ongathula angakhulumi na?
018	JOB	004	003	Khumbula ukuthi sewabafundisa njani abanengi, ukuthi ubaqinise njani abalezandla ezibuthakathaka.
018	JOB	004	004	Amazwi akho abasekele labo abakhubekayo; uwaqinisile amadolo axegayo.
018	JOB	004	005	Kodwa manje uhlupho luze kuwe, usuphela amandla; lukutshaya ubusudela ithemba.
018	JOB	004	006	Kungani ukukholwa kwakho kungabi yiso isibindi sakho na lezindlela zakho ezimsulwa zibe lithemba lakho na?
018	JOB	004	007	Khumbula manje: Ngubani owathi engelacala wabhubha na? Kungaphi lapho abaqotho abake babhujiswa khona na?
018	JOB	004	008	Ngokubona kwami labo abalima okubi lalabo abahlanyela ububi bavuna bona.
018	JOB	004	009	Ngokuphefumula kukaNkulunkulu bayabhubha; ngokukhwaza kolaka lwakhe bayafa.
018	JOB	004	010	Izilwane zingabhonga zihwabhe, kodwa amazinyo ezilwane ezinkulu ayephuka.
018	JOB	004	011	Isilwane siyafa ngokuswela ukudla besekuthi imidlwane yesilwanekazi ihlakazeke.
018	JOB	004	012	Kulethwe ilizwi kimi ngasese, indlebe zami zilizwile linyenyezwa.
018	JOB	004	013	Phakathi kwamaphupho adungayo ebusuku, lapho abantu belele obukabhuka,
018	JOB	004	014	ukwesaba lokuthuthumela kwangifikela kwenza wonke amathambo ami aqhaqhazela.
018	JOB	004	015	Kwathi tshazi umoya emehlweni ami, wahlasimula umzimba wami lenwele zami zema.
018	JOB	004	016	Umoya lowo wema, kodwa kangikwazanga ukuthi kuyini. Kwakumi into phambi kwamehlo ami, ngasengisizwa ilizwi elihelezayo:
018	JOB	004	017	‘Kambe umuntu angalunga ukwedlula uNkulunkulu na? Umuntu angahlanzeka kuloMenzi wakhe na?
018	JOB	004	018	Nxa uNkulunkulu engazethembi izinceku zakhe, nxa ebeka izingilosi zakhe umlandu ngokona,
018	JOB	004	019	pho-ke kuzakuba njani kulabo abahlala ezindlini zodaka, ozisekelo zazo zisothulini, abahlifizeka lula njengenondo!
018	JOB	004	020	Phakathi kokusa lokuhlwa bayabhidlizwa babe yizicucu; bengananzwa langubani, bayabhubha kokuphela.
018	JOB	004	021	Izintambo zamatende abo kazidonswa na, bafe bengelalwazi?’”
018	JOB	005	001	“Memeza nxa uthanda, kodwa ngubani ozakuphendula na? Uzaphendukela kuwuphi wabangcwele na?
018	JOB	005	002	Ukucaphuka kuyasibulala isiwula lomhawu uyamqeda oyisithutha.
018	JOB	005	003	Mina ngokwami sengasibona isiwula siphumelela, kodwa masinyane nje indlu yaso yayisiqalekisiwe.
018	JOB	005	004	Abantwabaso kabavikelekanga lakancinyane, baphoselwa entolongweni bengelamvikeli.
018	JOB	005	005	Abalambileyo bayazidlela isivuno sakhe, besithatha kanye lasemeveni, labomileyo bahahabela inotho yakhe.
018	JOB	005	006	Ngoba ubunzima kabugobhozi emhlabathini, loba uhlupho luhlume phansi.
018	JOB	005	007	Kodwa umuntu uzalelwa ukuhlupheka njengoba ngeqiniso inhlansi zomlilo ziqhatshela phezulu.
018	JOB	005	008	Kodwa aluba ubuyimi, bengizamncenga uNkulunkulu; bengizakwethula udubo lwami kuye.
018	JOB	005	009	Uyazenza izimanga ezingelakulinganiswa, imimangaliso engelakubalwa.
018	JOB	005	010	Uyanisa izulu emhlabeni; uthumela amanzi elizweni.
018	JOB	005	011	Abaphansi uyabakhweza phezulu, lalabo abakhalayo ubaphakamisela ekuphepheni.
018	JOB	005	012	Uyawafubisa amacebo amaqili, ukuze izandla zawo zingaphumeleli.
018	JOB	005	013	Uyababamba abahlakaniphileyo ebuqilini babo, kuthi amaqhinga eziphoxo achitheke.
018	JOB	005	014	Ubumnyama buyabehlela emini; phakathi kwemini bayaphumputha kungathi kusebusuku.
018	JOB	005	015	Uyabasindisa abaswelayo baphephe inkemba emlonyeni wabo; uyabasindisa ekubanjweni ngabalamandla.
018	JOB	005	016	Ngakho abayanga balalo ithemba, ukwahlulela kubi kuvala owakho umlomo.
018	JOB	005	017	Ubusisiwe umuntu oqondiswa nguNkulunkulu; ngakho ungaseyisi isijeziso sikaSomandla.
018	JOB	005	018	Ngoba uyagwaza, kodwa aphinde abophe amanxeba; uyalimaza kodwa izandla zakhe njalo ziyapholisa.
018	JOB	005	019	Uzakuhlenga ezinhluphekweni eziyisithupha; kweziyisikhombisa kawuyikuwelwa yingozi.
018	JOB	005	020	Ngesikhathi sendlala uzakuhlenga ekufeni, lasempini akuhlenge ekugaleleni kwenkemba.
018	JOB	005	021	Uzavikelwa ekuhletshweni, ungaze wesaba nxa kufika incithakalo.
018	JOB	005	022	Uzakuhleka ukuchithakala kanye lendlala, njalo ungaze wazesaba izilo zomhlaba.
018	JOB	005	023	Ngoba uzakuba lesivumelwano lamatshe eganga, lezinyamazana zeganga zizahlalisana kuhle lawe.
018	JOB	005	024	Uzakwazi ukuthi ithente lakho livikelekile; uzahlolisisa impahla yakho uthole kungelalutho olungekho.
018	JOB	005	025	Uzakwazi ukuthi abantwabakho bazakuba banengi, lesizukulwane sakho sibe ngangotshani bomhlaba.
018	JOB	005	026	Uzakuza engcwabeni usukhulile okugcweleyo njengezikhwebu zamabele eziqoqwa seziphelele.
018	JOB	005	027	Sesikuhlolile lokhu, kuliqiniso. Ngakho kuzwisise, ukulandele wena ngokwakho.”
018	JOB	006	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	006	002	“Nxa ubuhlungu bami bungalinganiswa lokuhlupheka kwami konke kufakwe esikalini!
018	JOB	006	003	Ngempela bungasinda ukwedlula itshebetshebe yolwandle, akungamangalisi ukuthi amazwi ami abhede kanje.
018	JOB	006	004	Imitshoko kaSomandla iphakathi kwami, umoya wami unatha itshefu yayo; inhlupho zokuhlukuluza zikaNkulunkulu ziqondiswe kimi.
018	JOB	006	005	Kambe ubabhemi weganga uyakhala yini utshani bukhona, loba inkabi ikhonye yona ukudla ilakho?
018	JOB	006	006	Ukudla okuduma kuyadleka na kungelatswayi, kumbe okumhlophe kweqanda kuyanambitheka yini?
018	JOB	006	007	Ngiyala ukukuthinta; ukudla okunjalo kubuyisa inhliziyo yami.
018	JOB	006	008	Oh, aluba ngingazuza isicelo sami, uNkulunkulu angiphe lokho engikufisayo,
018	JOB	006	009	ukuthi uNkulunkulu avume ukungichoboza, ekele nje isandla sakhe singiqede!
018	JOB	006	010	Lalapho ngizabe ngilokhu ngilale induduzo intokozo yami ebuhlungwini obungadediyo, ukuthi bengingawaphikanga amazwi akhe oNgcwele.
018	JOB	006	011	Ngilamandla bani okuthi ngibe lokhu ngithemba? Ngisamelelwe yini ukuba ngibe ngilokhu ngibekezela?
018	JOB	006	012	Ngilamandla elitshe yini? Inyama yami ilithusi na?
018	JOB	006	013	Ngilawo yini amandla okuzisiza, manje njengoba sengemukwe impumelelo?
018	JOB	006	014	Iloba ngubani ogodla umusa kumkhula wakhe udela ukwesaba uSomandla.
018	JOB	006	015	Kodwa abafowethu kabathenjwa njengemifula egeleza icitsha, njengemifula echithayo
018	JOB	006	016	ileliqhwa eselincibilika, njalo igcwele ngongqwaqwane osencibilikile,
018	JOB	006	017	kodwa ikhawule ukugeleza ngesikhathi sokoma, kuthi sekutshisa amanzi anyamalale ezindleleni zawo.
018	JOB	006	018	Indwendwe zamakamela ziyaphambuka ezindleleni zazo; zintule enkangala zifele khona.
018	JOB	006	019	Indwendwe zamakamela aseThema zidinga amanzi, abathengisi baseShebha balinde bethembile.
018	JOB	006	020	Bayadana ngoba bebekade bethembile; bayafika khonale bafike badane.
018	JOB	006	021	Lani selitshengise ukuthi kalilancedo; libona into eyesabekayo beselisesaba.
018	JOB	006	022	Sengake ngatsho yini ukuthi, ‘Ake lingihlawulele lokhu, ngihlengani ngempahla yenu,
018	JOB	006	023	ngikhululani esandleni sesitha, ngihlengani ekufithizelweni ngabalesihluku’?
018	JOB	006	024	Ngifundisani, ngizathula; ake lingitshengise lapho engiphambanise khona.
018	JOB	006	025	Abuhlungu kanganani amazwi eqiniso! Kodwa ukuphikisa kwenu kutshengisani?
018	JOB	006	026	Lizama ukuqondisa engikutshoyo, amazwi omuntu oselahlekelwe lithemba liwathethe njengomoya nje na?
018	JOB	006	027	Lina lingenza inkatho ngezintandane, lithengise lomngane wenu.
018	JOB	006	028	Kodwa okwamanje wobani lomusa lingizwele. Ngingaqamba amanga phambi kwenu na?
018	JOB	006	029	Dedani, lingenzi okungaqondanga; khumbulani kutsha, phela ubuqotho bami busengozini.
018	JOB	006	030	Kukhona okubi na okusezindebeni zami? Kambe umlomo wami kawukwehlukanisi okubi na?”
018	JOB	007	001	“Umuntu kakho ekutshikatshikeni okunzima yini emhlabeni? Insuku zakhe kazifani lezomuntu oqhatshiweyo na?
018	JOB	007	002	Njengesigqili siloyisa amathunzi okuhlwa, lanjengoqhatshiweyo elindele umholo wakhe,
018	JOB	007	003	kanjalo ngibekelwe izinyanga ezingelambadalo, lobusuku bosizi sebabelwe mina.
018	JOB	007	004	Ngithi nxa ngilala ngicabange ngithi, ‘Kuzakusa nini na’? Ubusuku buyadonsa ngiqwayize kuze kuse.
018	JOB	007	005	Umzimba wami uphihlika impethu lamathuthuva, isikhumba sami siyobukile siyabhibhidla.
018	JOB	007	006	Insuku zami ziyaphangisa kulosungulo lomaluki, zisuka ziphele kungekho ithemba.
018	JOB	007	007	Khumbula, Oh Nkulunkulu, ukuthi impilo yami ngumoya nje; amehlo ami kawayikufa akubona njalo ukuthokoza.
018	JOB	007	008	Ilihlo elingibonayo khathesi alisayikuphinde lingibone futhi; lizangidinga, kodwa ngizakuba ngingasekho.
018	JOB	007	009	Njengeyezi elinyamalalayo liphele, kanjalo lowo ongena engcwabeni kaphenduki.
018	JOB	007	010	Kasoze lanini aphinde angene endlini yakhe; indawo yakhe kayisayikubuye imazi lanini.
018	JOB	007	011	Ngakho-ke kangizukuthula; ngizakhuluma ubuhlungu obusemoyeni wami, ngizasola ngokudabuka komphefumulo wami.
018	JOB	007	012	Ngilulwandle yini, kumbe ngiyisilo semanzini okungaze lihlale lingilindile?
018	JOB	007	013	Ngithi lapho ngicabanga ukuthi umbheda wami uzangiduduza lecansi lami liphungule ukusola kwami,
018	JOB	007	014	lakhona lapho liyangethusa ngamaphupho njalo lingethusele ngemibono,
018	JOB	007	015	okwenza ngiqome ukuklinywa lokufa, kulalo umzimba wami.
018	JOB	007	016	Ngiyayeyisa impilo yami; kangiloyisi ukuphila okwaphakade. Ngiyekelani; insuku zami kazisatsho lutho.
018	JOB	007	017	Umuntu uyini ongaze uzihluphe kangaka ngaye, ungaze umnake kangaka,
018	JOB	007	018	uze umhlole ekuseni insuku zonke njalo umlinge imizuzwana yonke na?
018	JOB	007	019	Kawusoze uke ukhangele eceleni kwami na, loba uke ungixekele okomzuzwana yini?
018	JOB	007	020	Aluba ngenze isono, kuyini engikwenzileyo kuwe, wena mlindi wabantu? Kungani ukhethe ukuhlukuluza mina na? Sengingumthwalo kuwe na?
018	JOB	007	021	Kungani ungaxoleli iziphambeko zami na, uthethelele izono zami? Ngoba kakusekhatshana ukuthi ngilale othulini; uzangidinga, kanti ngizabe ngingasekho.”
018	JOB	008	001	UBhilidadi umShuhi wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	008	002	“Koze kube nini ukhuluma izinto ezinjalo? Amazwi akho angumoya ophenquzayo.
018	JOB	008	003	Kambe uNkulunkulu uyakuhlanekela ukulunga na? Kambe uSomandla uyakuhlanekela okuhle na?
018	JOB	008	004	Lapho abantwabakho besona kuye, wabapha isijeziso sokona kwabo.
018	JOB	008	005	Kanti nxa wena uzakhangela kuNkulunkulu uncenge kuSomandla,
018	JOB	008	006	nxa umsulwa ulungile, lamanje nje uzaphakama akusize akubuyisele esimeni sakho.
018	JOB	008	007	Lapho owaqalisa khona kuzakhanya sekukuncinyane, ngoba ngezinsuku ezizayo uzabe usuphumelela kakhulu.
018	JOB	008	008	Buza izizukulwane ezingaphambili udinge ukuthi okhokho babo bafundani,
018	JOB	008	009	ngoba thina sizelwe izolo nje, kasazi lutho, lezinsuku zethu emhlabeni zilithunzi kuphela.
018	JOB	008	010	Kambe kaziyikukulaya zikutshele na? Kaziyikuletha amazwi okuzwisisa na?
018	JOB	008	011	Konje imihlanga ingakhula ibe mide ingekho exhaphozini na? Imizi ingaphila kungelamanzi na?
018	JOB	008	012	Nxa leyonqodi isakhula ingakaqunywa imane ibune masinyane kulotshani.
018	JOB	008	013	Sinjalo isiphetho sabo bonke abakhohlwa uNkulunkulu; litshabalala kanjalo ithemba lalowo ongakholwayo.
018	JOB	008	014	Lokho akuthembayo kufohlozeka lula; lokho eyeme kukho yibulembu besayobe.
018	JOB	008	015	Uyeyama kulobubulembu bakhe, kodwa bubhidlike; uyabambelela kubo, kodwa bukhithike.
018	JOB	008	016	Unjengesihlahla esithelelwa kakhulu sikhula elangeni, esisabalalisa ingatsha zaso esivandeni;
018	JOB	008	017	sinxibanise impande zaso enqunjini yamatshe, sizama ukuzuza ukugxila kuhle ematsheni.
018	JOB	008	018	Kodwa singasitshulwa kuleyondawo, leyondawo isisilandula ithi, ‘Angikaze ngikubone.’
018	JOB	008	019	Ngeqiniso impilo yaso iyabuna, ezinye izihlahla zibe zilokhu zikhula emhlabathini lowo.
018	JOB	008	020	Ngeqiniso uNkulunkulu kamlahli umuntu ongelasici futhi kaqinisi izandla zezigangi.
018	JOB	008	021	Usazogcwalisa umlomo wakho ngohleko lezindebe zakho ngokumemeza ngentokozo.
018	JOB	008	022	Izitha zakho zizakwembathiswa ngehlazo, lamathente ababi azatshabalala.”
018	JOB	009	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	009	002	“Ngeqiniso ngiyazi ukuthi lokhu kuliqiniso. Kodwa umuntu wenyama angalunga yini kuNkulunkulu?
018	JOB	009	003	Loba umuntu ubengafisa ukuphikisana laye ngeke amphendule lakanye emibuzweni eyinkulungwane.
018	JOB	009	004	Ukuhlakanipha kwakhe kujulile, amandla akhe makhulu. Ngubani kambe oke wamelana laye wasinda?
018	JOB	009	005	Uyazidudula izintaba zona zingazi lutho, azigenqule nxa esezondile.
018	JOB	009	006	Uyawunyikinya umhlaba endaweni yawo, axukuxe izinsika zawo.
018	JOB	009	007	Uyalitshela ilanga ukuba lingakhanyi; asibekele ukukhanya kwezinkanyezi.
018	JOB	009	008	Nguye kuphela owelula amazulu, ohamba phezu kwamagagasi olwandle.
018	JOB	009	009	UnguMenzi wezinkanyezi iNgulube leZinja, iSilimela lomthala waseningizimu.
018	JOB	009	010	Wenza imimangaliso engafinyelelekiyo, izimanga ezingelakubalwa.
018	JOB	009	011	Uthi nxa esedlula kimi, ngingamboni; ahambe khonapho ngingezwa lutho.
018	JOB	009	012	Nxa ehluthuna, ngubani ongamalela? Ngubani ongathi kuye, ‘Wenzani wena?’
018	JOB	009	013	UNkulunkulu kalunqandi ulaka lwakhe; labasekeli bakaRahabi besaba bawela ezinyaweni zakhe.
018	JOB	009	014	Pho mina ngingaphikisana laye njani? Ngingawathatha ngaphi amazwi okujijana laye?
018	JOB	009	015	Laloba ngingelamlandu, ngeke ngimphendule; ngingancenga uMahluleli wami kuphela ukuthi angihawukele.
018	JOB	009	016	Lanxa bengingambiza asabele, angikholwa ukuthi ubengangilalela.
018	JOB	009	017	Ubengangicobodisa ngesiphepho andise amanxeba ami kungelasizatho.
018	JOB	009	018	Ubengasoze angiphe ithuba lokukhokha umoya kodwa ubezahle angincindezele ngosizi.
018	JOB	009	019	Nxa kungokwamandla, alamandla amakhulu! Nxa kungokokwahlulela ngokulunga, ngubani ongamthonisisa?
018	JOB	009	020	Loba ngingabe ngimsulwa, umlomo wami ubungangilahla; lanxa ngimsulwa wona ubuzakuthi ngilecala.
018	JOB	009	021	Lanxa ngingelacala, angizihluphi ngami; ngiyayeyisa impilo yami.
018	JOB	009	022	Kuyafanana konke; yikho ngisithi, ‘Ubhubhisa bonke abangelacala lababi.’
018	JOB	009	023	Nxa isifo esibi sibulala ngokuphangisa, uyabahleka abangelacala ngokulahla kwabo ithemba.
018	JOB	009	024	Nxa ilizwe liwela ezandleni zababi, wembesa amehlo abahluleli balo. Nxa kungayisuye, pho ngubani?
018	JOB	009	025	Amalanga ami alesiqubu esidlula esesithunywa; ayaphapha anyamalale kungela mthonselanyana wokuthokoza.
018	JOB	009	026	Antweza edlule njengezikepe zelala, njengenkozi zisehla zihwitha ezikudlayo.
018	JOB	009	027	Nxa ngingathi, ‘Ngizakubeka eceleni ukusola kwami, ngicitshe ukunyukubala kwami, ngibobotheke,’
018	JOB	009	028	ngilokhu ngihemahema ngezinhlupho zami, ngoba ngiyazi ukuthi kawuzukungigeza.
018	JOB	009	029	Njengoba ngivele sengibekwe icala, ngizazihluphelani ngokulwela ize na?
018	JOB	009	030	Loba ngingaze ngigeze ngesepa lezandla zami ngesoda yokuhlambulula,
018	JOB	009	031	uzavele ungiphosele emgodini olodaka ngize ngenyanywe yizigqoko zami.
018	JOB	009	032	Akasumuntu njengami ukuthi ngingamphendula, ukuthi singamisana emthethwandaba.
018	JOB	009	033	Aluba ubengabakhona osilamulayo, abeke isandla sakhe phezu kwethu sobabili,
018	JOB	009	034	omunye nje ongasusa uswazi lukaNkulunkulu kimi, ukuze ngingatshukunyiswa yikwesaba lokhu.
018	JOB	009	035	Lapho-ke bengizakhuluma ngingesabi yena, kodwa okwakhathesi kunje, ngeke.”
018	JOB	010	001	“Senginengwa yimpilo yami; ngakho sengizasola ngingasathikazi ngithulule ubuhlungu bomphefumulo wami.
018	JOB	010	002	Ngizakuthi kuNkulunkulu: Ungangilahli, kodwa ngitshela ukuthi ungethesa cala bani.
018	JOB	010	003	Kuyakuthabisa na ukungizwisa ubuhlungu, ukulahla umsebenzi wezandla zakho, ikanti uyahlekelela ngamacebo ababi?
018	JOB	010	004	Ulamehlo enyama na? Ubona njengokubona kwabantu na?
018	JOB	010	005	Insuku zakho ziyafanana lezabantu yini, kumbe iminyaka yakho njengeyomuntu yini,
018	JOB	010	006	osungaze uphenye iziphambeko zami njalo ulandelele isono sami,
018	JOB	010	007	loba wena ukwazi ukuthi angilacala lokuthi kakho ongangikhulula esandleni sakho?
018	JOB	010	008	Izandla zakho zangibumba zangenza. Pho usuzaphenduka ungibhidlize na?
018	JOB	010	009	Khumbula ukuthi wangibumba njengomdaka. Pho usuzabuye ungiphendule uthuli na?
018	JOB	010	010	Kawungichithanga yini njengochago njalo wangijiyisa njengolaza,
018	JOB	010	011	wangigqokisa ngesikhumba lenyama, wangithungela ndawonye ngamathambo lemisipha?
018	JOB	010	012	Wangipha ukuphila wangitshengisa umusa, ukunanza kwakho kwawelusa umoya wami.
018	JOB	010	013	Kodwa lokhu yikho owakufihla enhliziyweni yakho, njalo ngiyazi ukuthi lokhu kwakukhona engqondweni yakho:
018	JOB	010	014	Nxa ngona, ngabe wawungikhangele wawungeke wekela ukona kwami kungajeziswa.
018	JOB	010	015	Aluba ngilecala, maye mina! Laloba ngimsulwa, akukho engingakwenza, ngoba ngiyafa ngenhloni njalo ngiyagalula ekuhluphekeni kwami.
018	JOB	010	016	Nxa ngingathi ngivusa ikhanda ungicwathela njengesilwane uphinde utshengise amandla akho esabekayo kimi.
018	JOB	010	017	Uletha ofakazi abatsha abangilahlayo, wandise ulaka lwakho kimi; amabutho akho angihlasela amaviyo ngamaviyo.
018	JOB	010	018	Pho kungani wangikhupha esibelethweni na? Ngifisa ukuthi ngabe ngafa ngingakabonwa laloba yiliphi ilihlo.
018	JOB	010	019	Aluba ngavele ngingabi ngophilayo, loba ngathwalwa ngisuka esibelethweni ngasiwa ethuneni!
018	JOB	010	020	Insuku zami ezilutshwane kaseziphelile nje? Akungifulathele ukuze ngizuze umzuzwana wentokozo nje
018	JOB	010	021	ngingakayi lapho okungabuywa khona, elizweni lobumnyama lethunzi elikhulu,
018	JOB	010	022	elizweni lobusuku obujule ngempela, elethunzi elinzima lengxubevange, lapho lokukhanya kunjengobumnyama.”
018	JOB	011	001	UZofari umNahama wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	011	002	“Uthi amazwi wonke la angayekelwa ukuphendulwa na? Uwawane lolu luyekelwe nje lubheda?
018	JOB	011	003	Umbhedo wakho lo ungenza abantu bathule na? Uthi ungangakhuzwa muntu wena ukhulumela eceleni?
018	JOB	011	004	Uthi kuNkulunkulu, ‘Inkolo yami kayilansolo njalo ngimsulwa phambi kwakho.’
018	JOB	011	005	Oh, ngize ngifise ukuthi ngabe uNkulunkulu uyakhuluma, avule izindebe zakhe ekusola
018	JOB	011	006	akuvulele imfihlo zokuhlakanipha, ngoba inhlakanipho yeqiniso ikabili. Yazi lokhu: UNkulunkulu uvele usezikhohliwe ezinye izono zakho.
018	JOB	011	007	Kambe ungayifinyelela yini imfihlakalo kaNkulunkulu? Ungaziphenya iziphetho zikaSomandla na?
018	JOB	011	008	Ziqongile ngaphezu kwamazulu, ungenzani kambe? Zizikile kulokujula kolwandle, kuyini ongakwazi pho?
018	JOB	011	009	Ukulinganiswa kwazo kude kulomhlaba njalo kubanzi kulolwandle.
018	JOB	011	010	Nxa engeza lapha akuphosele entolongweni abize inkundla, ngubani ongamphikisa na?
018	JOB	011	011	Liqiniso ukuthi uyababona abantu abakhohlisayo; njalo nxa ebona okubi, kananzeleli na?
018	JOB	011	012	Kodwa umuntu oyisithutha ngeke ahlakaniphe njengoba ubabhemi weganga engeke azalwa ngumuntu.
018	JOB	011	013	Kodwa nxa ugxilisa inhliziyo yakho kuye uphakamisele izandla zakho kuye,
018	JOB	011	014	nxa ulahla isono esisesandleni sakho ungavumeli bubi buhlale ethenteni lakho,
018	JOB	011	015	lapho-ke uzabuveza ubuso bakho ungelanhloni; uzakuma uqine ungesabi.
018	JOB	011	016	Uzalukhohlwa ngempela uhlupho lwakho, lufike nje engqondweni njengezikhukhula ezadlulayo.
018	JOB	011	017	Impilo izakhanya kulemini enkulu, lobumnyama buzakuba njengasekuseni.
018	JOB	011	018	Uzavikeleka, ngoba ithemba likhona; uzakhangela ofuna khona uzuze ukuphumula uvikelekile.
018	JOB	011	019	Uzazilalela, kungekho okwethusayo, njalo abanengi bazabe sebezisondeza kuwe.
018	JOB	011	020	Kodwa amehlo ababi azafiphala, behluleke lokubaleka; ithemba labo libe yikuhotsha umoya wokufa.”
018	JOB	012	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	012	002	“Wo, lina yini elizibona kuyini abantu, njalo lolwazi luzakufa lani!
018	JOB	012	003	Kodwa lami ngilayo ingqondo njengani; kalingedluli ngalutho. Ngubani ongazaziyo izinto zonke lezi?
018	JOB	012	004	Sengiyinto yokuhlekisa ebanganini bami, lanxa ngacela kuNkulunkulu waphendula, inhlekisa sibili, kodwa ngilungile, ngimsulwa!
018	JOB	012	005	Abantu abahlezi kuhle bayakweyisa ukwehlelwa ngumnyama, bathi kuyimfanelo yalabo onyawo zabo sezitshelela.
018	JOB	012	006	Amathente ezigebenga avikelekile, lalabo abamthukuthelisayo uNkulunkulu bavikelekile, uNkulunkulu ulabo ezandleni zakhe.
018	JOB	012	007	Kodwa ake ubuze izinyamazana, zizakufundisa, kumbe izinyoni zemoyeni, zizakutshela;
018	JOB	012	008	kumbe khuluma lomhlaba, uzakufundisa, loba uthi inhlanzi zolwandle zikwazise.
018	JOB	012	009	Yikuphi kwalezizinto okungaziyo na ukuthi yisandla sikaThixo esikwenzileyo lokhu?
018	JOB	012	010	Esandleni sakhe kulempilo yazo zonke izidalwa lokuphefumula kwabantu bonke.
018	JOB	012	011	Indlebe kayiwahloli yini wonke amazwi njengolimi lunambitha ukudla?
018	JOB	012	012	Angithi ukuhlakanipha kufunyanwa ebadaleni na? Angithi impilo ende iletha ukuzwisisa na?
018	JOB	012	013	NgokukaNkulunkulu ukuhlakanipha lamandla; ukweluleka lokuzwisisa kungokwakhe.
018	JOB	012	014	Lokho akubhidlizayo kungeke kwamiswa njalo; lowo amvalelayo ngeke avulelwe.
018	JOB	012	015	Angaze awavale amanzi, kuba lokoma; angawavulela kuba lomonakalo elizweni.
018	JOB	012	016	Angawakhe amandla lenhlakanipho; okhohliswayo lomkhohlisi ngabakhe bonke.
018	JOB	012	017	Abeluleki uyabakhupha bahambe beze enze abehluleli babe yiziphukuphuku.
018	JOB	012	018	Uyanyomula izibopho ezibotshwe ngamakhosi azibophe ngelembu ekhalweni.
018	JOB	012	019	Abaphristi uyabakhupha beze awagenqule amadoda abesithi asegxilile.
018	JOB	012	020	Uyazithulisa izindebe zabeluleki abathenjiweyo asuse ulwazi lwabadala.
018	JOB	012	021	Izikhulu uzihleka usulu abalamandla abathathele lawomandla.
018	JOB	012	022	Uyembula imfihlo ezenzeka emnyameni amathunzi azikileyo awalethe ekukhanyeni.
018	JOB	012	023	Wenza izizwe zikhule, abesezidiliza; uyaziqhelisa izizwe, aphinde azichithe.
018	JOB	012	024	Abakhokheli basemhlabeni ubemuka ukuhlakanipha kwabo; ubenza bantule enkangala.
018	JOB	012	025	Bayaphumputha emnyameni kungelakukhanya; ubenza badiyazele njengezidakwa.”
018	JOB	013	001	“Amehlo ami asekubonile konke lokhu, indlebe zami zikuzwile zakuqedisisa lokhu.
018	JOB	013	002	Elikwaziyo lina lami ngiyakwazi; kalingcono ngalutho kulami.
018	JOB	013	003	Kodwa ngiloyisa ukukhuluma loSomandla, ngiphikisane loNkulunkulu ngendaba yami.
018	JOB	013	004	Kodwa lina lingigcona ngamanga; lonke lizinyanga ezingelamsebenzi!
018	JOB	013	005	Thulani lithi zwi lonke! Lokho kungaba yikuhlakanipha kini.
018	JOB	013	006	Zwanini-ke manje engikutshoyo; lalelani ukuncenga kwezindebe zami.
018	JOB	013	007	Lingakhuluma okubi limele uNkulunkulu na? Lingamkhulumela inkohliso na?
018	JOB	013	008	Limtshengisa ukuthi liyabandlulula yini? Yini elimkhulumelayo uNkulunkulu akutshoyo?
018	JOB	013	009	Kungalilungela yini nxa engalihlola? Kambe lingamkhohlisa njengoba lingakhohlisa abantu na?
018	JOB	013	010	Ngempela angaligcona nxa lingabe litshengisa ukubandlulula.
018	JOB	013	011	Inkazimulo yakhe ingezake ilethuse na? Ukwesabeka kwakhe kungezake kulehlele na?
018	JOB	013	012	Izitsho zenu ziyizaga zomlotha; lezivikelo zenu yizivikelo zebumba kuphela.
018	JOB	013	013	Thulani ngikhulume mina; kungivelele loba kuyini okuvelayo.
018	JOB	013	014	Ngizifakelani engozini na ngiphathe impilo yami ezandleni zami?
018	JOB	013	015	Lanxa engangibulala kodwa ngizakwala ngimethemba; ngizazivikela izindlela zami phambi kwakhe.
018	JOB	013	016	Ngeqiniso lokhu kuzangihlenga, ngoba kakho umuntu ongakholwayo ongasondela kuye!
018	JOB	013	017	Ake lilalele kuhle amazwi ami; vulani indlebe zenu lizwe engikutshoyo.
018	JOB	013	018	Manje-ke njengoba sengiyilungisile indaba yami, ngiyabona ukuthi ngizakhululwa.
018	JOB	013	019	Ngubani kambe ongangethesa icala? Nxa ekhona, ngizathula ngife.
018	JOB	013	020	Akungiphe lezizinto ezimbili nje, Oh Nkulunkulu, lapho-ke angiyikukucatshela:
018	JOB	013	021	Sisusele khatshana lami isandla sakho, ukhawule ukungethusa ngokwesabeka kwakho.
018	JOB	013	022	Ubusungibizela ecaleni, ngizaphendula, kumbe ungiyekele ngikhulume, lawe uphendule.
018	JOB	013	023	Sengenze iziphambeko lezono ezinganani na? Ngitshengisa isiphambeko sami lesono sami.
018	JOB	013	024	Kungani ufihla ubuso bakho ungithathe njengesitha sakho?
018	JOB	013	025	Uzahluphana lehlamvu eliphetshulwa ngumoya na? Uzaxotshana lomule owomileyo na?
018	JOB	013	026	Ngoba ubhala izinto ezibuhlungu ngami ungenze ngivune izono zobutsha bami.
018	JOB	013	027	Ukhina inyawo zami ngezibopho; ulandelela zonke izindlela zami ngokudweba uphawu ezinyathelweni zezinyawo zami.
018	JOB	013	028	Yikho-ke umuntu ecikizeka njengento ebolileyo, njengesigqoko esidliwe yinondo.”
018	JOB	014	001	“Umuntu ozelwe ngumfazi ulensuku ezilutshwane njalo ezigcwele inhlupho.
018	JOB	014	002	Uyaqhakaza njengeluba aphinde abune; njengesithunzi esithi tshazi, akemi.
018	JOB	014	003	Onjalo ungala ulokhu umkhangele na? Ungamisa phambi kwakho umthonisise na?
018	JOB	014	004	Ngubani ongaveza okuhlambulukileyo kokungcolileyo na? Kakho!
018	JOB	014	005	Insuku zomuntu zimisiwe; uzibekile izinyanga zokuphila kwakhe wabeka lemikhawulo angeke ayeqe.
018	JOB	014	006	Ngakho-ke myekele ungazihluphi ngaye, aze aqede lesosikhathi sakhe njengomuntu oqhatshiweyo.
018	JOB	014	007	Kungaba lethemba ngesihlahla; singaganyulwa siyahluma njalo, amahlumela aso kawayikwehluleka ukukhula.
018	JOB	014	008	Impande zaso zingaguga phansi emhlabathini lesiphunzi saso sife emhlabathini,
018	JOB	014	009	kodwa singezwa amanzi siyahluma sikhuphe ingatsha njengesihlahla esitsha.
018	JOB	014	010	Kodwa umuntu uyafa alaliswe phansi; uphefumula okokucina angabe esabakhona.
018	JOB	014	011	Njengamanzi esitsha olwandle lanjengomfula ucitsha amanzi wome qha,
018	JOB	014	012	ngokunjalo umuntu ulala phansi angabe esavuka; kuze kutshabalale amazulu abantu kabayikuvuka kumbe baphatshanyiswe ebuthongweni babo.
018	JOB	014	013	Kube uyangifihla ethuneni ungithukuze ulaka lwakho luze ludlule! Kube ungibekela isikhathi ube usungikhumbula!
018	JOB	014	014	Umuntu angafa uphinde aphile na? Zonke insuku zokutshikatshika kwami ngizalindela isikhathi sokuyekelwa kwami.
018	JOB	014	015	Uzabiza lami ngizasabela; uzasifisa lesosidalwa esenziwa yizandla zakho.
018	JOB	014	016	Ngeqiniso lapho uzabala izinyathelo zami kodwa kawuyikulandelela izono zami.
018	JOB	014	017	Iziphambeko zami zizananyekwa emgodleni; uzasigubuzela isono sami.
018	JOB	014	018	Kodwa njengentaba ikhumuzeka ize ibhidlike, lanjengedwala ligudluka endaweni yalo,
018	JOB	014	019	njengamanzi awagubhayo amatshe lezikhukhula zikhukhula umhlabathi, kanjalo uyalibhidliza ithemba lomuntu.
018	JOB	014	020	Umehlula kanye angaphindi abekhona, adlule; uyabuguqula ubuso bakho umxotshe.
018	JOB	014	021	Nxa amadodana akhe ezuza udumo, kawakwazi; nxa izizukulwane zakhe zisehliswa, kazikuboni.
018	JOB	014	022	Bezwa kuphela ubuhlungu bemizimba yabo bazikhalele bona.”
018	JOB	015	001	Wasephendula u-Elifazi umThemani wathi:
018	JOB	015	002	“Kambe indoda ehlakaniphileyo ingaphendula ngeze nje loba igcwalise isisu sayo ngomoya otshisayo wempumalanga na?
018	JOB	015	003	Ingadaza inkani ngamazwi angatsho lutho, ngezinkulumo ezingelasisindo na?
018	JOB	015	004	Wena uze weyise ukulunga njalo uphazame lokukhonza uNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	015	005	Isono sakho sikhuthaza umlomo wakho; usuthethe ulimi lwamaqili.
018	JOB	015	006	Umlomo wakho yiwo okulahlayo, hatshi owami; izindebe zakho zifakaza ububi bakho.
018	JOB	015	007	Nguwe yini umuntu wokuqala ukuzalwa? Wabakhona kuqala kulezintaba na?
018	JOB	015	008	Uyake ulalele yini enkundleni kaNkulunkulu? Nguwe wedwa yini ololwazi?
018	JOB	015	009	Kuyini okwaziyo wena thina esingakwaziyo? Ulemibono bani wena thina esingelayo?
018	JOB	015	010	Asebezimpunga lamakhehla bavumelana lathi, amadoda amadala kuloyihlo.
018	JOB	015	011	Induduzo zikaNkulunkulu kazikwanelisi yini, amazwi akhulunywa kamnandi kuwe?
018	JOB	015	012	Kungani uvumela ukufuqwa yinhliziyo na, kungani amehlo akho eqwayiza,
018	JOB	015	013	uze ubhodlise ulaka lwakho kuNkulunkulu ukhihlize amazwi anjalo ngomlomo wakho?
018	JOB	015	014	Umuntu uyini ukuthi abe ngohlanzekileyo na, lozelwe ngowesifazane ongaba ngcwele?
018	JOB	015	015	Nxa uNkulunkulu engazethembi izingilosi zakhe, njalo lamazulu engathembekanga kuye,
018	JOB	015	016	pho umuntu ongcolileyo ke, oxhwalileyo, onatha ububi njengamanzi!
018	JOB	015	017	Lalela kimi ngikuchazele; wothi ngikutshele esengakubonayo,
018	JOB	015	018	lokho osekwafakazwa yizihlakaniphi, bengafihli lutho abaluthatha kubokhokho babo
018	JOB	015	019	(abayibo kuphela abaphiwa ilizwe njalo akwaze kwedlula muntu wezizweni phakathi kwabo):
018	JOB	015	020	Ngezinsuku zakhe zonke umuntu omubi uhlutshwa yizinhlungu, kube yisihluku seminyaka yonke ayibekelweyo.
018	JOB	015	021	Imisindo eyesabisayo iyagcwala ezindlebeni zakhe; nxa kusithi kuyalunga, izikliwi zimhlasele.
018	JOB	015	022	Ulahlekelwa lithemba lokuwuphepha umnyama; umiselwe inkemba.
018	JOB	015	023	Uyantula nje abe yikudla kwamanqe; uyazi ukuthi usuku lobumnyama selusondele.
018	JOB	015	024	Usizi lobuhlungu emoyeni bumlethela uvalo; inhlupho ziyamgabhela, njengenkosi isilungele ukuhlasela,
018	JOB	015	025	ngoba efumbathele uNkulunkulu inqindi, ezimisela ukulwa loSomandla,
018	JOB	015	026	aqholoze amhlasele ngesihlangu esiqinileyo, esilohlonzi.
018	JOB	015	027	Lanxa ezimuke ubuso bungaka, umkhaba ulenga ngedanga,
018	JOB	015	028	uzahlala emadolobheni angamanxiwa lezindlini ezingahlali muntu, izindlu eziwohlokayo zibe yinqumbi.
018	JOB	015	029	Kasayikunotha futhi lenotho yakhe kayiyikuma, lezifuyo zakhe kazisayikugcwala ilizwe lonke.
018	JOB	015	030	Kayikuphepha emnyameni; ilangabi lizabunisa amahlumela akhe lomoya wokuphefumula komlomo kaNkulunkulu uzamthwalela kude.
018	JOB	015	031	Makangazikhohlisi ngokuthemba okuyize, ngoba akazukuzuza lutho ngakho.
018	JOB	015	032	Singakapheli isikhathi sakhe uzajeziswa, lezingatsha zakhe kaziyikuhluma.
018	JOB	015	033	Uzaba njengevini eliphundlwe izithelo zalo zingakavuthwa, njengesihlahla se-oliva sikhithiza impoko zaso.
018	JOB	015	034	Ngoba ixuku labangamesabiyo uNkulunkulu kalizukuba lezithelo, lomlilo uzawahangula amathente alabo abathanda isivalamlomo.
018	JOB	015	035	Bazithwala uhlupho babelethe ububi; isibeletho sabo sibumba inkohliso.”
018	JOB	016	001	UJobe wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	016	002	“Sengezwa izinto ezinengi ezifana lalezi; lingabaduduzi ababi lina lonke!
018	JOB	016	003	Zizaphela nini inkulumo zokubhuda kwenu lokhu? Kuyini okulihluphayo laphikelela nje lidaza inkani?
018	JOB	016	004	Lami bengingakhuluma njengani aluba yini elisesikhundleni sami; ngabe ngikhupha inkulumo ezimnandi ngilisola ngize nginikine ikhanda lami.
018	JOB	016	005	Kodwa umlomo wami ngabe uyaliqinisa; induduzo yezindebe zami idedise inhlungu zenu.
018	JOB	016	006	Kodwa nxa ngikhuluma, ubuhlungu obukimi kabudedi; loba ngingaze ngithule, kabupheli.
018	JOB	016	007	Ngeqiniso, Nkulunkulu, usungiqede amandla; usuyitshabalalisile yonke imuli yami.
018	JOB	016	008	Usungibophile sekuyibo ubufakazi balokho; lokucikizeka kwami kuyakhula kungilahla.
018	JOB	016	009	UNkulunkulu uyanginxwanela angidlikize ngolaka lwakhe, angigedlele amazinyo; isitha sami singinyonkoloze ngamehlo ahlabayo.
018	JOB	016	010	Abantu bavula imilomo yabo bengihoza; bangimakala esihlathini bengihlambaza babambane bangihlanganyele.
018	JOB	016	011	UNkulunkulu usenginikele ebantwini ababi wangiphosela ezandleni zezigangi.
018	JOB	016	012	Konke kwakukuhle kimi, kodwa wangibhidliza; wangixhakalaza ngentamo wangichoboza. Usengenze ngaba yinto yakhe yokunenjwa;
018	JOB	016	013	abacibi bemtshoko bakhe bangihanqile. Ungiciba izinso zami engelazwelo achithele inyongo yami phansi.
018	JOB	016	014	Ungisukela njalonjalo; angidumele njengebutho.
018	JOB	016	015	Sengithungele isembatho sesaka emzimbeni wami ngathukuza ibunzi lami othulini.
018	JOB	016	016	Ubuso bami sebubomvu ngokukhala, amathunzi anzima ahonqolozela amehlo ami;
018	JOB	016	017	kodwa izandla zami kaziluqhelanga udlakela, lomkhuleko wami uhlanzekile.
018	JOB	016	018	Awu mhlaba, ungaligqibeli igazi lami; sengathi lokukhala kwami kungaze kwacitshwa lanini!
018	JOB	016	019	Lakhathesi ufakazi wami usezulwini; umeli wami uphezulu khonale.
018	JOB	016	020	Umeli wami ngumngane wami nxa amehlo ami empompoza inyembezi kuNkulunkulu;
018	JOB	016	021	uyamncengela umuntu kuNkulunkulu njengomuntu encengela umngane wakhe.
018	JOB	016	022	Kusasele iminyakana engemingaki andubana ngiye lapho kungabuywa khona.”
018	JOB	017	001	“Umoya wami udabukile, insuku zami ziqunyiwe, ithuna lingimelele.
018	JOB	017	002	Impela abaklolodayo bangihanqile; amehlo ami asehlezi elinde ulaka lwabo.
018	JOB	017	003	Ngipha, Oh Nkulunkulu, lesosibambiso osifunayo. Kambe ngubani omunye ongangenzela lesosibambiso na?
018	JOB	017	004	Usuzivalile ingqondo zabo kabasazwisisi; ngakho kawuzukubayekela bagiye.
018	JOB	017	005	Nxa umuntu angaphika umngane wakhe ukuze ahlawulwe, amehlo abantwabakhe azafiphala.
018	JOB	017	006	UNkulunkulu usengenze ngaba yisiga ebantwini bonke, umuntu okhafulelwa ngabanye emehlweni.
018	JOB	017	007	Amehlo ami asethundubele ngosizi; umdumbu wami wonke usuyisithunzi nje.
018	JOB	017	008	Abantu abaqotho kuyabanenga lokhu; abangelacala bayacaphuka ngabangakholwayo.
018	JOB	017	009	Kungenani, abalungileyo bazabambelela ezindleleni zabo, kuthi labo abalezandla ezihlanzekileyo baqine.
018	JOB	017	010	Kodwa khathesi lina lonke ake lizame futhi! Kangiboni loyedwa ohlakaniphileyo kini.
018	JOB	017	011	Sezidlule insuku zami, amacebo ami asedilikile, kunjalo lezifiso zenhliziyo yami.
018	JOB	017	012	Lababantu bathatha ubusuku njengemini; bathi bebona ubumnyama bathi, ‘Ukukhanya sekusondele.’
018	JOB	017	013	Nxa ikhaya engilithembileyo lilingcwaba kuphela, nxa ngisendlala umbheda wami emnyameni,
018	JOB	017	014	nxa ngisithi ekuboleni, ‘Baba,’ ngithi empethwini, ‘Mama’ kumbe ‘Dadewethu,’
018	JOB	017	015	pho lingaphi ithemba lami na? Ngubani ongabona ithemba ngami?
018	JOB	017	016	Kuzakwehlela emasangweni okufa na? Sizakwehlela ndawonye othulini na?”
018	JOB	018	001	Kwathi lapho uBhilidadi umShuhi waphendula wathi:
018	JOB	018	002	“Koze kube nini ulokhu uphethe emlonyeni? Nakana andubana sikhulume.
018	JOB	018	003	Kungani usithatha njengezinkomo kube ingathi siyizithutha kuwe na?
018	JOB	018	004	Wena ozidabudabulayo ube yiziqa ngokuthukuthela kwakho, uthi sesingawudela umhlaba ngenxa yakho? Loba uthi amadwala agudlulwe ezindaweni zawo na?
018	JOB	018	005	Isibane somubi siyacima; ilangabi lomlilo wakhe liyaphela ukubhebha.
018	JOB	018	006	Ukukhanya ethenteni lakhe kuyafiphala; isibane esiseceleni kwakhe siyacima.
018	JOB	018	007	Izisinde zakhe zamandla ziyadeda; lamacebo akhe yiwo amlahla phansi.
018	JOB	018	008	Inyawo zakhe zimbeka emambuleni acine esemthandele.
018	JOB	018	009	Umjibila umhwiphula ngesithende; isihitshela simuthi nki.
018	JOB	018	010	Isihitshela usifihlelwe phansi; umjibila uthukuziwe endleleni yakhe.
018	JOB	018	011	Uyethuka ngokwesaba inxa zonke kumlandelele langaphi aya khona.
018	JOB	018	012	Umonakalo umlambele; incithakalo imlindele nxa esiwa.
018	JOB	018	013	Kudla ingxenye yesikhumba sakhe; izibulo lokufa lidla izitho zakhe.
018	JOB	018	014	Uyasuswa ekuvikelekeni kwethente lakhe aqhutshwe asiwe enkosini yokwesaba.
018	JOB	018	015	Umlilo uhlala ethenteni lakhe; isolufa evuthayo ichithachithwe emzini wakhe.
018	JOB	018	016	Impande zakhe ziyabuna ngaphansi lamagatsha akhe abune ngaphezulu.
018	JOB	018	017	Ukukhunjulwa kwakhe kuyaphela emhlabeni; kalabizo elizweni.
018	JOB	018	018	Uyasuswa ekukhanyeni aye ebumnyameni njalo axotshwe emhlabeni.
018	JOB	018	019	Kalabantwana loba isizukulwane ebantwini bakibo, kakho loyedwa owakhe lapho ake ahlala khona.
018	JOB	018	020	Abantu bentshonalanga bayanengwa yisiphetho sakhe; abantu bempumalanga bayatshaqeka.
018	JOB	018	021	Ngempela linjalo ikhaya lomuntu omubi; yiyo indawo yalowo ongamaziyo uNkulunkulu.”
018	JOB	019	001	Wasephendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	019	002	“Koze kube nini lilokhu lingichukuluza, lingicobodisa ngamazwi na?
018	JOB	019	003	Selingithethise amahlandla alitshumi manje; lingihlasela lingelanhloni.
018	JOB	019	004	Nxa kuliqiniso ukuthi ngiphambukile, isiphambeko sami ngumlandu wami ngedwa.
018	JOB	019	005	Nxa isibili liziphakamisa ngaphezulu kwami, lingincindezele ngokuyangeka kwami,
018	JOB	019	006	yazini ukuthi uNkulunkulu ungonile wangithandela ngomambule wakhe.
018	JOB	019	007	Loba ngingaze ngikhale ngithi, ‘Ngiyahlukuluzwa bo!’ angitholi mpendulo; loba ngicela uncedo, kangahlulelwa ngokulunga.
018	JOB	019	008	Uyivalile indlela yami akudluleki; izindlela zami uzembese ngomnyama.
018	JOB	019	009	Usengiphucile konke ukuhlonitshwa wangethula umqhele ekhanda lami.
018	JOB	019	010	Ungidabula inxa zonke ngize ngiphele du; usiphuna ithemba lami njengesihlahla.
018	JOB	019	011	Ulaka lwakhe luyavutha kimi; ungibalela phakathi kwezitha zakhe.
018	JOB	019	012	Amabutho akhe eza ngamandla; angakhela isihonqo sokungivimbezela amise egqagqele ithente lami.
018	JOB	019	013	Usenze abafowethu bangihlamuka; abangane bami sebemelana lami.
018	JOB	019	014	Izihlobo zami sezihambile; abangane bami sebekhohliwe ngami.
018	JOB	019	015	Izethekeli zami lezincekukazi zami zithi ngingowemzini; zingikhangela njengowezizweni.
018	JOB	019	016	Ngithi nxa ngibiza isisebenzi sami singasabeli, lokuba ngisincenga ngomlomo wami.
018	JOB	019	017	Ukuphefumula kwami kuyamnukela umkami; ngiyenyanyeka kubafowethu.
018	JOB	019	018	Labafanyana bayangiklolodela; ngithi nxa ngiqhamuka bangihoze.
018	JOB	019	019	Bonke abangane bami abasekhwapheni bayanengeka ngami; labo engibathandayo sebengifulathele.
018	JOB	019	020	Angiselalutho ngaphandle kwesikhumba lamathambo kuphela; ngiphephe manayinayi.
018	JOB	019	021	Ngizwelani usizi, bangane bami, wobani losizi, ngoba isandla sikaNkulunkulu singitshayile.
018	JOB	019	022	Lingilandelelani njengoNkulunkulu na? Lizakufa lasutha ngenyama yami na?
018	JOB	019	023	Oh, uthi ngabe amazwi ami ayalotshwa, ngabe abhaliwe emqulwini,
018	JOB	019	024	ngabe athwetshulwe ngensimbi phezu komnuso, loba agujwe edwaleni lanininini!
018	JOB	019	025	Ngiyazi ukuthi uMhlengi wami uyaphila, lokuthi ekupheleni uzakuma emhlabeni.
018	JOB	019	026	Kuzakuthi nxa isikhumba sami sesibhujisiwe, kodwa ngikuyo inyama yami ngizambona uNkulunkulu;
018	JOB	019	027	mina ngokwami ngizambona ngawami amehlo, mina hatshi omunye. Inhliziyo yami iyagubhazela ngokulangatha!
018	JOB	019	028	Lingaze lithi, ‘Sizamzingela qho ngoba nguye ozilethele ukuhlupheka,’
018	JOB	019	029	yini okumele liyesabe inkemba; ngoba intukuthelo izaletha isijeziso ngenkemba, lapho-ke lizakwazi ukuthi kulokwahlulela.”
018	JOB	020	001	Wasephendula uZofari umNahama wathi:
018	JOB	020	002	“Imicabango yami ekhathazekileyo ingifuqa ukuthi ngiphendule ngoba sengikhubekile kakhulu.
018	JOB	020	003	Ngizwa kulokukhuzwa okungilulazisayo njalo ukuzwisisa kwami kungifuqela ukuthi ngiphendule.
018	JOB	020	004	Ngempela uyakwazi ukuthi kwakuvele kunjani lendulo, kusukela ukubekwa komuntu emhlabeni,
018	JOB	020	005	ukuthi injabulo yomubi imfitshane, intokozo yongakholwayo ngeyomzuzwana nje.
018	JOB	020	006	Loba ukuzigqaja kwakhe kufika emazulwini lekhanda lakhe lithinta emayezini,
018	JOB	020	007	uzabhubha okwaphakade, njengobulongwe bakhe; labo abake bambona bazakuthi, ‘Ungaphi kanti?’
018	JOB	020	008	Njengephupho uyanyamalala angabe esabonwa njalo, axotshwe njengombono webusuku.
018	JOB	020	009	Ilihlo elake lambona kalisayikumbona njalo; indawo yakhe ingeke ibe isambona.
018	JOB	020	010	Abantwabakhe bazazincengela ebayangeni ngezandla zakhe abuyisele inotho yakhe.
018	JOB	020	011	Amadlabuzane obutsha alawo emathanjeni akhe azalala kanye laye othulini.
018	JOB	020	012	Loba ububi bumnandi emlonyeni wakhe, ebufihla ngaphansi kolimi lwakhe,
018	JOB	020	013	loba esehluleka ukutshiyana labo abugcine emlonyeni wakhe,
018	JOB	020	014	kodwa ukudla kwakhe kuzahloba esiswini sakhe; kuzaphenduka kube yibuhlungu bezinyoka ngaphakathi kwakhe.
018	JOB	020	015	Uzayihlanza yonke inotho ayiginyayo; uNkulunkulu uzakwenza isisu sakhe sikuhlanze konke.
018	JOB	020	016	Uzamunya ubuhlungu bezinyoka; amazinyo ebululu azambulala.
018	JOB	020	017	Akayikuyikholisa imifula, leyomifula egeleza uluju lolaza.
018	JOB	020	018	Lokho akuginqeleyo kumele akubuyise engakudlanga; akayikuyikholisa inzuzo yokuthengiselana kwakhe.
018	JOB	020	019	Ngoba ubebancindezela abayanga basala bengelalutho; wathumba izindlu angazakhanga.
018	JOB	020	020	Ngempela akayikudeda kulobubuhwaba bakhe; ngeke azisindise ngenotho yakhe.
018	JOB	020	021	Akusela lutho angabe esaludla; ukuphumelela kwakhe kakuyikuma.
018	JOB	020	022	Phakathi kwenotho yakhe uzahlaselwa zinhlupho; ubuhlungu buzamehlela ngamandla.
018	JOB	020	023	Nxa esesigcwalisile isisu sakhe, uNkulunkulu uzabhodlisela ulaka lwakhe oluvuthayo kuye akhwele ehle ngezidutshulo phezu kwakhe.
018	JOB	020	024	Lanxa angaze abalekele isikhali sensimbi umtshoko wethusi uzamciba.
018	JOB	020	025	Uyawuhwatsha emhlane wakhe, umcijo wawo ocazimulayo awuhwatshe esibindini. Uzangenwa yikwesaba okukhulu;
018	JOB	020	026	umnyama omkhulu uyilindele inotho yakhe. Umlilo ongungumayo uzamqeda utshise lokho okuseleyo ethenteni lakhe.
018	JOB	020	027	Amazulu azabembula ububi bakhe; umhlaba uzamvukela.
018	JOB	020	028	Isikhukhula sizayithwala indlu yakhe, kungamanzi azimpophoma mhla wosuku lolaka lukaNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	020	029	Sinjalo isiphetho uNkulunkulu asimisele ababi, ilifa abalikhethelwe nguNkulunkulu.”
018	JOB	021	001	UJobe wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	021	002	“Lalelani kuhle amazwi ami; lokhu akube yinduduzo elingipha yona.
018	JOB	021	003	Ake lingibekezelele nxa ngisakhuluma, ngithi nxa sengikhulumile liklolode.
018	JOB	021	004	Ukusola kwami kuqonde umuntu yini? Ngingayekelelani ukucunuka pho?
