018	JOB	021	006	Nxa ngikhumbula ngalokhu ngitshaywa luvalo; ngizwa umzimba wami uqhaqhazela.
018	JOB	021	007	Kungani ababi bephila impilo ende, baluphale nje amandla abo esanda?
018	JOB	021	008	Babona abantwababo bezinza benamile, inzalo yabo layo beyikhangele.
018	JOB	021	009	Imizi yabo ihlezi kayilakwesaba; induku kaNkulunkulu kayikho phezu kwabo.
018	JOB	021	010	Inkunzi zabo zikhuthele ziyazala; amankomokazi abo azala kuhle kawaphunzi.
018	JOB	021	011	Abantwababo bayazihambela njengomhlambi; izingane zabo ziyazigidela zichelesile.
018	JOB	021	012	Bayahlabela betshaya izigubhu lamachacho; bayazithokozisa ngomsindo wemiqangala.
018	JOB	021	013	Yonke iminyaka yabo ngeyokuphumelela baze bayongena egodini belokuthula.
018	JOB	021	014	Kodwa bathi kuNkulunkulu, ‘Tshiyana lathi! Kasifisi ukuzazi izindlela zakho.
018	JOB	021	015	Ungubani yena uSomandla ofuna ukuthi simkhonze na? Sizazuzani nxa sikhuleka kuye na?’
018	JOB	021	016	Kodwa ukuphumelela kwabo kakukho ezandleni zabo, ngakho kangisondeli ezelulekweni zababi.
018	JOB	021	017	Kodwa kukangaki na isibane sababi sicinywa? Kukangaki besehlelwa ngamabhadi na, abawabelwa nguNkulunkulu ezondile?
018	JOB	021	018	Kukangaki besiba njengomule emoyeni na, njengamakhoba ephetshulwa yisivunguzane?
018	JOB	021	019	Kuthiwa, ‘UNkulunkulu ulomba isijeziso somuntu asibekele amadodana akhe.’ Kajezise yena umuntu ngokwakhe ukuze akwazi!
018	JOB	021	020	Amehlo akhe kawakubone ukuchithwa kwakhe; kalunathe ulaka lukaSomandla.
018	JOB	021	021	Ngoba uvele uzihlupha ngani ngemuli avele ezayitshiya nxa izinyanga zakhe azabelweyo seziphelile na?
018	JOB	021	022	Kambe ukhona ongafundisa uNkulunkulu ulwazi, njengoba yena esahlulela labaphezulu na?
018	JOB	021	023	Umuntu uyafa ephilile kuhle, kukuhle konke ekhululekile,
018	JOB	021	024	umzimba wakhe uzimukile, amathambo akhe egcwele umnkantsho.
018	JOB	021	025	Omunye ufa elobuhlungu emphefumulweni wakhe, evele engakaze akholise lutho oluhle.
018	JOB	021	026	Bobabili balaliswe ndawonye eceleni komunye othulini, impethu zinyakaze phezu kwabo bobabili.
018	JOB	021	027	Ngiyazi kamhlophe ukuthi licabangani, amacebo elidinga ukungilimaza ngawo.
018	JOB	021	028	Lithi, ‘Ingaphi-ke manje indlu yesikhulu, amathente okwakuhlala kuwo abantu ababi?’
018	JOB	021	029	Kalikaze libuze labo abahambayo na? Kalize lananzelela izinto abazilandisayo,
018	JOB	021	030	ukuthi umuntu omubi uyaphepha ngosuku lokubhujiswa na, ukuthi uyakhululwa ngosuku lwesiphithiphithi?
018	JOB	021	031	Kambe ngubani omtshela ngobubi bakhe ebusweni bakhe na? Ngubani ophindiselayo ngalokho akwenzileyo na?
018	JOB	021	032	Uthwalelwa engcwabeni, lilindwe ingcwaba lakhe ngemfanelo.
018	JOB	021	033	Inhlabathi esigodini leso imnandi kuye; bonke abantu bayamlandela, banengi kakhulu njalo abahamba kuqala kulaye.
018	JOB	021	034	Pho-ke lingangiduduza njani likhuluma ize nje? Akusalanga lutho elilutshoyo ngaphandle kwenkohliso.”
018	JOB	022	001	U-Elifazi umThemani wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	022	002	“Umuntu angasiza uNkulunkulu na? Lesihlakaniphi uqobo kambe singamsiza na?
018	JOB	022	003	Bekungamupha ntokozo bani uSomandla ukulunga kwakho na? Ubengazuzani ngabe kuthiwa kawulasici na?
018	JOB	022	004	Yikumesaba kwakho yini akukhuzela khona lakwethesela khona amacala na?
018	JOB	022	005	Kabubukhulu ububi bakho na? Lezono zakho angithi kazipheli na?
018	JOB	022	006	Wawubiza isibambiso kubafowenu kungelasizatho; uhlubula abantu izigqoko zabo basale beze.
018	JOB	022	007	Abakhatheleyo wawubancitsha amanzi, abalambileyo ungabaphi ukudla,
018	JOB	022	008	lanxa wena wawuyindoda elamandla, ulepulazi, indoda ehlonitshwayo, uphila kulo.
018	JOB	022	009	Abafelokazi wabaxotsha ungabaphanga lutho izintandane waziqeda amandla.
018	JOB	022	010	Kungenxa yalokho usuhanqwe yimijibila, usuhlukuluzwa luhlupho masinyane,
018	JOB	022	011	yikho kumnyama kangaka ungasaboni, njalo yikho ususibekelwa zimpophoma zamanzi.
018	JOB	022	012	UNkulunkulu kakho esiqongweni samazulu na? Ake ubone phela ukuthi ziphakeme njani izinkanyezi ezisesiqongweni!
018	JOB	022	013	Kodwa wena uthi, ‘UNkulunkulu wazini? Angahlulela phakathi komnyama onje?
018	JOB	022	014	Usithwe ngamayezi amakhulu, ngakho kasiboni nxa ehambahamba ezulwini eliphezulu.’
018	JOB	022	015	Wena-ke uzakwalela endleleni endala na eseyahanjwa ngababi?
018	JOB	022	016	Bedluliswa singakafiki isikhathi sabo, izisekelo zabo zakhukhulwa nguzamcolo.
018	JOB	022	017	Bathi kuNkulunkulu, ‘Tshiyana lathi! USomandla angasenzani na?’
018	JOB	022	018	Ikanti kunguye owagcwalisa izindlu zabo ngezinto ezinhle, ngakho kangingeni ezelulekweni zababi.
018	JOB	022	019	Abalungileyo bayakubona lokho bathokoze; abangelacala bayabahleka bathi,
018	JOB	022	020	‘Ngempela izitha zethu zichithiwe, lokuseleyo kwenotho yazo sekubhuqwe ngumlilo.’
018	JOB	022	021	Zehlise kuNkulunkulu ukuze uwelelane laye; ngaleyondlela ukuphumelela kuzakuza kuwe.
018	JOB	022	022	Yamukela iziqondiso eziphuma emlonyeni wakhe, amazwi akhe uwabeke enhliziyweni yakho.
018	JOB	022	023	Nxa ubuyela kuSomandla, uzavuselelwa; nxa ususa ububi bube kude lethente lakho
018	JOB	022	024	lomthuso wakho uwulahlele othulini, igolide lakho lase-Ofiri ulilahlele emadwaleni ezifuleni,
018	JOB	022	025	lapho-ke uSomandla uzakuba ligolide lakho, lesiliva esikhethekileyo kuwe.
018	JOB	022	026	Ngempela uzazuza ukuthokoza kuSomandla uphakamisele ubuso bakho kuNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	022	027	Uzakhuleka kuye, yena akuzwe, njalo uzagcwalisa izifungo zakho.
018	JOB	022	028	Lokho okumisileyo kuzakwenziwa, lokukhanya kuzazikhanyisa izindlela zakho.
018	JOB	022	029	Nxa abantu besehliswa ubususithi, ‘Baphakamiseni!’ lapho-ke uzabasiza abahlulukelweyo.
018	JOB	022	030	Uzabasiza lalabo abonayo, abazakhululwa ngenxa yokubamsulwa kwakho.”
018	JOB	023	001	Waphendula uJobe wathi:
018	JOB	023	002	“Lalamuhla ukusola kwami kulokhu kubuhlungu kabi, isandla sakhe siyasinda loba ngibubula kangaka.
018	JOB	023	003	Ngabe ngiyakwazi lapho engingamfumana khona; aluba nje bengingaya emzini wakhe!
018	JOB	023	004	Bengizayibeka kuhle indaba yami phambi kwakhe ngigcwalise umlomo wami ngamazwi empikiswano.
018	JOB	023	005	Bengizakuzwa ukuthi yena uphendula athini, ngikuhlolisise lokho akutshoyo.
018	JOB	023	006	Kambe angangiphikisa ngamandla na? Hatshi, angazake angethese cala.
018	JOB	023	007	Lapho umuntu oqotho ubengendlala indaba yakhe phambi kwakhe, njalo bengizakhululwa lanini kumahluleli wami.
018	JOB	023	008	Kodwa nxa ngisiya empumalanga, yena kakho khona; nxa ngisiya entshonalanga, kangimfumani khona.
018	JOB	023	009	Nxa esemsebenzini enyakatho, kangimboni; angaphendukela eningizimu, kangiboni lokuthi tshazi kwakhe.
018	JOB	023	010	Kodwa uyayazi indlela engihamba ngayo; nxa esengilingile, ngizaphuma senginjengegolide.
018	JOB	023	011	Inyawo zami bezilokhu zilandelana lezinyathelo zakhe; ngalela endleleni yakhe angaze ngaphambuka.
018	JOB	023	012	Angigudlukanga emilayweni yezindebe zakhe; ngiwenze igugu amazwi omlomo wakhe ukwedlula isinkwa sami sansukuzonke.
018	JOB	023	013	Kodwa uzimele yedwa, ngubani ongaphikisana laye na? Uyenza loba yini ayifunayo.
018	JOB	023	014	Uyagcwalisa isimiso sakhe ngami, njalo manengi amacebo anjalo awagcinileyo.
018	JOB	023	015	Yikho-nje ngithuthumela ukuma phambi kwakhe; ngithi ngingakukhumbula konke lokhu ngimesabe.
018	JOB	023	016	UNkulunkulu usenze inhliziyo yami yaphela amandla; uSomandla usengethusile.
018	JOB	023	017	Kodwa kawuyikungithulisa umnyama lo, umnyama lo onzima ovala ubuso bami.”
018	JOB	024	001	“Kungani uSomandla engabeki izikhathi zokwahlulela na? Kungani labo abamaziyo belindela ize bengazazi lezinsuku na?
018	JOB	024	002	Abantu bayayiguqula imingcele ngokususa izikhonkwane; bayayelusa imihlambi entshontshiweyo.
018	JOB	024	003	Bayathatha bahambe lobabhemi wentandane, bathathe inkabi yomfelokazi ibe yisibambiso.
018	JOB	024	004	Abaswelayo bayabagudlula endleleni bancindezele abayanga belizweni baze bayocatsha.
018	JOB	024	005	Njengabobabhemi beganga enkangala, abayanga babhudula ukudla; egwaduleni kulapho okuzuzwa khona ukudla kwabantwababo.
018	JOB	024	006	Babutha ukudla kwenkomo emasimini badobhe okuseleyo ezivinini zababi.
018	JOB	024	007	Ngoba bengelazigqoko balala beze ubusuku bonke; kabalalutho lokuzembesa emqandweni.
018	JOB	024	008	Bagxonxwa lizulu lezintabeni bakhusele emadwaleni beswele indawo yokuphephela.
018	JOB	024	009	Umntwana oyintandane uhluthunwa ebeleni; usane lomyanga luyathunjelwa isikwelede.
018	JOB	024	010	Ngoba bengelazigqoko bahamba nqunu; bathwala izikhwebu zamabele kodwa belambile.
018	JOB	024	011	Bahluza ama-oliva emigelweni; bagidagida esikhamelweni sewayini kodwa bomile.
018	JOB	024	012	Ukububula kwabafayo kuzwakala kuphuma edolobheni, lemiphefumulo yabalimeleyo ikhala icela uncedo. Kodwa uNkulunkulu kabeki muntu icala ngenxa yokona.
018	JOB	024	013	Bakhona labo abahlamukela ukukhanya, abangazaziyo izindlela zalokho kukhanya loba ukuhlala kuzo.
018	JOB	024	014	Nxa ukukhanya kwemini sekuhambile isigebenga siyaphuma sibulale abampofu labaswelayo; ebusuku siyanyonyoba njengesela.
018	JOB	024	015	Ilihlo lesiphingi lilindela ukuhlwa; sikhumbula sithi, ‘Akulamuntu ozangibona,’ sihlala sibusithile ubuso baso.
018	JOB	024	016	Ebumnyameni abantu bayagqekeza izindlu, kodwa emini bayazivalela endlini; kabakufuni ukukhanya.
018	JOB	024	017	Bonke labo ubumnyama obukhulu buyikusa kubo; bathandana lezinto ezesabekayo ezobumnyama.
018	JOB	024	018	Ikanti baligwebu phezu kwamanzi; esabo isabelo selizwe siqalekisiwe, ukuze kungayi muntu ezivinini.
018	JOB	024	019	Njengalokhu ukutshisa lokoma kuhangula ungqwaqwane oncibilikayo, kanjalo ingcwaba liyabahlwitha abenze isono.
018	JOB	024	020	Isibeletho siyabakhohlwa, impethu zizitike phezu kwabo; abantu ababi kabasakhunjulwa kodwa bayafohlozwa njengesihlahla.
018	JOB	024	021	Bancindezela owesifazane oyinyumba longelamntwana, kumfelokazi kabalamusa.
018	JOB	024	022	Kodwa uNkulunkulu uyazihudulela kude izikhulu ngamandla akhe. Noma bangaze bahlale bazinze kodwa kabalathemba lempilo.
018	JOB	024	023	Angabayekela bahlale besizwa bevikelekile, kodwa amehlo akhe ayazibona izindlela zabo.
018	JOB	024	024	Okwesikhatshana nje balodumo, baphinde banyamalale; bayehliswa njalo bafe njengabo bonke abanye; bayaqunywa njengezihloko zamabele.
018	JOB	024	025	Aluba lokhu kungenjalo, ngubani ongathi ngilamanga alulazise amazwi ami abe yize?”
018	JOB	025	001	Kwathi-ke uBhilidadi umShuhi waphendula wathi:
018	JOB	025	002	“Umbuso lesizotha kukuye uNkulunkulu; nguye omisa konke ngemfanelo ezulwini eliphezulu.
018	JOB	025	003	Amabutho akhe angabalwa na? Ngubani ongaphunyelwa yikukhanya kwakhe na?
018	JOB	025	004	Pho umuntu angaba ngolungileyo njani kuNkulunkulu na? Angenza njani ozelwe ngowesifazane ukuthi ahlanzeke na?
018	JOB	025	005	Khangela, nxa inyanga ngokwayo ingakhazimuli, lezinkanyezi zingahlanzekanga emehlweni akhe,
018	JOB	025	006	pho umuntu-ke usilela kanganani, oyimpethu nje, umuntu, oyinhlava nje kuphela!”
018	JOB	026	001	UJobe wasephendula wathi:
018	JOB	026	002	“Usumsize njani ongelamandla! Usuyilamulele njani ingalo ebuthakathaka!
018	JOB	026	003	Yiseluleko esinjani osusiphe lowo ongelakuhlakanipha! Njalo usubonise mbono bani!
018	JOB	026	004	Ngubani okuncedisileyo ukukhuluma amazwi la na? Ngokabani umoya okhulume ngomlomo wakho na?
018	JOB	026	005	Abafileyo basebuhlungwini obukhulu, labo abangaphansi kwamanzi lalabo abahlala kuwo.
018	JOB	026	006	UKufa kwambulekile phambi kukaNkulunkulu; ikhamisile indawo yokubhubha.
018	JOB	026	007	Uyawendlala umkhathi wenyakatho endaweni engelalutho; aphanyeke umhlaba phezu kweze.
018	JOB	026	008	Ugoqele amanzi emayezini akhe, kodwa amayezi kawapatshaki yikusindwa ngamanzi.
018	JOB	026	009	Uyayigubuzela inyanga egcweleyo, endlale amayezi phezu kwayo.
018	JOB	026	010	Umisa umkhawulo wokwengama umkhathi emanzini kube ngumngcele phakathi kokukhanya lobumnyama.
018	JOB	026	011	Izinsika zamazulu ziyazamazama, zisethuswa yikukhuza kwakhe.
018	JOB	026	012	Ngamandla akhe waluthulisa ulwandle; ngenhlakanipho yakhe waquma uRahabi waba yiziqa.
018	JOB	026	013	Ngomoya wakhe umkhathi wacethula; isandla sakhe sayigwaza inyoka ibaleka.
018	JOB	026	014	Njalo le yimisebenzi yakhe engaphandle nje ekucineni; esikuzwayo yilizwana nje lokunyenyeza kwakhe! Pho ngubani ongawuzwisisa umdumo wamandla akhe na?”
018	JOB	027	001	UJobe waqhubeka ngenkulumo yakhe wathi:
018	JOB	027	002	“Ngifunga ngoNkulunkulu ophilayo, ngubani ongithathele ilungelo lami lokwahlulelwa ngokulunga, uSomandla, ongizwise ubuhlungu bomphefumulo,
018	JOB	027	003	nxa ngilokhu ngiselempilo ngaphakathi kwami, umphefumulo kaNkulunkulu usemakhaleni ami,
018	JOB	027	004	izindebe zami kazisoze zikhulume ububi, lolimi lwami kaluyikukhuluma inkohliso.
018	JOB	027	005	Kangisoze ngivume ukuthi lina lilungile ngelikutshoyo; ngizaze ngiyekufa ngingabulandulanga ubuqotho bami.
018	JOB	027	006	Ngizakugcina ukulunga kwami ngingakuyekeli; umzwangedwa wami kawuyikungihlupha empilweni yami.
018	JOB	027	007	Sengathi izitha zami zingaba njengababi, abaxabana lami babe njengabangaqondanga!
018	JOB	027	008	Ngoba ulethemba bani ongakholwayo nxa esefile, uNkulunkulu angathatha impilo yakhe na?
018	JOB	027	009	UNkulunkulu uyakulalela yini ukukhala kwakhe nxa usizi lumehlela na?
018	JOB	027	010	Uzakuthola yini ukuthokoza kuSomandla? Uzacela kuNkulunkulu sonke isikhathi na?
018	JOB	027	011	Ngizalifundisa mayelana lamandla kaNkulunkulu; izindlela zikaSomandla kangiyikuzifihla.
018	JOB	027	012	Lonke lizibonele lokhu ngokwenu. Pho, ngeyani inkulumo yonke le eyize na?
018	JOB	027	013	Nansi isabelo uNkulunkulu asiqumela ababi, ilifa elemukelwa ngumuntu olesihluku sivela kuSomandla:
018	JOB	027	014	Loba bebanengi njani abantwabakhe, isabelo sabo yinkemba; lenzalo yakhe kayisoze lanini izuze ukudla okwaneleyo.
018	JOB	027	015	Isifo esibi sizabangcwaba labo abatshiywa nguye besaphila, labafelokazi babo kabayikubalilela.
018	JOB	027	016	Lokuba angaze abuthelele isiliva njengothuli lezigqoko zibe yinqwaba njengodaka,
018	JOB	027	017	lokho akubuthelelayo abalungileyo bazakugqokela, labangelacala bazakwaba isiliva sakhe.
018	JOB	027	018	Indlu ayakhayo injengesidleke sobulembu, njengedumba elenziwe ngumlindi.
018	JOB	027	019	Uthi esiyalala enothile, kodwa kasayikuphinda njalo; uthi esevula amehlo, konke sekuphelile.
018	JOB	027	020	Utshaywa luvalo kungathi ufuqwa yisikhukhula; isiphepho siyamhwitha ebusuku.
018	JOB	027	021	Umoya wempumalanga udlula laye, anyamalale; uyamkhukhula endaweni yakhe.
018	JOB	027	022	Utshaya phezu kwakhe ngesihluku esithi uyabaleka ecambalele evika amandla awo.
018	JOB	027	023	Utshaya izandla umhleka ulunya uvunguza laye umsusa endaweni yakhe.”
018	JOB	028	001	Kulomgodi wesiliva lendawo lapho okucengwa khona igolide.
018	JOB	028	002	Insimbi ithathwa emhlabathini, lethusi lincibilikiswa emanyeleni.
018	JOB	028	003	Umuntu uyawuxotsha umnyama; uguduza ezingoxweni eziphansi kude edinga amanyele emnyameni othe bhuqe.
018	JOB	028	004	Khatshana kwezindawo zabantu ugebha umgodi, ezindaweni lapho okungafiki nyawo lwamuntu; khatshana kwabantu uyalenga, azunguzeke.
018	JOB	028	005	Umhlaba, okuphuma kuwo ukudla, uyaguquka ngaphansi ingathi utshiswe ngomlilo;
018	JOB	028	006	amasafire amatshe amahle ayaphuma emadwaleni, uthuli lwawo lugcwele igolide.
018	JOB	028	007	Kakukho nyoni edla inyama eyaziyo leyondlela efihlekileyo, kakulalihlo laluphi ukhozi oselwake lwayibona.
018	JOB	028	008	Izilo ezizithembileyo kazilubeki unyawo kuyo, njalo kakulasilwane esizingela khona.
018	JOB	028	009	Isandla somuntu yiso esihlasela idwala eliyinsengetshe siveze obala impande zezintaba.
018	JOB	028	010	Uyaligubha idwala angene; ilihlo lakhe liwabone wonke amagugu alo.
018	JOB	028	011	Uyathungatha lapho okudabuka khona imifula aveze obala izinto ezifihlekileyo.
018	JOB	028	012	Kodwa ukuhlakanipha kungafunyanwa ngaphi na? Kuhlala ngaphi na ukuzwisisa?
018	JOB	028	013	Umuntu kakuzwisisi ukuqakatheka kwakho; kakufunyanwa elizweni labaphilayo.
018	JOB	028	014	Phansi ekujuleni kuthi, “Kakukho kimi”; ulwandle luthi, “Kangilakho mina.”
018	JOB	028	015	Kungeke kwathengwa ngegolide elicolekileyo, njalo lentengo yakho ingeke yalinganiswa ngesiliva.
018	JOB	028	016	Kungeke kwathengwa ngegolide lase-Ofiri, loba nge-onikisi kumbe isafire.
018	JOB	028	017	Kungazake kulinganiswe legolide loba amatshe akhazimulayo, njalo kakuzuzwa ngemiceciso yegolide.
018	JOB	028	018	Amatshe amahle ekhorali lejaspa lawo kawabalwa lapha; intengo yokuhlakanipha ingaphezulu kwamarubhi.
018	JOB	028	019	Ithophazi yaseKhushi ngeke ilinganiswe lakho; ngeke kuthengwe langegolide elicolekileyo.
018	JOB	028	020	Pho kuvela ngaphi ukuhlakanipha na? Kuhlala ngaphi ukuzwisisa?
018	JOB	028	021	Kufihliwe emehlweni ento yonke ephilayo, kucatshisiwe lakuzo izinyoni zasemoyeni.
018	JOB	028	022	INcithakalo loKufa kuthi, “Amahungahunga akho yiwo kuphela esiwezwayo.”
018	JOB	028	023	UNkulunkulu uyayizwisisa indlela yakho njalo nguye yedwa okwaziyo lapho okuhlala khona,
018	JOB	028	024	ngoba uyayikhangela imikhawulo yomhlaba akubone konke okungaphansi kwamazulu.
018	JOB	028	025	Wathi emisa umfutho womoya, elinganisa isimo samanzi,
018	JOB	028	026	wathi ebeka umthetho wezulu elinayo lendlela yezulu elilesiphepho,
018	JOB	028	027	wasekukhangela ukuhlakanipha wakuhlola butsha; wakukholwa wakuqinisa, wakulinga ukuthi kuqinile.
018	JOB	028	028	Wathi emuntwini, “Ukumesaba uThixo yikho ukuhlakanipha, lokuxwaya ububi yikho ukuzwisisa.”
018	JOB	029	001	UJobe waqhubeka ngenkulumo yakhe wathi:
018	JOB	029	002	“Ngiyaziloyisa lezozinyanga esezadlulayo, lezinsuku uNkulunkulu esangilinda,
018	JOB	029	003	lapho isibane sakhe sisakhanyisa phezu kwekhanda lami ngihamba ngokukhanya kwakhe emnyameni!
018	JOB	029	004	Oh, lezinsuku ngisazizwa ukuthi ngiyimi, lapho ubudlelwano obukhulu loNkulunkulu busesendlini yami,
018	JOB	029	005	lapho uSomandla eseselami labantwabami besaphila lami,
018	JOB	029	006	lapho indlela yami ifafazwe ngolaza ledwala lingithululela impophoma zamafutha e-oliva.
018	JOB	029	007	Ekuyeni kwami emasangweni edolobho ngafika ngahlala enkundleni,
018	JOB	029	008	amajaha angibona agudluka ema eceleni, abadala baphakama bema ngezinyawo;
018	JOB	029	009	amadoda ayizikhulu athula akaze akhuluma avala imilomo yawo ngezandla zawo;
018	JOB	029	010	amazwi ezikhulu ehliselwa phansi, inlimi zazo zanamathela olwangeni lwazo.
018	JOB	029	011	Loba ngubani owangizwayo wakhuluma kuhle ngami, kwathi labo abangibonayo bangibuka,
018	JOB	029	012	ngoba ngalamulela abayanga abacela uncedo, lezintandane ezazingelamsizi.
018	JOB	029	013	Indoda eyayisifa yangibusisa; ngenza inhliziyo yomfelokazi yahlabelela.
018	JOB	029	014	Ngavunula ukulunga njengezigqoko zami; ukwahlulela ngokulunga kwaba yisembatho sami lengwane yami.
018	JOB	029	015	Ngangingamehlo kwabayiziphofu lezinyawo kwabaqhulayo.
018	JOB	029	016	Nganginguyise kwabaswelayo; ngayimela indaba yesihambi.
018	JOB	029	017	Ngawephula amazinyo ababi ngahluthuna labo ababebabambile ngamazinyo abo.
018	JOB	029	018	Ngakhumbula ngathi, ‘Ngizafela endlini yami, insuku zami zinengi njengezinhlamvu zetshebetshebe.
018	JOB	029	019	Impande zami zizafinyelela emanzini, amazolo azalala emagatsheni ubusuku bonke.
018	JOB	029	020	Udumo lwami luzahlala lulutsha kimi, idandili lami lilitsha esandleni sami.’
018	JOB	029	021	Abantu babengilalela belethemba, belindele ukwelulekwa bethule zwi.
018	JOB	029	022	Nxa sekukhulume mina, kungakhulumi omunye njalo; amazwi ami ayengena kamnandi ezindlebeni zabo.
018	JOB	029	023	Babengilindela njengokulindela izulu, bawanathe amazwi ami njengezulu lentwasa.
018	JOB	029	024	Ngangisithi ngingababobothekela, bathabe bangakholwa; ukukhanya kobuso bami kwakuligugu kubo.
018	JOB	029	025	Yimi engangibakhethela ukuthi benzeni ngoba ngisanduna kubo; ngangihlala njengenkosi phakathi kwamabutho ayo; ngangifana lomduduzi wabalilayo.”
018	JOB	030	001	“Kodwa manje bayangiklolodela, amadoda angabantwana kimi, oyise engangingabehlisa ngibelusise izimvu zami.
018	JOB	030	002	Amandla ezandla zabo ayengangisiza ngani mina, ngoba amadlabuzane abo ayesephelile;
018	JOB	030	003	sebejujukile ngokuswela langendlala, bazula elizweni elomileyo emangweni eyinkangala engelalutho ebusuku.
018	JOB	030	004	Enkotheni khonale bakha imibhida emunyu, ukudla kwabo kuzimpande zezihlahla.
018	JOB	030	005	Baxotshwa ebantwini bakibo, bathethiswa kungathi babengamasela.
018	JOB	030	006	Kwasekumele bahlale ezihotsheni zezifula ezomileyo, ezimbalwini emadwaleni lemilindini emhlabathini.
018	JOB	030	007	Bakhonya phakathi kwezihlahla baququbala ezixukwini.
018	JOB	030	008	Base bengabantu abaphansi abangaselabizo, sebexotshiwe elizweni.
018	JOB	030	009	Kodwa manje amadodana abo asengihaya ngengoma; sengiyisiga kubo.
018	JOB	030	010	Bayangenyanya njalo bamela khatshana lami; kabathikazi ukungikhafulela ebusweni.
018	JOB	030	011	Khathesi njengoba uNkulunkulu eselithukulule idandili lami wangitshaya ngezinhlupheko, sebeklamasa kabasazithinti.
018	JOB	030	012	Kwesokunene kwami ixuku liyangihlasela; bathiya inyawo zami ngemijibila bakhe imibundu yokungivimbezela.
018	JOB	030	013	Badiliza indlela yami; bayaphumelela ukungibhidliza besithi ‘Akekho ozamsiza.’
018	JOB	030	014	Bahlasela ingathi bafohlela esikhaleni esivulekileyo; beza bethululeka phezu kwezinqwaba zamanxiwa.
018	JOB	030	015	Ukwesaba okukhulu kungiphethe; isithunzi sami sobuntu singathi siphethwe ngumoya, ukuvikeleka kwami kunyamalala njengeyezi.
018	JOB	030	016	Manje impilo yami isincipha; insuku zokuhlupheka zingibambe nko.
018	JOB	030	017	Ubusuku bugwaza amathambo ami; lokuqaqamba kobuhlungu bami kakupheli.
018	JOB	030	018	Ngamandla akhe amakhulu uNkulunkulu unjengelembu kimi; uyangikhama ngamabheqe entanyeni yami.
018	JOB	030	019	Ungivoxela edakeni, ngicina sengiluthuli lomlotha.
018	JOB	030	020	Ngikhala kuwe, Oh Nkulunkulu, kodwa kawuphenduli; ngiyasukuma, kodwa uyangikhangela kuphela.
018	JOB	030	021	Ungisukela ngesihluku; ungihlasela ngamandla esandla sakho.
018	JOB	030	022	Uyangihlwitha ngiphetshulwe ngumoya; ngiphoseke le lale phakathi kwesiphepho.
018	JOB	030	023	Ngiyazi ukuthi uzangilalisa phansi ekufeni, endaweni emiselwe konke okuphilayo.
018	JOB	030	024	Ngempela kakho ombeka isandla umuntu oswelayo nxa ekhalela ukusizwa esebunzimeni.
018	JOB	030	025	Kangibakhalelanga yini labo abahluphekileyo? Umoya wami kawubazwelanga usizi abayanga na?
018	JOB	030	026	Kodwa ngathi ngilindele ubuhle, kweza ububi; ngathi ngilindele ukukhanya kweza ubumnyama.
018	JOB	030	027	Ukudunguluka ngaphakathi kwami kakukhawuli; insuku zokuhlupheka zingijamele.
018	JOB	030	028	Ngihamba nje ngimnyama kubi, kungesikutshiswa lilanga; ngiyasukuma enkundleni ngicele uncedo.
018	JOB	030	029	Sengingumfowabo wamakhanka, umkhula wezikhova.
018	JOB	030	030	Isikhumba sami siba mnyama, siyaxathuka; umzimba wami uyatshisa ngomkhuhlane.
018	JOB	030	031	Ichacho lami selilungiselwe isililo, lomqangala wami ulindele umkhosi wokukhala.”
018	JOB	031	001	“Ngasenza isivumelwano lamehlo ami ukuthi angakhangeli intombi ayihawukele.
018	JOB	031	002	Siyini isabelo somuntu asabelwe nguNkulunkulu ophezulu na, ilifa lakhe elivela kuSomandla phezulu?
018	JOB	031	003	Akusikubhujiswa kwababi lokutshabalaliswa kwalabo abenza okubi na?
018	JOB	031	004	Kanti kaziboni yini izindlela zami abale zonke izinyathelo zami?
018	JOB	031	005	Nxa ngike ngahamba ngokwamanga loba unyawo lwami lwakhuthalela inkohliso
018	JOB	031	006	uNkulunkulu akangikale esikalini sakhe esiqotho ukuze abone ukuthi angilasici,
018	JOB	031	007	nxa izinyathelo zami zike zaphambuka endleleni, nxa inhliziyo yami ikhokhelwe ngamehlo ami, noma kumbe izandla zami zike zangcoliswa,
018	JOB	031	008	lapho-ke abanye kabazidlele lokho engikuhlanyeleyo, njalo amabele ami kawasitshunwe.
018	JOB	031	009	Nxa inhliziyo yami ike yakhangwa ngowesifazane, kumbe nxa ngike ngacathama ngasemnyango kamakhelwane,
018	JOB	031	010	lapho-ke owami umfazi kacholele enye indoda, njalo amanye amadoda kawalale laye.
018	JOB	031	011	Ngoba lokho bekuzakuba lihlazo, isono esifanele ukwahlulelwa.
018	JOB	031	012	Kungumlilo otshisayo onguMaqothula; ngabe kwasiphuna isivuno sami.
018	JOB	031	013	Nxa ngingaphathanga kuhle izisebenzi zami, esesilisa lesesifazane nxa kukhona abakusolayo kimi,
018	JOB	031	014	ngizakuthini lapho uNkulunkulu esengibuza ngakho na? Ngizaphendula ngithini nxa sekumele ngichaze na?
018	JOB	031	015	Yena lowo owangenzayo esibelethweni kabenzanga labo na? Kasuye yini yena kanye owasenzayo sonke phakathi kwezisu zabomama na?
018	JOB	031	016	Nxa ngilahlele eceleni izifiso zabayanga loba ngayekela amehlo omfelokazi edinwa yizinyembezi,
018	JOB	031	017	nxa ngizidlele ngedwa isinkwa sami, ngingasabelani lezintandane,
018	JOB	031	018	kodwa ebutsheni bami ngabondla njengaboyise, njalo kusukela ekuzalweni kwami ngamkhokhela umfelokazi,
018	JOB	031	019	nxa ngike ngabona umuntu esifa ngokuswela izigqoko, loba umuntu oswelayo engelasivunulo,
018	JOB	031	020	njalo inhliziyo yakhe ayingibusisanga ngokumfudumeza ngoboya bezimvu zami,
018	JOB	031	021	nxa ngike ngaphakamisa isandla sami phezu kwentandane, kodwa mina ngikwazi ukuthi bayangilalela emthethwandaba,
018	JOB	031	022	nxa kunjalo kayikhumuke ingalo yami kusukela ehlombe, kayephulwe endololwaneni.
018	JOB	031	023	Ngoba ngesaba ukubhubhisa kukaNkulunkulu, kwathi ngokwesaba inkazimulo yakhe, ngayekela ukwenza izinto ezinjalo.
018	JOB	031	024	Nxa ngifake ithemba lami phezu kwegolide, loba ngathi kulo igolide elicolekileyo, ‘Ulithemba lami,’
018	JOB	031	025	nxa bengithokoziswa yinotho yami enengi, lenzuzo evele ngezandla zami,
018	JOB	031	026	nxa ngilikhangele ilanga libenyezela loba inyanga ihamba ngenkazimulo,
018	JOB	031	027	yaze yayengeka inhliziyo yami ngaphakathi nganga isandla sami ukuzikhonza,
018	JOB	031	028	lezi lazo yizono ebezifanele ukwahlulelwa, ngoba bengizabe ngingathembekanga kuNkulunkulu ophezulu.
018	JOB	031	029	Nxa ngike ngathokoza ngomnyama owehlele isitha sami kumbe ngagqabhaza ngohlupho olumehleleyo,
018	JOB	031	030	kangivumelanga umlomo wami ukuba wenze isono ngokuqalekisa ukuphila kwakhe,
018	JOB	031	031	nxa abantu bendlu yami bengakaze bathi, ‘Ngubani ongazange azitike ngenyama kaJobe na?’
018	JOB	031	032	kodwa kakulasihambi esake salala emgwaqweni, ngoba umnyango wami wawuhlala uvulelwe izihambi
018	JOB	031	033	nxa ngisithukuzile isono sami njengokwenziwa ngabantu, ngokufihla umlandu wami enhliziyweni yami
018	JOB	031	034	ngoba ngisesaba abantu ngithuthunyeliswa yikweyiswa ngabosendo ngazithulela ngaze ngala lokuphumela phandle.
018	JOB	031	035	(Oh, kube ukhona ongizwayo! Sengisayina incwadi yokuzivikela kwami, uSomandla kangiphendule; ongimangalelayo kabhale phansi icala angethesa lona.
018	JOB	031	036	Leyoncwadi ngingayithwala ehlombe lami, ngingayithwala ekhanda njengomqhele.
018	JOB	031	037	Bengingamchazela ngokugcweleyo ngazozonke izinyathelo zami; ngisondele kuye njengenkosana.)
018	JOB	031	038	Nxa ilizwe lakithi lingiphika lemifolo yalo imanzi ngezinyembezi,
018	JOB	031	039	nxa ngike ngadla izithelo zalo angaze ngabhadala loba ngephula imimoya yabanikazi,
018	JOB	031	040	nxa kunjalo kakumile ameva esikhundleni sengqoloyi, lokhula esikhundleni sebhali.” Aphela lapha amazwi kaJobe.
018	JOB	032	001	Amadoda la womathathu ema ukuphendula uJobe ngoba wayelungile ngokubona kwakhe.
018	JOB	032	002	Kodwa u-Elihu indodana kaBharakeli umBhuzi, owendlu kaRamu, wamzondela uJobe ngokuzigeza yena endaweni yokugezwa nguNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	032	003	Wayebazondele njalo labangane labo bobathathu ngoba babengayitholanga indlela yokuphikisa uJobe kodwa bemlahlile ngokumsola.
018	JOB	032	004	U-Elihu wayeke wema ukukhuluma loJobe ngoba babebadala kulaye.
018	JOB	032	005	Kodwa kwathi esebona ukuthi wonke amadoda womathathu ayengaselalutho ayengalutsho, ulaka lwakhe lwavutha.
018	JOB	032	006	Ngakho-ke u-Elihu indodana kaBharakeli umBhuzi wathi: “Ngimncinyane ngeminyaka, lina libadala; yikho bengisesaba, ngithikaza ukutsho engikwaziyo.
018	JOB	032	007	Ngikhumbule ngathi, ‘Kakukhulume ubudala; iminyaka yokukhula kayifundise ukuhlakanipha.’
018	JOB	032	008	Kodwa kungumoya osemuntwini, ukuphefumula kukaSomandla, okumupha ukuqedisisa.
018	JOB	032	009	Kakusibo bodwa abadala abahlakaniphileyo, njalo kakusibo bodwa abalupheleyo abakuzwisisayo okulungileyo.
018	JOB	032	010	Ngakho ngithi: Lalelani kimi; lami ngizalitshela engikwaziyo.
018	JOB	032	011	Bengithule lisakhuluma, ngikulalele ukucabanga kwenu; lathi lisadinga amazwi,
018	JOB	032	012	ngalilalela ngokupheleleyo. Kodwa kakho lamunye kini otshengise ukuthi uJobe ulahlekile; kakho omunye wenu osephendule imibono yakhe.
018	JOB	032	013	Lingaze lathi, ‘Sesikutholile ukuhlakanipha; uNkulunkulu kaveze ukuphosisa kwakhe, hatshi umuntu.’
018	JOB	032	014	Kodwa uJobe kakaqondisisi amazwi akhe kimi, futhi kangiyikumphendula ngendlela yenu yokuphikisa.
018	JOB	032	015	Sebededile kabaselakho okunye abangakutsho; sebesilela amazwi.
018	JOB	032	016	Ngike ngime na njengoba sebethule, sebemi nje laphayana bengaselampendulo?
018	JOB	032	017	Lami ngisake ngikhulume; lami ngizakutsho engikwaziyo.
018	JOB	032	018	Ngoba manengi amazwi engilawo, umoya ongaphakathi kwami uyangifuqa;
018	JOB	032	019	ngaphakathi ngiyafuthelana njengewayini elivalelwe embodleleni; njengemixhaka yewayini esifuna ukudubuka.
018	JOB	032	020	Kumele ngikhulume ukuze ngibhodle; kumele ngivule indebe zami ngiphendule.
018	JOB	032	021	Kangizukutshengisa ubandlululo loba kukubani, futhi kangisoze ngiyenge muntu;
018	JOB	032	022	ngoba ngabe ngangiligabazi ekukhulumeni, uMenzi wami ubezangisusa masinyane.”
018	JOB	033	001	“Khathesi-ke, Jobe, lalela amazwi ami; lalelisisa konke engikutshoyo.
018	JOB	033	002	Sengizawuvula umlomo wami; amazwi ami asesolimini lwami.
018	JOB	033	003	Amazwi ami aphuma enhliziyweni eqotho; izindebe zami zikhuluma ngokukholwa lokho engikwaziyo.
018	JOB	033	004	UMoya kaNkulunkulu wangenza; umphefumulo kaSomandla ungipha impilo.
018	JOB	033	005	Ngiphendula nxa usenelisa; zilungiselele ukuthi ungiphikise.
018	JOB	033	006	Lami nginjengawe phambi kukaNkulunkulu; lami njalo ngathathwa emhlabathini.
018	JOB	033	007	Ukungesaba kwakho makungakwethusi, njalo isandla sami masingasindi kuwe.
018	JOB	033	008	Kodwa ukhulumile ngisizwa, ngiwezwile amazwi wona kanye,
018	JOB	033	009	‘Ngimsulwa njalo kangilasono; ngihlanzekile kangilamlandu.
018	JOB	033	010	Ikanti uNkulunkulu ubone okusolekayo kimi; ungithatha njengesitha sakhe.
018	JOB	033	011	Uyazikhina inyawo zami ngezibopho; uyaziqaphelisisa zonke izindlela zami.’
018	JOB	033	012	Kodwa ngiyakutshela ukuthi lapha uyalahleka, uNkulunkulu mkhulu kulomuntu.
018	JOB	033	013	Kungani umsola usithi kaphenduli amazwi omuntu na?
018	JOB	033	014	Ngempela uNkulunkulu uyakhuluma, khathesi akhulume ngale indlela, aphinde akhulume ngenye lokuba umuntu angaze akunanzelela.
018	JOB	033	015	Kungaba ngephupho, kube ngombono ebusuku lapho abantu belele befile bethe nya emibhedeni yabo,
018	JOB	033	016	angakhuluma ezindlebeni zabo, abethuse ngezixwayiso,
018	JOB	033	017	ukuze aguqule umuntu ekwenzeni okubi aqede ukuzikhukhumeza kwakhe,
018	JOB	033	018	ukulondoloza umphefumulo wakhe ungayi egodini, lempilo yakhe ingabhubhi ngenkemba.
018	JOB	033	019	Loba umuntu angajeziswa ngobuhlungu esembhedeni wakhe, langokuqaqamba okungathuliyo emathanjeni akhe,
018	JOB	033	020	aze ezwe umzimba wakhe usunengwa yikudla lomoya wakhe usenyanya lokudla okumnandi kakhulu.
018	JOB	033	021	Inyama yakhe iyacikizeka iphele, lamathambo akhe ayekade evaliwe abonakale egcekeni.
018	JOB	033	022	Umoya wakhe uyasondela egodini, lempilo yakhe kuzo izithunywa zokufa.
018	JOB	033	023	Kodwa nxa kulengilosi eceleni kwakhe, engumeli, eyodwa phakathi kwenkulungwane, ukutshela umuntu okuyikho okumfaneleyo,
018	JOB	033	024	ukuba lomusa kuye isithi, ‘Mxolele angayingena egodini; sengimzuzele inhlawulo yakhe yokumhlenga
018	JOB	033	025	bese inyama yakhe ivuselelwa njengeyomntwana; iyavuselelwa ibe njengezinsukwini zobutsha bakhe.’
018	JOB	033	026	Uyakhuleka kuNkulunkulu amthokozele, abubone ubuso bukaNkulunkulu amemeze ngentokozo; uyabuyiselwa nguNkulunkulu esimeni sakhe sokulunga.
018	JOB	033	027	Kuthi-ke abesebuya ebantwini athi, ‘Ngenza isono, ngahlanekela okulungileyo, kodwa kangisazuzanga obekungifanele.
018	JOB	033	028	Wawuhlenga umphefumulo wami ukuze ungayi egodini, ngakho ngizaphila ukuze ngikholise ukukhanya.’
018	JOB	033	029	UNkulunkulu uyazenza zonke lezizinto emuntwini kabili, noma kathathu
018	JOB	033	030	ukubuyisa umphefumulo wakhe ungayi egodini, ukuthi isibane sokuphila sikhanye kuye.
018	JOB	033	031	Nanzelela, Jobe, ulalele kimi; thula kukhulume mina.
018	JOB	033	032	Nxa ulolutho lokutsho, ngiphendula; khuluma sibili, ngoba ngifuna ukuthi ugezwe umlandu.
018	JOB	033	033	Kodwa nxa lungekho lalela kimi; thula zwi mina ngizakufundisa ukuhlakanipha.”
018	JOB	034	001	U-Elihu waqhubeka esithi:
018	JOB	034	002	“Zwanini amazwi ami, lina madoda ahlakaniphileyo; lalelani kimi, lina madoda ayizifundiswa.
018	JOB	034	003	Phela indlebe iyawahlola amazwi njengolimi lunambitha ukudla.
018	JOB	034	004	Asizihluzeleni thina okulungileyo; kasifundeni ndawonye okuhle.
018	JOB	034	005	UJobe uthi, ‘Kangilacala, kodwa uNkulunkulu kangahluleli ngokulunga.
018	JOB	034	006	Loba mina ngiqondile, kuthiwa ngilamanga; loba ngingelacala, umtshoko wakhe ungihlaba isilonda esingelaphekiyo.’
018	JOB	034	007	UJobe kanti ungumuntu bani, onatha ukuklolodela njengamanzi?
018	JOB	034	008	Uzwanana labantu abenza ububi; uhambisana labantu ababi.
018	JOB	034	009	Ngoba uthi, ‘Umuntu kakumsizi ngalutho ukuzama ukuthokozisa uNkulunkulu.’
018	JOB	034	010	Ngakho lalelani kimi lina madoda azwisisayo. Kakube khatshana laye uNkulunkulu ukwenza ububi, khatshana kukaSomandla ukona.
018	JOB	034	011	Uyamphindisela umuntu ngalokho akwenzileyo; umehlisela lokho okufanele ukuziphatha kwakhe.
018	JOB	034	012	Kakungeni engqondweni ukuthi uNkulunkulu angenza ububi, ukuthi uSomandla angakutshila ukwahlulela ngokulunga.
018	JOB	034	013	Ngubani owambekayo phezu komhlaba na? Ngubani owathi kalawule umhlaba wonke na?
018	JOB	034	014	Aluba wayengathanda asuse umoya wakhe lokuphefumula,
018	JOB	034	015	bonke abantu babengatshabalala kanyekanye, umuntu wayezabuyela othulini.
018	JOB	034	016	Nxa lilokuzwisisa, zwanini lokhu; lalelani lokhu engikutshoyo.
018	JOB	034	017	Kambe lowo ozonda ukwahlulela ngokulunga angabusa na? Liyamlahla yini Yena oqotho njalo olamandla?
018	JOB	034	018	Kayisuye yini othi emakhosini, ‘Kalisizi lutho,’ athi kwabayizikhulu, ‘Libabi,’
018	JOB	034	019	ongatshengisi ukwazisa amakhosana kulabanye loba athande abanothileyo kulabayanga, ngoba bonke bangumsebenzi wezandla zakhe?
