018	JOB	034	021	Amehlo akhe aphezu kwezindlela zabantu; ubona zonke izinyathelo zabo.
018	JOB	034	022	Akulandawo emnyama loba ithunzi elisithileyo, lapho abenzi bobubi abangacatsha khona.
018	JOB	034	023	UNkulunkulu kasweli ukuthi aphinde abahlolisise abantu, ukuze abalethe ekwahlulelweni phambi kwakhe.
018	JOB	034	024	Engaqalanga wahlola uyabaphahlaza abalamandla abeke abanye endaweni yabo.
