018	JOB	035	001	U-Elihu wasesithi:
018	JOB	035	002	“Ukhumbula ukuthi lokhu kulungile yini? Uthi, ‘Ngizagezwa nguNkulunkulu.’
018	JOB	035	003	Kodwa uyambuza uthi, ‘Kungisiza ngani lokhu na, njalo ngizuzani ngokungenzi isono?’
018	JOB	035	004	Ngithanda ukukuphendula kanye labangane bakho abalapha.
018	JOB	035	005	Ake ukhangele emazulwini ubone; khangela amayezi aphakeme kangaka ngaphezu kwakho.
018	JOB	035	006	Ungaze wenze isono, lokho kumthinta ngani na? Nxa izono zakho zizinengi, kwenzani lokho kuye na?
018	JOB	035	007	Nxa ulungile, kuyini omnika khona wena na, kumbe yena wamukelani esandleni sakho?
018	JOB	035	008	Ububi bakho bulimaza kuphela umuntu onjengawe, lokulunga kwakho kuthinta amadodana abantu kuphela.
018	JOB	035	009	Abantu bayakhala ngomthwalo wokuncindezelwa; bacela ukuphunyuzwa ezingalweni zalabo abalamandla.
018	JOB	035	010	Kodwa kakho othi, ‘Ungaphi uNkulunkulu uMenzi wami na, opha amahubo ebusuku,
018	JOB	035	011	osifundisayo thina kulezinyamazana zalapha emhlabeni asenze sihlakaniphe kulezinyoni zasemoyeni?’
018	JOB	035	012	Kaphenduli nxa abantu bebiza ngenxa yokuziphakamisa kwababi.
018	JOB	035	013	Ngempela uNkulunkulu kakulaleli ukuncenga kwabo kwamanga; uSomandla kayilaleli into enjalo.
018	JOB	035	014	Kuzakuba njani pho, angakulalela nxa usithi kawumboni, usithi indaba yakho iphambi kwakhe ngakho kuzamele ulinde yena,
018	JOB	035	015	njalo futhi, ukuthi ulaka lwakhe kalujezisi njalo akabunanzi lakancane ububi.
018	JOB	035	016	Yikho uJobe evula umlomo wakhe ekhuluma ize; ngokuswela ulwazi wandisa amazwi.”
018	JOB	036	001	U-Elihu waqhubeka esithi:
018	JOB	036	002	“Ake lingibekezelele okwesikhatshana ukuze ngilitshengise ukuthi kunengi okumele kutshiwo ngobuhle bukaNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	036	003	Ngiluzuza kude ulwazi lwami; ngithi ukwahlulela okulungileyo ngokukaMenzi wami.
018	JOB	036	004	Yiba leqiniso ukuthi amazwi ami aqinisile; yena opheleleyo elwazini ulawe.
018	JOB	036	005	UNkulunkulu ulamandla, kodwa keyisi muntu; ulamandla njalo katshedi ezimisweni zakhe.
018	JOB	036	006	Ababi kabayekeli bephila kodwa abahluphekayo uyabapha okubafaneleyo.
018	JOB	036	007	Kawasusi amehlo akhe kwabalungileyo; ubakhweza esihlalweni kanye lamakhosi abaphakamise nini lanini.
018	JOB	036	008	Kodwa nxa abantu bebotshwe ngamaketane, bethiwe nko ngezibopho zezinhlupheko,
018	JOB	036	009	uyabatshela lokho abakwenzileyo, ukuthi benze isono ngokuziphakamisa.
018	JOB	036	010	Ubenza balalele ukuqondiswa abalaye ukuthi baphenduke ebubini babo.
018	JOB	036	011	Nxa bemlalela bamkhonze, zonke insuku zabo eziseleyo zizaphumelela, leminyaka yabo ibe ngeyokusuthiseka.
018	JOB	036	012	Kodwa nxa bengalaleli, bazabhubha ngenkemba, bafe bengelalwazi.
018	JOB	036	013	Abangamesabiyo uNkulunkulu bagodle ukusola enhliziyweni; loba angaze ababophe kabaceli ukusizwa.
018	JOB	036	014	Bafa besesebatsha, bephakathi kweziphingi ezingamadoda, ezihlala ezindaweni zokukhonzela.
018	JOB	036	015	Kodwa labo abahluphekayo uyabakhulula ekuhluphekeni kwabo; ukhuluma labo besezinkathazweni zabo.
018	JOB	036	016	Uyakulimukisa ukuthi uphume emihlathini yosizi uye endaweni ebanzi, ekhululekileyo njalo engelazibopho, ebumnandini betafula yakho igcwele izidlo ezimnandi.
018	JOB	036	017	Kodwa manje usindwa yikwahlulelwa okulungele ababi; ukuthonisiswa lokwahlulelwa ngokulunga yikho osekukuduba.
018	JOB	036	018	Qaphela kungabikhona okulingayo ngenotho; ungavumeli ukuthengwa ngemali kukususe endleleni.
018	JOB	036	019	Kambe inotho yakho loba konke ukutshikatshika kwakho kungakusekela ukuze ungangeni osizini na?
018	JOB	036	020	Ungalangazeleli ubusuku, ukuze uyohudula abantu ezindaweni zabo.
018	JOB	036	021	Qaphela ungangeni kokubi, okukhanya ingathi uyakuthanda kulokuhlupheka.
018	JOB	036	022	UNkulunkulu uphakeme ngamandla akhe. Ngubani ongafundisa njengaye na?
018	JOB	036	023	Ngubani omisele izindlela zakhe na, loba othe kuye, ‘Usuwenze okungalunganga?’
018	JOB	036	024	Khumbula ukukhulisa umsebenzi wakhe, abantu abawudumisileyo ngengoma.
018	JOB	036	025	Bonke abantu jikelele bakubonile lokhu; abantu bakukhangela bemi khatshana.
018	JOB	036	026	Ubukhulu bukaNkulunkulu bungaphezulu kokuzwisisa kwethu! Iminyaka yakhe ingezake yaziwe.
018	JOB	036	027	Uyawadonsa amathonsi amanzi, aqulungane abe lizulu elingena ezifuleni;
