018	JOB	036	029	Ngubani ongakuzwisisa ukuthi uwendlala njani amayezi na, ukuthi ukhwaza njani esesiqongweni sakhe na?
018	JOB	036	030	Ake libone ukuthi uwuhlakaza njani umbane wakhe azizingelezele ngawo, abhukutshe ezinzikini zolwandle.
018	JOB	036	031	Yiyo indlela abusa ngayo izizwe aziphe ukudla okunengi.
018	JOB	036	032	Ugcwalisa izandla zakhe ngombane awukhombise lapho omele utshaye khona.
018	JOB	036	033	Ukuduma kwakhe kubika isiphepho esizayo; lenkomo ziyatshengisa ukuza kwaso.”
018	JOB	037	001	“Konke lokhu kwenza inhliziyo yami itshaye ize itshede endaweni yayo.
018	JOB	037	002	Lalela! Lalela ukubhonga kwelizwi lakhe, ukuzamazama okuphuma emlonyeni wakhe.
018	JOB	037	003	Uyawukhulula umbane wakhe ngaphansi kwawo wonke amazulu awuthumele emikhawulweni yomhlaba.
018	JOB	037	004	Ngemva kwalokho kuza umdumo wokubhonga kwakhe; uduma ngelizwi lakhe lobukhosi. Nxa ilizwi lakhe seliqaqamba ulikhulula lonke angaligodli.
018	JOB	037	005	Ilizwi likaNkulunkulu liduma ngezindlela ezimangalisayo; wenza izinto ezinkulu ngaphezu kokuzwisisa kwethu.
018	JOB	037	006	Utshela ungqwaqwane athi, ‘Khithika phezu komhlaba,’ lezulu athi kulo, ‘Thululeka ube yisihlambo esikhulu.’
018	JOB	037	007	Ukuze kuthi bonke abantu abadalayo bakwazi ukusebenza kwakhe, uyamisa umuntu wonke emsebenzini wakhe.
018	JOB	037	008	Izinyamazana ziyacatsha; zihlale ezikhundleni zazo.
018	JOB	037	009	Isiphepho siyaphuma ekamelweni laso, umqando uphume entshongolweni esikayo.
018	JOB	037	010	Ukuphefumula kukaNkulunkulu kukhupha iliqhwa, amanzi aluwaca ajiye abe yilitshe.
018	JOB	037	011	Ugcwalisa amayezi ngamanzi; ahlakaze umbane wakhe ngawo.
018	JOB	037	012	Ngokuqondisa kwakhe ayaqhela embese umhlaba wonke ukuze enze loba yini awalaya yona.
018	JOB	037	013	Uyawaletha amayezi ajezise ngawo abantu, loba ukuthelezela umhlaba wakhe ukuze atshengise uthando lwakhe.
018	JOB	037	014	Lalela lokhu, Jobe; akume ukhumbule izimangaliso zikaNkulunkulu.
018	JOB	037	015	Uyakwazi na ukuthi uNkulunkulu uwalawula njani amayezi enze umbane wakhe ulavuke?
018	JOB	037	016	Uyakwazi na ukuthi amayezi emi njani elengile, leyomimangaliso yakhe yena lowo opheleleyo elwazini?
018	JOB	037	017	Wena oginqiswa yikutshisa kwezigqoko zakho nxa umhlaba uthule zwi kubetha umoya waseningizimu,
