018	JOB	037	023	USomandla asingeke simfinyelele njalo uphakeme ulamandla; ekwahluleleni kwakhe okuhle lokulunga okukhulu kancindezeli.
018	JOB	037	024	Ngakho-ke abantu bayamhlonipha, ngoba kanti kabanaki yini bonke abahlakaniphileyo enhliziyweni?”
018	JOB	038	001	UThixo wasekhuluma loJobe ephakathi kwesiphepho. Wathi:
018	JOB	038	002	“Ngubani na lowo odunga amacebo ami ngamazwi okungazi?
018	JOB	038	003	Qina njengendoda; ngizakubuza, lawe uzangiphendula.
018	JOB	038	004	Wawungaphi lapho ngibeka izisekelo zomhlaba na? Ngitshela nxa uqedisisa.
018	JOB	038	005	Ngubani owamisa izilinganiso zawo na? Phela angithi uyazi! Ngubani owayidonsayo intambo yokulinganisa kuwo na?
018	JOB	038	006	Izinsika zawo zamiswa phezu kwani na, loba ngubani owamisa ilitshe lawo lekhoneni na
018	JOB	038	007	lapho izinkanyezi zokusa zazihlabelela kanyekanye lezingilosi zonke zamemeza ngentokozo?
018	JOB	038	008	Ngubani owavalela ulwandle ngemva kwezivalo lapho selufohla esiswini na,
