018	JOB	038	012	Sewake wabekela ikuseni umthetho na, loba watshengisa ukusa indawo yakho
018	JOB	038	013	ukuba kuphakamise umhlaba ngemiphetho kuthintithe ababi abakuwo?
018	JOB	038	014	Umhlaba ubumbeka isimo njengebumba ufakwe uphawu; imibala yawo ikhanye ithi bha njengelembu.
018	JOB	038	015	Ababi bayacitshelwa ukukhanya, lengalo yabo ephakanyisiweyo iyephulwa.
018	JOB	038	016	Sewake wahamba emithonjeni yolwandle na loba wahamba ezingoxweni zenziki yalo na?
018	JOB	038	017	Amasango okufa aseke abonakaliswa kuwe na? Usuke wawabona amasango ethunzi lokufa na?
018	JOB	038	018	Ubuqedisisile na ubukhulu bobubanzi bomhlaba? Ngitshela nxa ukwazi konke lokhu.
018	JOB	038	019	Yiphi indlela eya ekhaya elihlala ukukhanya na? Ubumnyama bona buhlala ngaphi?
018	JOB	038	020	Ungakusa ezindaweni zakho na? Uyazazi izindlela eziya emizini yazo na?
018	JOB	038	021	Ye uyakwazi, ngoba wawuvele usuzelwe! Usuphile iminyaka yonke le!
018	JOB	038	022	Sewake wangena eziphaleni zikangqwaqwane loba wabona iziphala zesiqhotho na,
