018	JOB	038	024	Ingaphi indlela eya esigodlweni sokwaba umbane, loba indawo yokuhlakaza umoya wempumalanga phezu komhlaba na?
018	JOB	038	025	Ngubani ogubhe intshukuntshu yezihlambo zezulu, lendlela yomdumo wesiphepho;
018	JOB	038	026	ukuthelezela ilizwe elingahlali muntu, inkangala okungelamuntu kuyo,
018	JOB	038	027	ukusuthisa ilizwe elilugwadule kulenze lihlume utshani na?
018	JOB	038	028	Izulu elinayo liloyise na? Ngubani onguyise wamathonsi amazolo na?
018	JOB	038	029	Ngesikabani isisu esizala iliqhwa na? Ngubani ozala umtshazo ovela phezulu na
018	JOB	038	030	lapho amanzi abalukhuni njengelitshe, lapho iphezulu yolwandle ijiyile?
018	JOB	038	031	Ungasibopha na isiLimela lesi esihle? Ungazithukulula yini izintambo zeziNja?
018	JOB	038	032	Ungawuletha na uMthala ngesikhathi sawo loba ukhuphe inkanyezi ethiwa yiNgulube lemidlwane yayo?
018	JOB	038	033	Uyayazi imithetho yasezulwini na? Ungawakha yini umbuso kaNkulunkulu emhlabeni?
018	JOB	038	034	Ungawamemeza yini amayezi uthi akunethise ngesihlambo samanzi?
018	JOB	038	035	Uyakuthuma yini ukuphazima kombane? Uyabika kuwe yini uthi, ‘Ngilapha’?
018	JOB	038	036	Ngubani owapha inhliziyo ukuhlakanipha kumbe owapha ingqondo ukuzwisisa na?
018	JOB	038	037	Ngubani ololwazi lokubala amayezi na? Ngubani ongagenqula amaqhaga asezulwini na
018	JOB	038	038	nxa uthuli seluqina lamagade omhlabathi esebumbene?
018	JOB	038	039	Uyasizingelela na isilwanekazi ukudla kwaso, uyiqede indlala yezilwane
018	JOB	038	040	lapho zilele ezikhundleni zazo kumbe zicwathile ezixukwini?
018	JOB	038	041	Ngubani opha iwabayi ukudla lapho amatsiyane alo ekhala kuNkulunkulu ezulazula ehayila ngendlala na?”
018	JOB	039	001	“Uyakwazi na ukuthi amagogo azala nini? Uyawubukele yini nxa impalakazi izala izinyane layo?
018	JOB	039	002	Uyawuzibale yini izinyanga zize zizale? Uyasazi isikhathi ezizazala ngaso na?
018	JOB	039	003	Ziyalala phansi zizale abantwana bazo; kube sekuphela ubuhlungu bokuhelelwa kwazo.
018	JOB	039	004	Amazinyane azo ayaqina akhule abe lamandla egangeni; ayasuka ahambe angabuyi.
018	JOB	039	005	Ngubani owakhulula ubabhemi weganga na? Ngubani owathukulula igoda lakhe na?
018	JOB	039	006	Ngamupha ugwadule lwaba likhaya lakhe, lenkangala yetswayi ibe ngumango wakhe.
018	JOB	039	007	Uyazincifela iziphithiphithi zedolobho; kakuzwa ukukhahlanyezwa ngumtshayeli.
018	JOB	039	008	Uyazihambela abhode izintaba emadlelweni akhe edinga loba yini eluhlaza.
018	JOB	039	009	Inyathi kambe izavuma ukukusebenzela na? Izahlala esibayeni sakho ebusuku na?
018	JOB	039	010	Ungayibamba ngomchilo ulime ngayo na? Ingazilima na izigodi zakho?
018	JOB	039	011	Ungayithemba yini ngenxa yamandla ayo amakhulu na? Ungawuyekelela yona umsebenzi wakho onzima na?
018	JOB	039	012	Ungayithemba ukuthi izalayitsha amabele akho na iwase esizeni?
018	JOB	039	013	Impiko zentshe zitshaya kakuhle, kodwa ngeke zilinganiswe lempiko kanye lezinsiba zengabuzane.
018	JOB	039	014	Ibekela amaqanda ayo emhlabathini iwayekele afudumale etshebetshebeni,
018	JOB	039	015	inganakananga ukuthi unyawo oluthile lungawahlifiza, ukuthi inyamazana yeganga ethile ingawanyathela.
018	JOB	039	016	Amatsiyane ayo iyawakhahlameza, kube sengathi akusi wayo; ingakhathali ukuthi ukubekela kwayo kwaba yize,
018	JOB	039	017	ngoba uNkulunkulu kayiphanga ukuhlakanipha loba ingqondo yokubona okufaneleyo.
018	JOB	039	018	Kodwa nxa isiselula impiko zayo ukuthi igijime, iyalihleka ibhiza lomgadi walo.
018	JOB	039	019	Uyalipha na wena ibhiza amandla kumbe ugqokise intamo yalo ngomhlonga na?
018	JOB	039	020	Uyalenza leqe njengentethe na, lingethuse ngokuhwabha kwalo kokuziqenya?
018	JOB	039	021	Liyaphanda ngenkani, lithokoziswa ngamandla alo, lidlubulunde lihlasela isitha.
018	JOB	039	022	Liyakuhleka ukwesaba, kalesabi lutho; kaliyikhekhelezi inkemba.
018	JOB	039	023	Umxhaka wemitshoko ukhehlezela emhlubulweni walo, ndawonye lomkhonto obenyezelayo kanye lomdikadika.
018	JOB	039	024	Liyafuthelana ngamadlabuzane ligijime limbe phansi; kakulivumeli ukuma nxa icilongo selikhala.
018	JOB	039	025	Konela ukuthi likhale icilongo lihwabhe lithi, ‘Aha!’ Lihle lilizwe iphunga lempi isesekhatshana, ukukhwaza kwezinduna lomkhosi wempi.
018	JOB	039	026	Ukhozi luphatshiswa yikuhlakanipha kwakho na lwelule impiko zalo ziqonde eningizimu?
018	JOB	039	027	Ukhozi luntweza ngokutshelwa nguwe yini kanye lokwakhela isidleke salo esiqongweni?
018	JOB	039	028	Luhlala eliweni, lulale khona ebusuku; idwala elililiwa yilo inqaba yalo.
018	JOB	039	029	Ludinga ukudla kwayo lusuka khona; amehlo alo akubona ekude.
018	JOB	039	030	Amatsiyane alo azitika ngegazi, kuthi lapho okulokubuleweyo khona lalo lukhona.”
018	JOB	040	001	UThixo wathi kuJobe:
018	JOB	040	002	“Lowo ophikisana loSomandla angamqondisa na? Yena lowo obeka uNkulunkulu icala kamphendule!”
018	JOB	040	003	Ngakho uJobe wasephendula uThixo wathi:
018	JOB	040	004	“Kakungilingananga, ngingakuphendula njani na? Ngivala umlomo wami ngesandla sami.
018	JOB	040	005	Ngikhulumile kanye, kodwa kangilampendulo, kabili, kodwa kangisayikukhuluma njalo.”
018	JOB	040	006	UThixo wasekhuluma loJobe ephakathi kwesiphepho wathi:
018	JOB	040	007	“Qina njengendoda; ngizakubuza, wena uzangiphendula.
018	JOB	040	008	Ungakusola na ukwahlulela kwami ngokulunga? Ungangilahla ukuze uzigeze na?
018	JOB	040	009	Ulayo ingalo enjengekaNkulunkulu na, njalo ilizwi lakho lingaduma njengelakhe yini?
018	JOB	040	010	Nxa kunjalo zicecise ngobukhosi langenkazimulo, uzembathise ngodumo lobukhosi.
018	JOB	040	011	Khulula ukuvutha kolaka lwakho, khangela wonke umuntu ozigqajayo umthobise,
018	JOB	040	012	khangela wonke umuntu ozigqajayo umbeke phansi, ubacobodise ababi khonapho abakhona.
018	JOB	040	013	Bambele bonke ndawonye othulini; goqela ubuso babo engcwabeni.
018	JOB	040	014	Lapho-ke lami ngizavuma kuwe ukuthi isandla sakho sokunene singakusindisa.
018	JOB	040	015	Khangela imvubu, engayidala kanye lawe njalo edla utshani njengenkomo.
018	JOB	040	016	Ilamandla amangalisayo okhalweni lwayo, amandla angaka emisipheni yesisu sayo!
018	JOB	040	017	Umsila wayo uyazunguza njengomsedari; imisipha yemilenze yayo yalukene.
018	JOB	040	018	Amathambo ayo alezimbobo zethusi, lezitho zayo zinjengemiqwayi yensimbi.
018	JOB	040	019	Iyingqala yezidalwa zikaNkulunkulu, kodwa uMenzi wayo angayehlula ngenkemba yakhe.
018	JOB	040	020	Izintaba zimlethela izithelo zazo, kuthi zonke izilo zeganga zidlalele eduze.
018	JOB	040	021	Ilala ngaphansi kwezihlahla ezibukekayo, isithekile phakathi kwemihlanga exhaphozini.
018	JOB	040	022	Izihlahla ezinhle ziyayisitha ngemithunzi yazo; imidubu okhunjini lomfula iyihonqolozele.
018	JOB	040	023	Nxa umfula uthwele izikhukhula kayethuki; kayithi thiki lokuba iJodani ithululela impophoma emlonyeni wayo.
018	JOB	040	024	Ukhona yini ongayibamba ngamehlo, kumbe ayithiye ayibhoboze amakhala na?”
018	JOB	041	001	“Ungambamba na uLeviyathani ngewuka loba uhitshele ulimi lwakhe ngentambo na?
018	JOB	041	002	Ungawufaka umkhala yini emakhaleni akhe kumbe ubhoboze umhlathi wakhe ngewuka na?
018	JOB	041	003	Uzabe elokhu ekuncenga yini ukuthi umzwele? Uzakhuluma lawe ngamazwi apholileyo yini?
018	JOB	041	004	Uzakwenza isivumelwano lawe na ukuthi abe yisichaka sakho kokuphela?
018	JOB	041	005	Ungamenza abe yisifuyo sokudlalisa njengenyoni na kumbe umfake umkhungo adlaliswe ngamantombazana na?
018	JOB	041	006	Abathengi bazabhejelana ngentengo yakhe na? Bazakwahlukaniselana ngaye na abathengi?
018	JOB	041	007	Ungasibhoboza yini isikhumba sakhe ngenhlendla loba ikhanda lakhe ngemikhonto yokuciba inhlanzi?
018	JOB	041	008	Ungabeka isandla phezu kwakhe, uzahlala ukukhumbula ukutshukana kwenu ungaphindi futhi!
018	JOB	041	009	Ukucabanga ukuthi ungamehlula kuyize; ukumbona nje kodwa kuqeda amandla.
018	JOB	041	010	Kakho ongaba lesibindi sokuthi alwe laye. Pho ngubani ongamelana lami na?
018	JOB	041	011	Ngubani engilomlandu kuye othi kangihlawule na? Konke okukhona ngaphansi kwezulu ngokwami.
018	JOB	041	012	Kangisoze ngikhawule ukubabaza izitho zakhe, amandla akhe langesimo sakhe esihle.
018	JOB	041	013	Ngubani ongaxebula isikhumba sakhe na? Ngubani ongasondela kuye ngamatomu na?
018	JOB	041	014	Ngubani ongaqunga isibindi avule iminyango yomlomo wakhe, ogqagqelwe zingavula zamazinyo na?
018	JOB	041	015	Umhlane wakhe ulezinhlu zamahawu abophene silikici;
018	JOB	041	016	yilelo lithe mba kwelinye okuthi kakungeni moya phakathi kwawo.
018	JOB	041	017	Anamathelene ndawonye; abambene okokuthi angeke ehlukaniswe.
018	JOB	041	018	Ukuthimula kwakhe kukhupha inhlansi zomlilo; amehlo akhe anjengemisebe yokusa.
018	JOB	041	019	Amalangabi omlilo alavuka emlonyeni wakhe; inhlansi zomlilo ziqhatsha ziphuma khona.
018	JOB	041	020	Intuthu ithunqa iphuma emakhaleni akhe kungathi isuka embizeni ebilayo phezu komlilo wemihlanga.
018	JOB	041	021	Ukuphefumula kwakhe kulumathisa amalahle, njalo kulavuka amalangabi emlonyeni wakhe.
018	JOB	041	022	Amandla akhe asentanyeni yakhe; okuphambi kwakhe kuhle kuphele amandla.
018	JOB	041	023	Amavinqo enyama yakhe abambene nki; aqine nko kawehlukaniseki.
018	JOB	041	024	Isifuba sakhe silukhuni njengelitshe, siqine njengengaphansi kwembokodo.
018	JOB	041	025	Uthi nxa ephakama kwesabe amaqhawe ngokwawo; atshede ebalekela ukubhula komsila wakhe.
018	JOB	041	026	Inkemba leyo emfikelayo kayenzi lutho, kumbe umkhonto, loba umtshoko loba isijula.
018	JOB	041	027	Insimbi uyithatha njengotshani lethusi kungathi luluthi olubolileyo.
018	JOB	041	028	Imitshoko kayimenzi abaleke; lamatshe esavutha anjengomule kuye.
018	JOB	041	029	Induku kuye ingumuca wotshani; uyahleka esizwa ukukhenceza komdikadika.
018	JOB	041	030	Ingaphansi yomzimba wakhe injengendengezi ezibukhali, itshiya umzila odakeni kungathi yisileyi esizunguzekayo.
018	JOB	041	031	Udunga inziki zamanzi ayabuke njengembiza enkulu ibila, aluvube ulwandle njengembiza yamagcobo.
018	JOB	041	032	Ngemva kwakhe utshiya umzila okhazimulayo; umuntu angazathi ulwandle luloboya obumhlophe.
018	JOB	041	033	Kakukho emhlabeni okulingana laye, isidalwa esingesabiyo.
018	JOB	041	034	Ubakhangelela phansi bonke abathi bazithembile; uyinkosi phezu kwabo bonke abazigqajayo.”
018	JOB	042	001	UJobe wasemphendula uThixo wathi:
018	JOB	042	002	“Ngiyazi ukuthi ungazenza zonke izinto; kalikho icebo lakho elingavinjwa.
018	JOB	042	003	Ubuzile wathi, ‘Ngubani lo ovala iseluleko sami engelalwazi na?’ Ngeqiniso ngikhulumile ngezinto ebengingazizwisisi, izinto ezimangalisayo engingeke ngizazi.
018	JOB	042	004	Wena uthe, ‘Lalela manje, mina ngizakhuluma; ngizakubuza, wena uzangiphendula.’
018	JOB	042	005	Indlebe zami zasezizwile ngawe kodwa manje amehlo ami asekubonile.
018	JOB	042	006	Ngakho sengizeyisa, sengiphenduka ngizilahla othulini lasemlotheni.”
018	JOB	042	007	Kwathi uThixo esetshilo lezizinto kuJobe wathi ku-Elifazi umThemani, “Ngikuzondele wena kanye labangane bakho bobabili, ngoba kalikhulumanga ngami okulungileyo njengenceku yami uJobe.
018	JOB	042	008	Ngakho manje thathani inkunzi eziyisikhombisa lenqama eziyisikhombisa liye encekwini yami uJobe liyekwenza umnikelo wenu wokutshiswa. Inceku yami uJobe izalikhulekela, mina ngizawamukela umkhuleko wayo ngingaze ngalijezisa okufanele ubuthutha benu. Kalikhulumanga ngami okulungileyo njengenceku yami uJobe.”
018	JOB	042	009	Ngakho u-Elifazi umThemani, uBhilidadi umShuhi loZofari umNahama benza lokho abakutshelwa nguThixo; njalo uThixo wawemukela umkhuleko kaJobe.
018	JOB	042	010	UJobe esebakhulekele abangane bakhe, uThixo wamenza waphumelela njalo wamupha okunengi okuphindwe kabili kulokho ayelakho kuqala.
018	JOB	042	011	Bonke abafowabo labodadewabo kanye lobani owayemazi ngaphambili weza ukuzakudla laye endlini yakhe. Bamkhalela, bamzwela ngakho konke ukuhlupheka uThixo ayemehlisele khona, kwathi ngulowo lalowo wamupha ulutho lwesiliva kanye lesongo legolide.
018	JOB	042	012	UThixo wayibusisa impilo yokucina kaJobe ukwedlula eyokuqala. Waba lezimvu eziyizinkulungwane ezilitshumi lane, izinkulungwane eziyisithupha zamakamela, inkulungwane yezipani zenkabi labobabhemi abayinkulungwane.
018	JOB	042	013	Waphinda njalo waba lamadodana ayisikhombisa lamadodakazi amathathu.
018	JOB	042	014	Indodakazi yokuqala wayetha ibizo elithi Jemima, eyesibili yayinguKheziya, eyesithathu yaba nguKhereni-Haphutshi.
018	JOB	042	015	Kakuzange kube khona elizweni lonke abesifazane ababebahle njengamadodakazi kaJobe, njalo uyise wawabela ilifa kanye labanewabo.
018	JOB	042	016	Ngemva kwalokhu uJobe waphila iminyaka elikhulu lamatshumi amane; wababona abantwabakhe labantwababo kwaze kwaba yisizukulwane sesine.
018	JOB	042	017	UJobe wafa esemdala njalo eseluphele.
#
# BOOK	019	PSA	Psalms	Amahubo
019	PSA	001	001	Ubusisiwe umuntu ongahambi ngezeluleko zababi; ongemiyo endleleni yezoni; ongahlaliyo esihlalweni sabaklolodayo.
019	PSA	001	002	Kodwa ukuthokoza kwakhe kusemthethweni kaThixo, futhi unakana ngomthetho wakhe imini lobusuku.
019	PSA	001	003	Unjengesihlahla esihlanyelwe emifuleni yamanzi, esithela izithelo zaso ngesikhathi saso, ohlamvu laso kalibuni. Konke akwenzayo kuyaphumelela.
019	PSA	001	004	Ababi kabanjalo! Banjengamakhoba aphetshulwa ngumoya.
019	PSA	001	005	Ngakho ababi kabayikuma ekwahlulelweni, noma izoni enkundleni yabalungileyo.
019	PSA	001	006	Ngoba uThixo uyayilinda indlela yabalungileyo, kodwa indlela yababi iya ekubhujisweni.
019	PSA	002	001	Kungani izizwe zixokozela, labantu besakha amacebo ngeze?
019	PSA	002	002	Amakhosi omhlaba ayahloma ajame lababusi bahlangana ndawonye bemelana loThixo njalo lalowo ogcotshiweyo wakhe besithi;
019	PSA	002	003	“Kasiwaqamuleni amaketane abo, silahle izibopho zabo.”
019	PSA	002	004	Yena osesihlalweni ezulwini uyahleka; uThixo uyabahleka.
019	PSA	002	005	Abesebakhalimela ngolaka, abathuthumelise ngentukuthelo yakhe, esithi,
019	PSA	002	006	“Sengiyibekile eyami inkosi phezu kweZiyoni, intaba yami engcwele.”
019	PSA	002	007	Ngizasimemezela isimiso sikaThixo: Wathi kimi, “UyiNdodana yami; lamhla sengibe nguyihlo.
019	PSA	002	008	Cela kimi, ngizakwenza izizwe zibe yilifa lakho, imikhawulo yomhlaba kube yinotho yakho.
019	PSA	002	009	Uzazibusa ngentonga yobukhosi eyensimbi, uzazibhidliza zicubuzeke njengebumba.”
019	PSA	002	010	Ngakho-ke lina makhosi, limukani, liyaxwayiswa lina babusi bomhlaba.
019	PSA	002	011	Mkhonzeni uThixo ngokumesaba, lithokozele umbuso wakhe ngokuthuthumela.
019	PSA	002	012	Ikhothameleni iNdodana, funa ithukuthele beselibhujiswa endleleni yenu, ngoba intukuthelo yakhe ingavutha ngesikhatshana. Babusisiwe bonke abaphephela kuye.
019	PSA	003	001	Ihubo likaDavida ebalekela indodana yakhe u-Abhisalomu. Oh Thixo banengi kangaka abayizitha zami! Banengi kangaka abangihlaselayo!
019	PSA	003	002	Abanengi bathi ngami, “UNkulunkulu kayikumhlenga.”
019	PSA	003	003	Kodwa wena uyisihlangu sokungivikela, Oh, Thixo, inkazimulo yami, uphakamisa ikhanda lami.
019	PSA	003	004	Ngikhala kakhulu kuThixo uyangiphendula esentabeni yakhe engcwele.
019	PSA	003	005	Ngilala phansi ngijumeke; ngibuye ngiphaphame, ngoba uThixo uyangilondoloza.
019	PSA	003	006	Angiyikubesaba abangamatshumitshumi ezinkulungwane abangihlaselayo inxa zonke.
019	PSA	003	007	Phakama, awu Thixo Ngisindise, Oh Nkulunkulu wami. Zibethe zonke izitha zami emhlathini; akhumule amazinyo ababi.
019	PSA	003	008	KuThixo kuvela insindiso. Sengathi isibusiso Sakho singaba sebantwini Bakho.
019	PSA	004	001	Kumqondisi wokuhlabela. Ngeziginci. Ihubo likaDavida. Ngiphendula lapho ngikubiza, Oh Nkulunkulu wami olungileyo. Ake ungiphumuze ekuhlulukelweni engikukho; woba lomusa kimi njalo uzwe umkhuleko wami.
019	PSA	004	002	Koze kube nini, we bantu, koze kube nini inkazimulo yami liyenza ihlazo? Koze kube nini lithanda inkohliso njalo lidinga onkulunkulu bamanga?
019	PSA	004	003	Yazini ukuthi uThixo usezehlukanisele labo abathembekileyo, njalo uThixo uyezwa nxa ngikhala kuye.
019	PSA	004	004	Ekuthukutheleni kwenu lingoni; nxa lisemibhedeni yenu hlolani inhliziyo zenu, lithule.
019	PSA	004	005	Nikelani imihlatshelo eqondileyo, limethembe uThixo.
019	PSA	004	006	Abanengi bayabuza bathi, “Kuvele ngubani ongasitshengisa ukulunga na?” Sengathi ukukhanya kobuso bakho kungakhazimula phezu kwethu, Oh Thixo.
019	PSA	004	007	Uyigcwalisile inhliziyo yami ngentokozo enkulu eyedlula ubunengi bamabele abo lewayini labo elitsha.
019	PSA	004	008	Ngizalala phansi ngijunywe yibuthongo ngilokuthula, ngoba wena wedwa, Oh Thixo, uhlezi ungilondolozile.
019	PSA	005	001	Kumqondisi wokuhlabela. Kwabemifece. Ihubo likaDavida. Zwana amazwi ami, Oh Thixo, hawukela ukububula kwami.
019	PSA	005	002	Lalela ukukhala kwami ngidinga uncedo, Nkosi yami loNkulunkulu wami, ngoba ngikhuleka kuwe.
019	PSA	005	003	Ekuseni, Oh Thixo, uyalizwa ilizwi lami; ekuseni ngibeka izicelo zami phambi kwakho ngilinde ngithembile.
019	PSA	005	004	Kawusuye uNkulunkulu othokoza ngobubi; ababi ngeke bahlale lawe.
019	PSA	005	005	Iziqholo ngeke zime phambi kwakho; uyabazonda bonke abenza okubi.
019	PSA	005	006	Uyababhubhisa labo abaqamba amanga; abomele igazi labakhohlisayo uThixo uyabenyanya.
019	PSA	005	007	Kodwa mina, ngomusa wakho omkhulu, ngizangena endlini yakho; ngizakhothamela phansi ngokuhlonipha ngikhangele ethempelini lakho elingcwele.
019	PSA	005	008	Ngikhokhele, Oh Thixo, ngokulunga kwakho; ngenxa yezitha zami yenza iqonde indlela yakho phambi kwami.
019	PSA	005	009	Kalikho lalinye ilizwi lomlomo wabo elithembekileyo; inhliziyo yabo igcwele ukubhidliza. Umphimbo wabo ulingcwaba elikhamisileyo; ngolimi lwabo bakhuluma inkohliso.
019	PSA	005	010	Tshono uthi balecala, Oh Nkulunkulu! Akuthi amacebo abo abe yikuwa kwabo. Baxotshele khatshana ngenxa yezono zabo ezinengi, ngoba bakuhlamukele wena.
019	PSA	005	011	Kodwa akuthi bonke abaphephela kuwe bathokoze; kabahlabelele njalonjalo ngenjabulo. Basibekele ngovikelo lwakho, kuthi labo abalithandayo ibizo lakho bajabule ngawe.
019	PSA	005	012	Ngoba ngempela, Oh Thixo, uyababusisa abalungileyo; uyabazungeza ngomusa wakho njengesihlangu.
019	PSA	006	001	Kumqondisi wokuhlabela. Ngeleziginci. Kulandelwa isheminithi. Ihubo likaDavida. Oh Thixo ungangikhalimeli ngolaka lwakho njalo ungangitshayi uthukuthele.
019	PSA	006	002	Woba lomusa kimi, Thixo, ngoba ngiphela amandla; Oh Thixo, ngisilisa, ngoba amathambo ami alobuhlungu.
019	PSA	006	003	Umoya wami udabukile. Koze kube nini, Oh Thixo, koze kube nini?
019	PSA	006	004	Phenduka, Oh Thixo, ungikhulule; ngihlenga ngenxa yothando lwakho olungehlulekiyo.
019	PSA	006	005	Kakho okukhumbulayo nxa esefile. Ngubani okukhonzayo esengcwabeni lakhe?
019	PSA	006	006	Ngikhathele ngokububula; ubusuku bonke umbheda wami uba manzi te ngikhala umendlalo wami ngiwugcwalise ngezinyembezi.
019	PSA	006	007	Amehlo ami ayafiphala ngenxa yosizi; ayanqundeka ngenxa yazo zonke izitha zami.
019	PSA	006	008	Xekani kimi lina lonke elenza okubi, ngoba uThixo usekuzwile ukulila kwami.
019	PSA	006	009	UThixo usekuzwile ukukhala kwami ngicela umusa; UThixo uyawamukela umkhuleko wami.
019	PSA	006	010	Zonke izitha zami zizayangeka zidaniswe; zizatshibilika zibuyele emuva masinyane sezilehlazo.
019	PSA	007	001	Ishigayoni kaDavida ayihlabelela uThixo mayelana loKhushi umBhenjamini. Oh Thixo Nkulunkulu wami, ngiphephela kuwe; ngisindisa ungikhulule kubo bonke abangizingelayo,
019	PSA	007	002	ngoba bazanginithiza njengesilwane bangiklebule iziqanyana kungekho ongangilamulela.
019	PSA	007	003	Oh Thixo, Nkulunkulu wami, nxa ngikwenzile lokhu izandla zami zilecala,
019	PSA	007	004	nxa ngenze okubi kulowo ohlalisene kuhle lami loba ngisuke ngaphanga isitha sami kungelasizatho,
019	PSA	007	005	nxa kunjalo akuthi isitha sami singihlasele; masigxobagxobele impilo yami emhlabathini singibhuqabhuqele phansi ebhuqwini.
019	PSA	007	006	Vuka, Oh Thixo, ngolaka lwakho; vuka uvimbele ukuthukuthela kwezitha zami. Vuka, Nkulunkulu wami, memezela ukwahlulela okuhle.
019	PSA	007	007	Akuthi abantu bebuthene bakuhanqe busa phezu kwabo usekuphakameni.
019	PSA	007	008	UThixo kahlulele bonke abantu. Ngahlulele, Oh Thixo ngokwanele ukulunga kwami, ngokwanele ubuqotho bami, wena oPhezukonke.
019	PSA	007	009	Oh Nkulunkulu olungileyo, ohlolisisa imicabango lezinhliziyo, qeda udlakela lwababi ukuze abalungileyo bavikeleke.
019	PSA	007	010	Isihlangu sami nguNkulunkulu oPhezukonke, osindisa abaqotho ngenhliziyo.
019	PSA	007	011	UNkulunkulu ngumahluleli olungileyo, uNkulunkulu obonisa ulaka lwakhe insuku zonke.
019	PSA	007	012	Nxa umuntu engadeli ububi bakhe uzalola inkemba yakhe; uzaligoba alithiye idandili lakhe.
019	PSA	007	013	Usezilungisile izikhali zakhe ezibulalayo; uselungisa imitshoko yakhe evutha umlilo.
019	PSA	007	014	Lowo osuthiswe ngobubi akhulelwe yikona uzala ukuphumputheka.
019	PSA	007	015	Lowo omba umgodi awuphande uwela kulowomgodi awumbileyo.
019	PSA	007	016	Inkathazo ayidalileyo iyamphendukela; lesihluku sakhe sehlela phezu kwekhanda lakhe.
019	PSA	007	017	Ngizambonga uThixo ngenxa yokulunga kwakhe; ngizahlabelela indumiso egameni likaThixo oPhezukonke.
019	PSA	008	001	Kumqondisi wokuhlabela. Ngendlela yegithithi. Ihubo likaDavida. Oh Thixo, Thixo wethu, ibizo lakho libabazeka kangaka emhlabeni wonke! Uyibekile inkazimulo yakho ngaphezulu emazulwini.
019	PSA	008	002	Ukumisile ukudunyiswa yizindebe zabantwana lensane ngenxa yezitha zakho, ukuze uthulise isitha lomphindiseli.
019	PSA	008	003	Nxa nginakana ngamazulu akho, umsebenzi weminwe yakho, inyanga lezinkanyezi ozibeke endaweni yazo,
019	PSA	008	004	uyini umuntu osungaze uzihluphe ngaye na, indodana yomuntu ukuba uyinanze?
019	PSA	008	005	Wamenza waba mncinyazana kulezingilosi, wamethesa umqhele wodumo lobukhosi.
019	PSA	008	006	Wamenza umbusi phezu kwemisebenzi yezandla zakho; wabeka zonke izinto ngaphansi kwezinyawo zakhe:
019	PSA	008	007	yonke imihlambi yezimvu leyenkomo lezinyamazana zeganga,
019	PSA	008	008	izinyoni zasemkhathini lenhlanzi zolwandle, konke okuntsheza emanzini olwandle.
019	PSA	008	009	Oh Thixo, Thixo wethu, ibizo lakho libabazeka kangaka emhlabeni wonke!
019	PSA	009	001	Kumqondisi wokuhlabelela. Ihlatshelwa njengengoma ethi “Ukufa kweNdodana.” Ihubo likaDavida. Ngizakudumisa, Oh Thixo, ngenhliziyo yami yonke; ngizafakaza ngazozonke izimangaliso zakho.
019	PSA	009	002	Ngizathokoza ngijabule ngawe, ngizahlabelela indumiso egameni lakho, wena oPhezukonke.
019	PSA	009	003	Izitha zami ziyafulathela zibaleke; ziyakhubeka zitshabalale phambi kwakho.
019	PSA	009	004	Ngoba ulisekele ilungelo lami; usuhlalile esihlalweni sakho sobukhosi wahlulela kakuhle.
019	PSA	009	005	Uzikhuzile izizwe, wababhubhisa ababi; wawesula amabizo abo kuze kube nini lanini.
019	PSA	009	006	Ukubhidlika okungapheliyo kusehlele isitha sami, wawasiphuna amadolobho aso; lokukhunjulwa kwaso sekuphele nya.
019	PSA	009	007	UThixo uyabusa kuze kube nininini; usesimisile isihlalo sakhe sobukhosi ukuze ahlulele.
