019	PSA	140	005	Abantu abazigqajayo bangifihlele isifu; sebewanwebile amambule abo bangithiya lapha lalapha endleleni yami.
019	PSA	140	006	Oh Thixo, ngithi kuwe, “UnguNkulunkulu wami.” Zwana, ukukhala kwami ngicela umusa.
019	PSA	140	007	Oh Thixo wobukhosi, mhlengi wami olamandla, ovikela ikhanda lami ngelanga lempi
019	PSA	140	008	ungavumeli ababi izifiso zabo Oh Thixo; ungayekeli amacebo abo ukuthi aphumelele, funa bazigqaje.
019	PSA	140	009	Akuthi ingqondo zalabo abangihanqileyo zandelwe luhlupho oludalwe yizindebe zabo.
019	PSA	140	010	Akuthi amalahle avuthayo abakhithikele; sengathi bangaphoselwa emlilweni, emigodini ebhixa udaka, bangavuki futhi.
019	PSA	140	011	Akuthi abahlebayo bangatholi indawo elizweni; akuthi umnyama ubahlale izithende abantu bochuku.
019	PSA	140	012	Ngiyazi ukuthi uThixo ubenzela okulungileyo abayanga, ubamele abaswelayo.
019	PSA	140	013	Ngempela abalungileyo bazalidumisa ibizo lakho labaqotho bazahlala phambi kwakho.
019	PSA	141	001	Ihubo likaDavida Oh Thixo, ngiyakubiza; woza masinyane kimi. Zwana ilizwi lami nxa ngikubiza.
019	PSA	141	002	Sengathi umkhuleko wami ungema phambi kwakho njengempepha; kuthi ukuphakama kwezandla zami kube njengomhlatshelo wakusihlwa.
019	PSA	141	003	Ngibekela umlindi womlomo wami, Oh Thixo, qaphela umnyango wezindebe zami.
019	PSA	141	004	Ungayekeli inhliziyo yami ihugwe ngokubi, ngingene ezenzweni ezimbi labantu abayizigangi; mangingadli izibiliboco zabo.
019	PSA	141	005	Ake ngitshaywe ngumuntu olungileyo, kungumusa; kake angikhuze, kungamafutha ekhanda lami. Ikhanda lami kaliyikukwala. Ikanti umkhuleko wami uhlezi umelana lezenzo zezigangi.
019	PSA	141	006	Ababusi bazo bazaphoselwa phansi emaweni, lababi bazafunda ukuthi amazwi ami ayekhulunywe kuhle.
019	PSA	141	007	Bazakuthi, “Njengalowo olimayo eqeqebula umhlabathi, kanjalo amathambo ethu achithiziwe emlonyeni weliba.”
019	PSA	141	008	Kodwa amehlo ami agxile kuwe, Oh Thixo woBukhosi; kuwe ngiyaphephela unganginikeli ekufeni.
019	PSA	141	009	Ngivikela emijibileni asebeyithiyele mina, ezifini ezithiywe yizigangi.
019	PSA	141	010	Akuthi ababi bawele emambuleni abo, mina ngidlule kuhle ngiphephile.
019	PSA	142	001	Ihubo likaDavida. Lapho esebhalwini. Umkhuleko. Ngiyamemeza kakhulu kuThixo; ngiphakamisela ilizwi lami kuThixo ngicela umusa.
019	PSA	142	002	Ngithululela ukusola kwami phambi kwakhe; phambi kwakhe ngichaza ukuhlupheka kwami.
019	PSA	142	003	Lapho umphefumulo wami uncipha ngaphakathi kwami, nguwe oyaziyo indlela yami. Endleleni engihamba ngayo abantu bangithiyile khona.
019	PSA	142	004	Khangela kwesokunene sami ubone; kakho lobani onginanzayo. Angilaso isiphephelo; kakho onakekela impilo yami.
019	PSA	142	005	Ngikhala kuwe, Oh Thixo; ngithi, “Uyisiphephelo sami, uyisabelo sami elizweni labaphilayo.”
019	PSA	142	006	Lalela ukukhala kwami, ngoba ngileziswelo ezizikileyo, ngikhulula kulabo abaxotshana lami, ngoba balamandla kakhulu kulami.
019	PSA	142	007	Ngikhulula entolongweni yami, ukuze ngidumise ibizo lakho. Lapho-ke abalungileyo bazangibuthanela ngenxa yokulunga kwakho kimi.
019	PSA	143	001	Ihubo likaDavida Oh Thixo, zwana umkhuleko wami, zwana ukukhala kwami ngicela umusa; ngokuthembeka kwakho langokulunga kwakho woza uzongiphumuza.
019	PSA	143	002	Ungangenisi inceku yakho ekwahlulelweni, ngoba kakho ophilayo ongabe ulungile kuwe.
019	PSA	143	003	Isitha siyangizingela, singincindezela phansi emhlabathini; singenza ngihlale emnyameni njengalabo abafa kudala.
019	PSA	143	004	Kanjalo umphefumulo wami uyaphela ngaphakathi kwami; inhliziyo yami ngaphakathi kwami idanile.
019	PSA	143	005	Ngiyazikhumbula insuku zekadeni; ngidla ingqondo ngayo yonke imisebenzi yakho nginakane ngalokho okwenziwe yizandla zakho.
019	PSA	143	006	Ngiyelula izandla zami kuwe; umphefumulo wami uyakomela njengomhlabathi owomileyo.
019	PSA	143	007	Ngiphendula masinyane, awu Thixo; umoya wami uyaphela. Ungangifihleli ubuso bakho funa ngibe njengalabo abaya egodini.
019	PSA	143	008	Akuthi ukusa kungilethele ilizwi lothando lwakho olungaphuthiyo, ngoba sengibeke ithemba lami kuwe. Ngitshengisa indlela okumele ngihambe ngayo, ngoba ngiphakamisela umphefumulo wami kuwe.
019	PSA	143	009	Ngikhulula ezitheni zami, Oh Thixo, ngoba ngizifihla kuwe.
019	PSA	143	010	Ngifundisa ukwenza intando yakho, ngoba unguNkulunkulu wami; sengathi uMoya wakho omuhle kakhulu ungangikhokhela emhlabathini ochayileyo.
019	PSA	143	011	Ngenxa yebizo lakho, Oh Thixo, londoloza impilo yami; ngokulunga kwakho ngikhupha ekuhluphekeni.
019	PSA	143	012	Ethandweni lwakho olungaphuthiyo, thulisa izitha zami; bhubhisa bonke abangizondayo, ngoba ngiyinceku yakho.
019	PSA	144	001	ElikaDavida. Udumo kalube kuThixo iDwala lami, yena ofundisa izandla zami ukulwa impi, leminwe yami ukuhlasela.
019	PSA	144	002	UnguNkulunkulu wami othandekayo lenqaba yami, inqaba yami lomkhululi wami, isihlangu sami engiphephela kuso, othobisa abantu bami ngaphansi kwami.
019	PSA	144	003	Kambe Thixo, umuntu uyini ungaze umnanze, indodana yomuntu ukuthi uyikhumbule na?
019	PSA	144	004	Umuntu unjengomphefumulo; insuku zakhe zinjengesithunzi esidlulayo masinyane.
019	PSA	144	005	Yahlukanisa izulu lakho, Oh Thixo, wehlele phansi; thinta izintaba, ukuze zithunqe intuthu.
019	PSA	144	006	Thumela umbane uzihlakaze izitha; phosa imitshoko yakho zichitheke.
019	PSA	144	007	Yelula isandla sakho sisuka phezulu; ngihlenga ungikhulule emanzini alamandla abezizweni
019	PSA	144	008	omilomo yabo igcwele amanga, ozandla zabo zokunene zilenkohliso.
019	PSA	144	009	Ngizakuhlabelela ingoma entsha, Oh Nkulunkulu; ngechacho lezintambo ezilitshumi ngizakutshayela ingoma,
019	PSA	144	010	kuye yedwa onika amakhosi ukunqoba, ohlenga inceku yakhe uDavida enkembeni ebulalayo.
019	PSA	144	011	Ngihlenge, ungikhulule ezandleni zabezizwe omilomo yabo igcwele amanga, ozandla zabo zokunene zilenkohliso.
019	PSA	144	012	Kuzakuthi amadodana ethu ebutsheni bawo azakuba njengezihlahla ezikhuliswa kuhle, kuthi amadodakazi ethu abe njengezinsika ezibazelwe ukucecisa isigodlo.
019	PSA	144	013	Iziphala zethu zizagcwala ngemihlobo yonke yokudla. Izimvu zethu zizakwanda ngezinkulungwane, ngamatshumi ezinkulungwane emadlelweni ethu;
019	PSA	144	014	inkabi zethu zizadonsa imithwalo enzima. Akusayikuba khona ukubhidlizwa kwemiduli, ukuya ebugqilini, lokukhala kosizi emigwaqweni yakithi.
019	PSA	144	015	Babusisiwe labobantu lokhu okuzakwenzakala kubo; babusisiwe abantu oNkulunkulu wabo ngu Thixo.
019	PSA	145	001	Ihubo lokudumisa. ElikaDavida. Ngizaphakamisa wena, Nkulunkulu wami oyiNkosi; ngizalidumisa ibizo lakho kuze kube phakade.
019	PSA	145	002	Zonke insuku ngizakudumisa ngibabaze ibizo lakho kuze kube phakade.
019	PSA	145	003	Umkhulu uThixo njalo ufanele kakhulu ukudunyiswa; ubukhulu bakhe kakho ongabulinganisa.
019	PSA	145	004	Yileso laleso isizukulwane sizababaza imisebenzi yakho kwesinye; sizatshelana ngezenzo zakho ezinkulu.
019	PSA	145	005	Sizakhuluma ngenkazimulo yakho ebenyezelayo ubukhosi bakho, lami ngizazidla ingqondo ngemisebenzi yakho emangalisayo.
019	PSA	145	006	Zizalandisa ngamandla emisebenzi yakho emangalisayo, lami ngizafakaza ngemisebenzi yakho emikhulu.
019	PSA	145	007	Bazakwenza umkhosi ngokulunga kwakho okukhulu bahlabele ngentokozo ngokulunga kwakho.
019	PSA	145	008	UThixo ulomusa njalo ulesihawu, uyaphuza ukuthukuthela, kodwa uyanda ngothando.
019	PSA	145	009	UThixo ulungile kubo bonke; ulesihawu kukho konke akwenzayo.
019	PSA	145	010	Konke owakwenzayo kuzakudumisa, wena Thixo; abathembekileyo bakho bazakubabaza.
019	PSA	145	011	Bazalandisa ngenkazimulo yombuso wakho bakhulume ngamandla akho,
019	PSA	145	012	kuze kuthi bonke abantu bazi ngezenzo zakho ezinkulu lokubenyezela kwenkazimulo yombuso wakho.
019	PSA	145	013	Umbuso wakho ungumbuso ongapheliyo, lobukhosi bakho bumi kuzozonke izizukulwane. UThixo uthembekile kuzozonke izithembiso zakhe njalo ulothando kukho konke akwenzayo.
019	PSA	145	014	UThixo uyabaxhasa bonke labo abawayo abaphakamise bonke abacubayo.
019	PSA	145	015	Amehlo abo bonke akhangela kuwe, wena ubaphe ukudla kwabo ngesikhathi esifaneleyo.
019	PSA	145	016	Uyavula isandla sakho usuthise izidingo zakho konke okuphilayo.
019	PSA	145	017	UThixo ulungile kuzozonke izindlela zakhe njalo uthembekile kukho konke akwenzayo.
019	PSA	145	018	UThixo useduze kulabo abacela kuye, kubo bonke abacela kuye ngeqiniso.
019	PSA	145	019	Uyagcwalisa izidingo zalabo abamesabayo; uyezwa ukukhala kwabo abasindise.
019	PSA	145	020	UThixo uyabalinda bonke abamthandayo, kodwa bonke ababi uzababhubhisa.
019	PSA	145	021	Umlomo wami uzakhuluma ngokudumisa uThixo. Akuthi izidalwa zonke zidumise ibizo lakhe elingcwele kuze kube nini lanini.
019	PSA	146	001	Dumisani uThixo. Dumisa uThixo mphefumulo wami.
019	PSA	146	002	Ngizamdumisa uThixo impilo yami yonke; ngizahlabela indumiso kuNkulunkulu wami nxa ngisaphila.
019	PSA	146	003	Lingabeki ithemba lenu emakhosini, ebantwini benyama, abangeke basindise.
019	PSA	146	004	Kuthi umoya wabo ungaphuma, babuyele emhlabathini; mhlalokho nje amacebo ahle abhidlike.
019	PSA	146	005	Ubusisiwe lowo osizo lwakhe lunguNkulunkulu kaJakhobe, othemba lakhe likuThixo uNkulunkulu wakhe.
019	PSA	146	006	UnguMenzi wamazulu lomhlaba, ulwandle lakho konke okulapho: uThixo owala elokhu ethembekile laphakade.
019	PSA	146	007	Uyabalwela abancindezelwayo anike abalambileyo ukudla. UThixo ukhulula izibotshwa,
019	PSA	146	008	uThixo wenza iziphofu zibone, uThixo uyabaphakamisa labo asebebhazalele, uThixo uthanda abalungileyo.
019	PSA	146	009	UThixo uyabalinda abezizweni asekele izintandane labafelokazi, kodwa anyampise izindlela zababi.
019	PSA	146	010	UThixo uyabusa nini lanini, uNkulunkulu wakho, wena Ziyoni, ezizukulwaneni zonke. Dumisani uThixo.
019	PSA	147	001	Dumisani uThixo. Kuhle kangakanani ukuhlabela indumiso kuNkulunkulu wethu, kumnandi njalo kufanele ukumbonga!
019	PSA	147	002	UThixo uyalakha iJerusalema; aqoqe labo abahlakazekileyo baka-Israyeli.
019	PSA	147	003	Uyabathoba abadabukileyo enhliziyweni abophe amanxeba abo.
019	PSA	147	004	Umisile ubunengi bezinkanyezi aziqambe leyo laleyo ngamabizo.
019	PSA	147	005	INkosi yethu inkulu, njalo makhulu amandla ayo; ukuzwisisa kwayo kakulamkhawulo.
019	PSA	147	006	UThixo uyabasekela abathobekileyo kodwa abaphosele phansi ababi.
019	PSA	147	007	Hlabelani kuThixo ngokubonga; litshaye amachacho kuNkulunkulu wethu.
019	PSA	147	008	Uyembesa umkhathi ngamayezi; awuphe umhlaba izulu njalo akhulise utshani ezintabeni.
019	PSA	147	009	Unika inkomo utshani aphe lamatsiyane amawabayi nxa esekhala.
019	PSA	147	010	Ukuthokoza kwakhe kakukho emandleni ebhiza, loba injabulo yakhe ekuqineni kwemilenze yomuntu;
019	PSA	147	011	UThixo uthokoza ngalabo abamesabayo, ababeka ithemba labo ethandweni lwakhe olungaphuthiyo.
019	PSA	147	012	Umbabaze uThixo, Oh Jerusalema; dumisa uNkulunkulu wakho, Oh Ziyoni.
019	PSA	147	013	Ngoba uyaqinisa imigoqo yamasango akho, abusise labantu bakho ngaphakathi kwakho.
019	PSA	147	014	Wenza ukuthula emikhawulweni yelizwe lakho. Njalo ukusuthisa ngamabele amahle kakhulu.
019	PSA	147	015	Uthumela umlayo wakhe emhlabeni; ilizwi lakhe ligijima masinyane.
019	PSA	147	016	Wendlala ungqwaqwane njengoboya bezimvu ahaze iliqhwa njengomlotha.
019	PSA	147	017	Uphosela phansi isiqhotho sakhe njengamatshe. Ngubani ongamelana lomfutho wakhe olomqando na?
019	PSA	147	018	Uthumela ilizwi lakhe konke kuncibilike; aphephethise umoya wakhe amanzi ageleze.
019	PSA	147	019	Ulivezile ilizwi lakhe kuJakhobe, imithetho yakhe lezahlulelo ku-Israyeli.
019	PSA	147	020	Lokhu kazange akwenzele esinye isizwe; kaziyazi imithetho yakhe. Dumisani uThixo.
019	PSA	148	001	Dumisani uThixo. Dumisani uThixo emazulwini, mdumiseni eziqongweni ngaphezulu.
019	PSA	148	002	Mdumiseni zingilosi zakhe zonke, mdumiseni lonke mabutho asezulwini.
019	PSA	148	003	Mdumiseni, langa lenyanga, mdumiseni lonke zinkanyezi ezikhazimulayo.
019	PSA	148	004	Mdumiseni lina ziqongo zamazulu lani manzi ngaphezulu komkhathi.
019	PSA	148	005	Konke kakudumise ibizo likaThixo ngoba yena watsho ilizwi kwadaleka.
019	PSA	148	006	Wazibeka ezindaweni zazo okwanini lanini; wanika isahlulelo esingela kuguquka.
019	PSA	148	007	Dumisani uThixo emhlabeni, lina zidalwa zasolwandle lezinziki zalo zonke,
019	PSA	148	008	umbane lesiqhotho, ungqwaqwane lamayezi, umoya wesiphepho owenza intando yakhe,
019	PSA	148	009	lina zintaba lamaqaqa wonke, zihlahla zezithelo lemisedari yonke,
019	PSA	148	010	zinyamazana zeganga lenkomo zonke, zinanakazana lezinyoni eziphaphayo,
019	PSA	148	011	makhosi omhlaba lezizwe zonke, lina makhosana lababusi bonke emhlabeni,
019	PSA	148	012	majaha lezintombi, maxhegu labantwana.
019	PSA	148	013	Kabalidumise ibizo likaThixo, ngoba ibizo lakhe lodwa liphakeme; inkazimulo yakhe ingaphezulu komhlaba lamazulu.
019	PSA	148	014	Ubaphakamisele abantu bakhe uphondo, indumiso yabo bonke abathembekileyo bakhe, eka-Israyeli, abantu abasesifubeni sakhe. Dumisani uThixo.
019	PSA	149	001	Dumisani uThixo. Hlabelelani uThixo ingoma entsha, indumiso yakhe ebandleni labathembekileyo.
019	PSA	149	002	Akuthi u-Israyeli athokoze ngoMenzi wakhe; akuthi abantu baseZiyoni bajabule ngeNkosi yabo.
019	PSA	149	003	Kabadumise ibizo lakhe ngokusina, batshaye amagedla lamachacho.
019	PSA	149	004	Ngoba uThixo uyathokoza ngabantu bakhe; abathobekileyo ubapha umqhele wensindiso.
019	PSA	149	005	Akuthi abathembekileyo bathokoze ngale inhlonipho, bahlabele ngentokozo besemibhedeni yabo.
019	PSA	149	006	Sengathi indumiso kaNkulunkulu ingaba semilonyeni yabo lenkemba esika nxazonke ibe sezandleni zabo,
019	PSA	149	007	ukuthi benze impindiselo phezu kwezizwe lesijeziso phezu kwabantu,
019	PSA	149	008	babophe amakhosi azo ngentambo lezikhulu zabo ngezibopho zensimbi,
019	PSA	149	009	ukugcwalisa kubo isigwebo abasibhalelwayo. Lokhu kuyinkazimulo yabathembekileyo bakhe bonke. Dumisani uThixo.
019	PSA	150	001	Dumisani uThixo. Dumisani uNkulunkulu endlini yakhe engcwele; mdumiseni emazulwini Akhe amakhulu.
019	PSA	150	002	Mdumiseni ngenxa yezenzo zakhe zamandla; mdumiseni ngenxa yobukhulu bakhe obudlula konke.
019	PSA	150	003	Mdumiseni ngokutshaya icilongo, mdumiseni ngechacho langomhubhe,
019	PSA	150	004	mdumiseni ngegedla langokusina, mdumiseni ngeziginci langomqangala,
019	PSA	150	005	mdumiseni ngamazenge akhencezayo; mdumiseni ngomsindo wamazenge ancencethayo!
019	PSA	150	006	Akuthi konke okuphefumulayo kumdumise uThixo. Dumisani uThixo.
#
# BOOK	020	PRO	Proverbs	Izaga
020	PRO	001	001	Izaga zikaSolomoni indodana kaDavida, inkosi yako-Israyeli:
020	PRO	001	002	ukuba abantu bazuze ukuhlakanipha lokuzithiba; ukuba bazwisise amazwi okuqedisisa;
020	PRO	001	003	ukuba bazuze impilo yokuzithiba lobuqotho, besenza okulungileyo, okufaneleyo lokuqondileyo;
020	PRO	001	004	ukunika ulwazi kwabayizithutha, ulwazi lokukhetha okuqondileyo kwabatsha
020	PRO	001	005	ukuthi ohlakaniphileyo alalele engeze ukufunda kwakhe, kuthi obonisisayo azuze izeluleko,
020	PRO	001	006	ukuba abantu bazwisise izaga lemizekeliso, izitsho lamalibho abahlakaniphileyo.
020	PRO	001	007	Ukwesaba uThixo kuyikuqala kwenhlakanipho, kodwa iziwula ziyakweyisa ukuqedisisa lokuzithiba.
020	PRO	001	008	Lalela, ndodana yami, izeluleko zikayihlo njalo ungadeli imfundiso kanyoko.
020	PRO	001	009	Kuzakuba ngumqhele omuhle ekhanda lakho lomgaxo wokucecisa intamo yakho.
020	PRO	001	010	Ndodana yami, aluba izoni zikuhuga, ungaze wavuma.
020	PRO	001	011	Nxa zisithi, “Woza sihambe; kasicathamele abantu sichithe igazi, kasicwathele omunye umuntu ongelacala;
020	PRO	001	012	kasibaginye bephila njengengcwaba, sibajwamule njengabawele emgodini;
020	PRO	001	013	sizazuza impahla ezinhle ezehlukeneyo sigcwalise izindlu zethu ngempango;
020	PRO	001	014	phathisana lathi ukuze sibelesikhwama sinye”
020	PRO	001	015	ndodana yami, ungahambi lazo, ungalugxobi olwakho ezindleleni zazo;
020	PRO	001	016	ngoba ezabo inyawo zigijima ekoneni, bachitha igazi lula.
020	PRO	001	017	Kakusizi ukuthiya ngembule lithe dandalazi emehlweni ezinyoni!
020	PRO	001	018	Abantu laba bacathamela ukuchitheka kwelabo igazi; bajuma okwabo ukuphila.
020	PRO	001	019	Sinjalo isiphetho salabo abadinga inzuzo ngobugebenga; kuyayichitha impilo yalabo abayitholayo.
020	PRO	001	020	Ukuhlakanipha kuyamemeza emgwaqweni, kuphakamisa ilizwi lakho ezinkundleni;
020	PRO	001	021	kuyanqongoloza lezindleleni okuxokozela khona, kuyatshumayela emasangweni omuzi kuthi:
020	PRO	001	022	“Koze kube nini lina zithutha lithanda ubuthutha benu na? Koze kube nini izideleli zikholisa ukudelela leziphukuphuku zizonda ulwazi na?
020	PRO	001	023	Lalelani ukukhuza kwami liphenduke! Ngizalivulela isifuba sami, ngilivezele imicabango yami.
020	PRO	001	024	Kodwa ngenxa yokuthi langifulathela ngilibiza, kwangabi khona onginanzayo ngiselula isandla sami,
020	PRO	001	025	njengoba lala izeluleko zami njalo kalavuma ukukhuza kwami,
020	PRO	001	026	ngakho lami ngizahleka selihlupheka; ngizaliklolodela nxa lisehlelwa lusizi,
020	PRO	001	027	nxa usizi lulehlela njengesiphepho; nxa incithakalo ilikhukhula njengesivunguzane, nxa usizi lezinhlupheko ziligabhela.
020	PRO	001	028	Lapho-ke bazangibiza kodwa kangiyikusabela; bazangidinga bangangitholi.
020	PRO	001	029	Ngoba babeluzonda ulwazi kabaze bakhetha ukwesaba uThixo
020	PRO	001	030	ngoba kabavumanga iseluleko sami, badelela ukukhuza kwami,
020	PRO	001	031	bazakudla izithelo zokuhamba kwabo basuthiswe ngezithelo zamacebo abo.
020	PRO	001	032	Phela ubuhlongandlebe bezithutha buzazibulala, lokungananzi kweziphukuphuku kuzazibhubhisa;
020	PRO	001	033	kodwa lowo ongilalelayo uzahlala evikelekile ekhululekile, engesabi lutho olungamlimaza.”
020	PRO	002	001	Ndodana yami, nxa usamukela amazwi ami ugcine imilayo yami ngaphakathi kwakho,
020	PRO	002	002	uvule indlebe yakho izwe ukuhlakanipha unikele inhliziyo yakho ukuthi izwisise,
020	PRO	002	003	njalo nxa ucela ukuqedisisa ukhalela kakhulu ukuzwisisa,
020	PRO	002	004	futhi ukudingisisa njengokudinga isiliva ukuphenye njengento eligugu efihliweyo,
020	PRO	002	005	lapho-ke uzakuzwisisa ukumesaba uThixo njalo uluzuze ulwazi lukaNkulunkulu.
020	PRO	002	006	Ngoba uThixo uyapha ukuhlakanipha, emlonyeni wakhe kuphuma ulwazi lokuqedisisa.
020	PRO	002	007	Abaqotho ubapha ukunqoba, ulihawu lalabo abahamba bengasoleki,
020	PRO	002	008	ngoba uyayilinda indlela yabalungileyo avikele ukuhamba kwabathembekileyo bakhe.
020	PRO	002	009	Yikho uzazwisisa lokho okulungileyo lokuqondileyo lokufaneleyo zonke izindlela ezinhle.
020	PRO	002	010	Ngoba ukuhlakanipha kuzangena enhliziyweni yakho, lolwazi lube mnandi emphefumulweni wakho.
020	PRO	002	011	Ukwazi ukukhetha kuzakuvikela, lokuzwisisa kuzakulinda.
020	PRO	002	012	Ukuhlakanipha kuzakusindisa ezindleleni zabantu ababi, abantu abamazwi abolileyo,
020	PRO	002	013	abatshiya izindlela eziqondileyo, bahambe ngezindlela ezilamathunzi,
020	PRO	002	014	abathokoza ngokwenza okubi bajabule ngokungcola kokubi,
020	PRO	002	015	abandlela zabo zitshekile lokuhamba kwabo kakuqondakali.
020	PRO	002	016	Kuzakukhulula njalo koyisiphingikazi, lasemfazini olamazwi akhohlisayo,
020	PRO	002	017	osetshiye indoda yakhe yobutsha bakhe wadela isifungo asenza phambi kukaNkulunkulu.
020	PRO	002	018	Ngoba indlu yakhe iholela ekufeni lezindlela zakhe zidonsela kwabafileyo.
020	PRO	002	019	Kakho ongena kuye obuyayo kumbe aphinde azuze izindlela zokuphila.
020	PRO	002	020	Ngakho uzahamba ezindleleni zabantu abalungileyo walele emikhondweni yabaqondileyo.
020	PRO	002	021	Ngoba abaqotho bazahlala elizweni, labangasolekiyo bazasala kulo;
020	PRO	002	022	kodwa izigangi zizasuswa elizweni, labangathembekanga bazakhutshwa kulo.
020	PRO	003	001	Ndodana yami, ungakhohlwa imfundiso yami, kodwa ugcine imilayo yami enhliziyweni yakho,
020	PRO	003	002	ngoba izakwandisa impilo yakho okweminyaka eminengi, ikuphe ukuthula.
020	PRO	003	003	Akungasuki kuwe loba nini uthando lokuthembeka; kubophele entanyeni yakho, ukubhale egwalibeni lenhliziyo yakho.
020	PRO	003	004	Ngalokho uzathandeka uzuze ibizo elihle emehlweni kaNkulunkulu laphambi kwabantu.
020	PRO	003	005	Themba kuThixo ngenhliziyo yakho yonke, ungathembi ekuzwisiseni kwakho;
020	PRO	003	006	mvume kuzozonke izindlela zakho, yena uzaqondisa zonke izindlela zakho.
020	PRO	003	007	Ungazenzi ohlakaniphileyo ngokubona kwakho; yesaba uThixo uxwaye okubi.
020	PRO	003	008	Lokho kuzawuphilisa umzimba wakho kuwaqinise lamathambo akho.
020	PRO	003	009	Dumisa uThixo ngenotho yakho; ngezithelo zakho zokuqala zonke;
020	PRO	003	010	ngalokho iziphala zakho zizagcwala ziphuphume, lezimbiza zakho zewayini zize zichitheke ngewayini elitsha.
020	PRO	003	011	Ndodana yami, ungeyisi ukulaya kukaThixo njalo ungacaphukeli ukukhuza kwakhe,
020	PRO	003	012	ngoba uThixo ulaya labo abathandayo, njengoyise elaya indodana yakhe ayithandayo.
020	PRO	003	013	Ubusisiwe umuntu ozuza ukuhlakanipha, umuntu ozuza ukuqedisisa,
020	PRO	003	014	ngoba khona kulenzuzo eyedlula isiliva lenzuzo eyedlula igolide.
020	PRO	003	015	Kuligugu elidlula amarubhi; kakukho okuloyisayo okungalinganiswa lakho.
020	PRO	003	016	Impilo ende isesandleni sakho sokunene; kwesokhohlo kulenotho lodumo.
020	PRO	003	017	Izindlela zakhe zilokuthokoza, lemikhondo yakhe ilokuthula.
020	PRO	003	018	Kuyisihlahla sokuphila kulabo abakwamukelayo; labo abakuphathayo bazabusiswa.
020	PRO	003	019	Ngokuhlakanipha uThixo wabeka izisekelo zomhlaba, ngokuqedisisa wamisa izulu endaweni yalo;
020	PRO	003	020	ngolwazi lwakhe inlwandle zehlukaniswa, lamayezi athontisa amazolo.
020	PRO	003	021	Ndodana yami, gogosa ingqondo ehlela ngolwazi, ungayekeli kukucatshele;
020	PRO	003	022	kuzakuba yikuphila kuwe, kube ngumceciso omuhle entanyeni yakho.
020	PRO	003	023	Lapho-ke uzahamba ngendlela evikelweyo unyawo lwakho lungakhubeki;
020	PRO	003	024	nxa ulala kawuyikwesaba; uzalala ubuthongo obumnandi.
020	PRO	003	025	Ungabi lovalo nxa ujunywa ngumonakalo kumbe yikubhidlika lokho okwehlela ababi,
020	PRO	003	026	ngoba uThixo uzakuba lithemba lakho avikele unyawo lwakho emjibileni.
020	PRO	003	027	Ungaze wala ukusiza labo abadinga uncedo, wena ulakho ongabasiza ngakho.
020	PRO	003	028	Ungabokuthi kumakhelwane wakho: “Ubobuya kwesinye isikhathi; ngizakunika kusasa” wena ulalo lololutho.
020	PRO	003	029	Ungacebi okubi ngomakhelwane wakho, ohlezi lawe ekwethemba.
020	PRO	003	030	Ungaxabani lomuntu kungelasizatho yena engakonelanga ngalutho.
020	PRO	003	031	Ungamhawukeli umuntu othanda ukulwa loba nje ufise lakuphi ukwenza kwakhe,
020	PRO	003	032	ngoba uThixo uyamenyanya umuntu oxhwalileyo kodwa oqotho umbeka ekhwapheni lakhe.
020	PRO	003	033	Isiqalekiso sikaThixo sehlela endlini yababi, kodwa uyayibusisa indlu yabalungileyo.
020	PRO	003	034	Uyabahleka usulu abayizideleli ezizithembayo, kodwa abe lomusa kwabathobekileyo.
020	PRO	003	035	Abahlakaniphileyo baphiwa udumo kodwa abayiziwula ubathela ihlazo.
020	PRO	004	001	Zwanini, madodana ami, izeluleko zikayihlo; lalelani lizuze ukuqedisisa.
020	PRO	004	002	Ngilipha izifundo ezipheleleyo; ngakho lingalahli imfundiso yami.
020	PRO	004	003	Ngathi ngisengumfana emzini kababa, ngisebuthakathaka, ngiyimi ngedwa ingane kamama,
020	PRO	004	004	wangifundisa ubaba wathi, “Abambe amazwi ami ngenhliziyo yakho yonke; gcina imilayo yami ukuze uphile.
020	PRO	004	005	Zuza ukuhlakanipha, zuza ukuqedisisa; ungawakhohlwa amazwi ami, kumbe ugudluke kuwo.
020	PRO	004	006	Ungafulatheli ukuhlakanipha, kuzakuvikela; kuthande, kuzakulinda.
020	PRO	004	007	Ukuhlakanipha kuyinqaba; ngakho zuza ukuhlakanipha. Zuza ukuqedisisa loba kungathatha konke olakho.
020	PRO	004	008	Kugogose, kuzakuphakamisa; kugone, kuzakunika udumo.
020	PRO	004	009	Kuzakwethesa umqhele wamaluba omusa ekhanda lakho kukwethese umqhele wenkazimulo.”
020	PRO	004	010	Zwana mntanami, yamukela lokho engikutshoyo, ukuze insuku zokuphila kwakho zibe zinengi.
020	PRO	004	011	Ngiyakukhokhela endleleni yokuhlakanipha, ngikuqondise ezindleleni eziqondileyo.
020	PRO	004	012	Nxa uhamba kawuyikuthikaza; nxa ugijima kawuyikukhubeka.
020	PRO	004	013	Bambelela iziqondiso, ungayekethisi; zigcine kuhle ngoba ziyikuphila kwakho.
020	PRO	004	014	Ungayingeni indlela yababi njalo ungahambi endleleni yezigangi.
020	PRO	004	015	Ixwaye, ungahambi ngayo; itshiye uqhubeke ngeyakho indlela.
020	PRO	004	016	Phela kabalali bengenzanga ukuganga; badela ubuthongo ukuze baqale balimaze omunye umuntu.
020	PRO	004	017	Badla isinkwa sobubi banathe iwayini lobudlwangudlwangu.
020	PRO	004	018	Indlela yabalungileyo injengovivi lokusa, kukhule ukukhanya kwalo kuze kuphelele emini.
020	PRO	004	019	Kodwa indlela yababi ifana lomnyama omkhulu; kabazi ukuthi kuyini okubakhubayo.
020	PRO	004	020	Ndodana yami, zwana lokhu engikutshoyo; lalelisisa amazwi ami.
020	PRO	004	021	Ungawasusi emehlweni akho, agcine enhliziyweni yakho;
020	PRO	004	022	ngoba ayikuphila kulabo abawafumanayo; lokuqina komzimba wonke womuntu.
020	PRO	004	023	Phezu kwakho konke, gcina inhliziyo yakho, ngoba ingumthombo wokuphila kwakho.
020	PRO	004	024	Lahla izibozi zamazwi emlonyeni wakho; ungakhuphi inkulumo yokuxhwala ezindebeni zakho.
020	PRO	004	025	Khangelisa amehlo akho nta phambili, uwathi nhlo amehlo akho kulokho okuphambi kwakho.
020	PRO	004	026	Lungisa izindlela ukuze inyawo zakho zinyathele kuhle, uhambe ngezindlela eziqinileyo kuphela.
020	PRO	004	027	Ungaphambukeli kwesokunene loba kwesokhohlo; ugcine unyawo lwakho lunganyatheli okubi.
020	PRO	005	001	Ndodana yami, nanzelela ukuhlakanipha kwami, ulalele kuhle amazwi ami alombono,
020	PRO	005	002	ukuze uhlale ukwazi ukukhetha okuqondileyo lokuze izindebe zakho zigcine ulwazi.
020	PRO	005	003	Phela izindebe zesifebekazi zithonta uluju, lenkulumo yaso iyatshelela kulamafutha;
020	PRO	005	004	kodwa ekucineni iyababa ingathi yinyongo, ibukhali njengenkemba esika nxa zombili.
020	PRO	005	005	Inyawo zaso zehlela ekufeni; izinyathelo zaso ziqonda nta elibeni.
020	PRO	005	006	Kasikhathali ukuthi kuphilwa njani; izindlela zaso ziyazombeleza, kodwa kasikuboni lokho.
020	PRO	005	007	Ngalokho-ke, madodana ami, ngilalelani; lingaphambuki kulokho engikukhulumayo.
020	PRO	005	008	Hambani ngendlela ekhatshana kwaso, lingasondeli emnyango wendlu yaso,
020	PRO	005	009	funa unikele kwabanye amandla akho wonke lobudala bakho kulowo olesihluku,
020	PRO	005	010	funa abemzini bazitike ngenotho yakho lokusebenza kwakho kunothise umuzi wenye indoda.
020	PRO	005	011	Ekupheleni kokuphila kwakho uzabubula, lapho inyama yakho lomzimba wakho sekugugile.
020	PRO	005	012	Uzakuthi, “Uthi ngangikuzonda yini ukulaywa! Inhliziyo yami yayikuzonda njani ukuqondiswa!
020	PRO	005	013	Ngangingafuni ukulalela abafundisi bami kumbe ukulalela abeluleki bami.
020	PRO	005	014	Ngacina sengisenkingeni enkulu ngiphakathi kwabantu bakaNkulunkulu.”
020	PRO	005	015	Natha amanzi kowakho umgqomo, amanzi agelezayo kowakho umthombo.
020	PRO	005	016	Kambe imifudlana yakho ingayekelwa igelezela emigwaqweni, lezifula zakho zamanzi zigelezele ezinkundleni zabantu na?
020	PRO	005	017	Kazibe ngezakho wena wedwa, ungazabelani labafokazana nje.
020	PRO	005	018	Sengathi ungabusiswa umthombo wakho njalo sengathi ungathokoza ngomfazi wobutsha bakho.
020	PRO	005	019	Oyimpalakazi ethandekayo, imbabala ebutshelezi amabele akhe sengathi angakusuthisa lanini, nini lanini ukhangwe luthando lwakhe.
020	PRO	005	020	Kungani ndodana yami, uthunjwa yisifebekazi? Kungani ugona iqolo lomfazi wenye indoda?
020	PRO	005	021	Phela izindlela zomuntu zisobala kuThixo, uyazihlola zonke izindlela zakhe.
020	PRO	005	022	Izenzo ezimbi zomuntu omubi ziyamthiya; izibopho zesono sakhe zimuthe nko.
020	PRO	005	023	Uzabhubha ngoba engalayeki, elahlekiswa yibuphukuphuku bakhe.
020	PRO	006	001	Ndodana yami, nxa wenzele umakhelwane wakho isibambiso, nxa libambene izandla ukuba uzamhlawulela imilandu yakhe,
020	PRO	006	002	aluba usuzihilele ngalokho okutshiloyo, wazibambisa ngamazwi omlomo wakho,
020	PRO	006	003	lapho-ke yenza lokhu, ndodana yami, ukuzikhulula, njengoba usuwele ezandleni zakhe umakhelwane wakho: Hamba ufike uzehlise; mncengancenge umakhelwane wakho!
020	PRO	006	004	Ungabuvumeli ubuthongo emehlweni akho, ungavumeli ukuwozela enkopheni zakho.
020	PRO	006	005	Zikhulule njengempala ezandleni zomzingeli, njengenyoni esifini somthiyi.
020	PRO	006	006	Khangela ubunyonyo, wena vila; hlolisisa ukwenza kwabo uhlakaniphe!
020	PRO	006	007	Kabulamphathi, kabula mkhangeli loba umbusi,
020	PRO	006	008	kodwa buyaqoqa umphako wabo ehlobo bubuthe ukudla kwabo nxa kuvunwa.
020	PRO	006	009	Uzalala khonapho kuze kube nini, vila ndini? Uzavuka nini ebuthongweni bakho?
020	PRO	006	010	Ukulala okuncane, ukuwozela okuncane, ukugoqa izandla kancane uphumula,
020	PRO	006	011	ubuyanga buzafika kuwe njengesela lokuswela njengesigebenga.
020	PRO	006	012	Isigangi lesixhwali esihamba sikhuluma amanyala,
020	PRO	006	013	esiqhweba ngelihlo sitshengise ngezinyawo zaso njalo sitshengise ngeminwe yaso,
020	PRO	006	014	esiceba ububi ngenkohliso enhliziyweni yaso sithanda ukuvusa inkani kokuphela.
020	PRO	006	015	Ngakho lowo uzawelwa yingozi ngokuphazima; uzabhidlizwa ngokuphangisa kungasekho okungenziwa.
020	PRO	006	016	Ziyisithupha izinto uThixo azizondayo, eziyisikhombisa eziyisinengiso kuye:
020	PRO	006	017	amehlo atshengisa ukudelela, ulimi oluqamba amanga, izandla ezichitha igazi elingelacala,
020	PRO	006	018	inhliziyo egaya izibozi, inyawo eziphangisa ukuya ebubini,
020	PRO	006	019	umfakazi wamanga, okhuluma inkohliso lomuntu oletha ukuxabana kubazalwane.
020	PRO	006	020	Ndodana yami, gcina imilayo kayihlo ungadeli imfundiso kanyoko.
020	PRO	006	021	Kubophele enhliziyweni yakho nini lanini; kugqize entanyeni yakho.
020	PRO	006	022	Nxa uhamba, lezizinto zizakukhokhela; lanxa ulele zizakulinda; uthi uvuka zikukhulumise.
020	PRO	006	023	Ngoba imilayo le iyisibane, imfundiso le iyikukhanya, leziqondiso zokuzithiba ziyindlela yokuphila,
020	PRO	006	024	zikuvikela kowesifazane ongaziphathanga, laselimini olumnandi lomfazi ongelambeko.
020	PRO	006	025	Ungasuki umfise ngenhliziyo yakho ngenxa yobuhle bakhe kumbe akuhuge ngamehlo akhe.
020	PRO	006	026	Ngoba isifebe siyakululazisa ufane lesinkwa, kodwa umfazi womuntu uyayibhidliza impilo yakho uqobo.
020	PRO	006	027	Kambe umuntu angokhela umlilo emathangazini akhe na zingaze zatsha izigqoko zakhe?
020	PRO	006	028	Kambe umuntu angahamba phezu kwamalahle inyawo zakhe zingaze zatsha na?
020	PRO	006	029	Kunjalo kulowo olala lomfazi wenye indoda; kakho omthintayo ongayikujeziswa.
020	PRO	006	030	Abantu kabalithuki isela nxa lintshontsha ngoba lifuqwa liphango.
020	PRO	006	031	Kodwa lingabanjwa lihlawuliswa kasikhombisa, lanxa inhlawulo ilithathela yonke impahla yendlu yalo.
020	PRO	006	032	Kodwa indoda efebayo kayilangqondo; lowo okwenzayo lokho uyazibulala yena ngokwakhe.
020	PRO	006	033	Izidutshulo lehlazo kuyisabelo sakhe, ukuyangeka kwakhe kakusoze kwafa kwaphela.
020	PRO	006	034	Ngoba ubukhwele bendoda yalowomfazi buyiqubula ulaka, ingabe isaba lozwelo lapho isiphindisela.
020	PRO	006	035	Kayizukuvuma inhlawulo; kayiyikwamukela isivalamlomo loba singakanani.
020	PRO	007	001	Ndodana yami, agcine amazwi ami ulondoloze imilayo yami ngaphakathi kwakho.
020	PRO	007	002	Gcina imilayo yami ukuze uphile; ulinde imfundiso yami njengegugu lakho elikhulu.
020	PRO	007	003	Ibophele eminweni yakho; uyilobe enhliziyweni yakho.
020	PRO	007	004	Tshela ukuhlakanipha uthi, “Ungudadewethu wena,” uthi ukuqedisisa kuyisihlobo sakho;
020	PRO	007	005	lezizinto zizakuvikela emfazini oyisifebe, lakumkakho ongelambeko ngamazwi akhe adukisayo.
020	PRO	007	006	Ngema ewindini lendlu yami ngalunguza ngesikhala.
020	PRO	007	007	Ngabona phakathi kwabayizithutha, ngananzelela phakathi kwamajaha ngabona ijaha elingelangqondo.
020	PRO	007	008	Lalisehla ngomgwaqo liseduze lejiko, liqonda endlini yowesifazane
020	PRO	007	009	ntambama sekunqunda amehlo, umnyama wobusuku usujiya.
020	PRO	007	010	Khonokho nje kwaqhamuka owesifazane elihlangabeza egqoke okwesifebe ngoba eqophile.
020	PRO	007	011	(Umfazi lowo, ngumuntu womsindo uyisiqholo, inyawo zakhe kazihlali phansi;
020	PRO	007	012	khathesi nangu emgwaqweni, njalo nangu enkundleni, utshobatshoba izindawana zonke.)
020	PRO	007	013	Wafika waligona lelijaha walanga wakhuluma engelanhloni wathi:
020	PRO	007	014	“Ngenzile umnikelo wobudlelwano ngekhaya; lamuhla ngizigcwalisile izifungo zami.
020	PRO	007	015	Yikho ngilapha ukukuhlangabeza; sengikudinge ngaze ngakuthola!
020	PRO	007	016	Sengiwendlele umbheda wami ngamalineni eGibhithe awemibalabala.
020	PRO	007	017	Sengiwuqholile umbheda wami ngemure, ngenhlaba langesinamoni.
020	PRO	007	018	Woza sizitike ngothando kuze kuse; kasizijabulise ngothando!
020	PRO	007	019	Indoda yami kayikho ekhaya; ihambile iye khatshana.
020	PRO	007	020	Ithwele isikhwama sayo sigcwele imali, ngakho kayibuyi kuze kube phakathi kwenyanga.”
020	PRO	007	021	Ngamazwi akhe amnandi waledukisa ijaha lelo; walihuga ijaha lelo ngolimi olumnandi.
020	PRO	007	022	Khonokho nje lahle lamlandela njengenkabi idonselwa ukuyabulawa, njengomziki uzingenisa emjibileni,
020	PRO	007	023	umtshoko uze uyehlaba isibindi, njengenyoni ithothela ngaphansi kwesifu, ingaboni ukuthi isizingenise ekufeni.
020	PRO	007	024	Ngakho-ke madodana ami, ngilalelani; zwanini lokhu engikutshoyo.
020	PRO	007	025	Lingayivumeli inhliziyo ikhangwe yizindlela zakhe, langabe iphumputhekele emikhubeni yakhe.
020	PRO	007	026	Banengi labo asebadilizile; izinkubela zakhe zilucaca olwesabekayo.
020	PRO	007	027	Indlu yakhe ingumgudu oya engcwabeni, iholela phansi ezindongeni zokufa.
020	PRO	008	001	Ukuhlakanipha kakumemezi yini? Ukuqedisisa kakuphakamisi ilizwi lakho na?
020	PRO	008	002	Emiqolweni yezindlela, emahlanganweni ezindlela kulapho okujame khona;
020	PRO	008	003	emasangweni angena phakathi kwedolobho, ezintubeni kuyamemeza kakhulu kusithi:
020	PRO	008	004	“Ngimemeza lina, madoda; ilizwi lami libiza bonke abantu.
020	PRO	008	005	Lina eliyizithutha, zuzani ukuqonda; lina ziphukuphuku, zuzani ukuqedisisa.
020	PRO	008	006	Lalelani ngoba ngilitshela izinto eziqakathekileyo; ngivula izindebe zami ngikhuluma okuqondileyo.
020	PRO	008	007	Umlomo wami ukhuluma okuliqiniso, ngoba izindebe zami ziyabenyanya ububi.
020	PRO	008	008	Wonke amazwi omlomo wami aqondile; kalikho lelilodwa elitshekileyo loba elingcolileyo.
020	PRO	008	009	Kulowo ozwisisayo wonke alungile; akulankohliso kulabo abalolwazi.
020	PRO	008	010	Khetha iseluleko sami kulesiliva, ulwazi kulegolide elikhethiweyo,
020	PRO	008	011	ngoba ukuhlakanipha kuligugu okudlula amarubhi, njalo akulanto ongayifisa ezifisweni zakho okulingana lakho.
020	PRO	008	012	Mina, kuhlakanipha, ngihlala ndawonye lokuqondisisa; ngilolwazi lokukhetha kuhle.
020	PRO	008	013	Ukwesaba uThixo yikuzonda ububi; ngiyakuzonda ukuzazisa lobuqholo, ukuziphatha kubi lenkulumo ebolileyo.
020	PRO	008	014	Ukweluleka lokwahlulela okuhle kungokwami; ngilokuzwisisa lamandla.
