020	PRO	030	001	Amazwi ka-Aguri indodana kaJakhe, amazwi ahlakaniphileyo: Umuntu lo wathi ku-Ithiyeli: “Ngikhathele, Oh Nkulunkulu, kodwa ngizophumelela.
020	PRO	030	002	Angilalwazi okudlula bonke abantu; angilakho ukuzwisisa komuntu.
020	PRO	030	003	Angikufundanga ukuhlakanipha njalo kangilalwazi ngaye oNgcwele.
020	PRO	030	004	Ngubani oseke waya ezulwini waphinda wehla na? Ngubani oseke wafumbatha umoya ngesandla sakhe na? Ngubani oseke wagoqela amanzi ngesigqoko sakhe na? Ngubani omise yonke imikhawulo yomhlaba na? Lingubani ibizo lakhe, lebizo lendodana yakhe? Ngitshela nxa usazi!
020	PRO	030	005	Wonke amazwi kaNkulunkulu akalamposiso; uyisihlangu kulabo abacatsha kuye.
020	PRO	030	006	Ungengezeleli emazwini akhe, funa akukhuze akwenze umqambimanga.
020	PRO	030	007	Zimbili izinto engizicela kuwe, Oh Thixo; ungangincitshi zona ngingakafi:
020	PRO	030	008	Susa kimi inkohliso lamanga; ungangiphi ubuyanga loba inotho, kodwa ungiphe kuphela ukudla kwami kwansukuzonke.
020	PRO	030	009	Phela ngingaba lokunengi kakhulu ngikuphike wena ngithi, ‘Ungubani uThixo?’ loba ngibengumyanga ngintshontshe; ngalokho ngiliyangise ibizo likaNkulunkulu wami.
020	PRO	030	010	Ungahlebi inceku enkosini yayo, ngoba izakuqalekisa ungene enkathazweni.
020	PRO	030	011	Bakhona abathuka oyise, abangababusisiyo onina;
020	PRO	030	012	labo abazibona belungile ikanti kabahlambululwanga emanyaleni abo;
020	PRO	030	013	labo abamehlo abo ahlezi egcwele ulaka, abakhangela ngokudelela;
020	PRO	030	014	labo omazinyo abo zinkemba, omihlathi yabo inanyathiselwe izingqamu ukuze baginye abayanga baphele emhlabeni, labaswelayo abaphakathi kwabantu.
020	PRO	030	015	Umkhaza ulamadodakazi amabili; ayamemeza athi, ‘Siphe! Siphe!’ Zintathu izinto ezingasuthiyo, zine ezingakaze zithi, ‘Sekwanele!’:
020	PRO	030	016	lingcwaba yisisu senyumba, lomhlabathi ongasuthiyo amanzi, lomlilo ongezukufa wathi, ‘Sekwanele!’
