020	PRO	030	019	indlela yengqungqulu emkhathini, umzila wenyoka edwaleni, indlela yomkhumbi olwandle, lendlela yejaha lentombi.
020	PRO	030	020	Le yindlela yesiphingikazi: siyadla sesule umlomo waso besesisithi, ‘Angenzanga lutho olubi.’
020	PRO	030	021	Zintathu izinto ezizamazamisa umhlaba, zine ongeke uzithwale:
020	PRO	030	022	yinceku ebayinkosi, yisiwula esisuthiyo,
020	PRO	030	023	ngumfazi owendileyo ongathandwayo, lencekukazi ethathela inkosikazi indoda.
020	PRO	030	024	Kukhona emhlabeni izinto ezine ezincinyane, ikanti-ke zihlakaniphile kakhulu:
020	PRO	030	025	Ubunyonyo kabulamandla anganani, kodwa buyabuthelela ukudla kwabo ehlobo;
020	PRO	030	026	lezimbila ziyizidalwa ezilamandla angatsho lutho, kodwa zenza izikhundla zazo ezingoxweni zamadwala;
020	PRO	030	027	izintethe kazilankosi, kodwa zihamba ziludibi olwesabekayo;
020	PRO	030	028	umbankwa ungabanjwa ngesandla, kodwa ungena lasezigodlweni zamakhosi.
020	PRO	030	029	Kulezinto ezintathu ezihamba zinqekuza kamnandi, zine ezihamba zibeka kamnandi:
020	PRO	030	030	yisilwane, esilamandla esabekayo phakathi kwezilo, esingabalekeli lutho;
020	PRO	030	031	liqhude eliditshazelayo, yimpongo, njalo lenkosi nxa ihanqwe libutho layo.
020	PRO	030	032	Nxa ube yisithutha waziphakamisa, kumbe nxa wakhe amacebo okwenza okubi, vala umlomo wakho ngesandla sakho.
020	PRO	030	033	Ngoba njengokuphehla uchago kudala iphehla, lanjengoba ukugubha amakhala kubanga umungula, kunjalo ukuvusa ulaka kudala ingxabano.”
