020	PRO	031	002	Oh, ndodana yami! Oh ndodana yethumbu lami! Oh, ndodana yezifungo zami,
020	PRO	031	003	ungadlalisi amandla akho ebafazini, izifutho zakho kulabo abadiliza amakhosi.
