024	JER	008	017	“Khangelani, ngizathumela phakathi kwenu izinyoka ezilobuhlungu, izinhlangwana ezingeke zithakathwe, njalo zizaliluma,” kutsho uThixo.
024	JER	008	018	Awu Mduduzi wami osizini, inhliziyo yami isiqaleka phakathi kwami.
024	JER	008	019	Lalela ukukhala kwabantu bami okuvela elizweni elikhatshana besithi: “UThixo kakho eZiyoni na? INkosi yalo kayisekho lapho na?” “Kungani bevuse ulaka lwami ngezifanekiso zabo, langezithombe zezizweni eziyize na?”
024	JER	008	020	“Ukuvuna sekwedlule, ihlobo seliphelile, kodwa kasihlengwanga.”
024	JER	008	021	Njengoba abantu bami benqotshiwe lami nginqotshiwe, ngiyalila njalo ukwesaba kungiphethe.
