024	JER	052	026	UNebhuzaradani umlawuli wabathatha bonke wabasa enkosini yaseBhabhiloni eRibhila.
024	JER	052	027	Khonale eRibhila, elizweni laseHamathi, inkosi yathi kabaqunywe. Ngakho abakoJuda baya ekuthunjweni kude lelizwe labo.
024	JER	052	028	Nanka amanani abantu uNebhukhadineza abasa ekuthunjweni: ngomnyaka wesikhombisa, amaJuda azinkulungwane ezintathu lamatshumi amabili lantathu;
024	JER	052	029	ngomnyaka kaNebhukhadineza wetshumi lasificaminwembili mibili, abantu beJerusalema abangamakhulu ayisificamunwemunye lamatshumi amathathu lambili;
024	JER	052	030	ngomnyaka wakhe wamatshumi amabili lantathu, amaJuda angamakhulu ayisikhombisa lamatshumi amane lanhlanu asiwa ekuthunjweni nguNebhuzaradani umlawuli wabalindi ekubusweni kwezizwe ezinengi. Bebonke kwakungabantu abazinkulungwane ezine lamakhulu ayisithupha.
024	JER	052	031	Ngomnyaka wamatshumi amathathu lesikhombisa uJehoyakhini inkosi yakoJuda esekuthunjweni, ngomnyaka u-Evili-Merodakhi aba yinkosi yaseBhabhiloni ngawo, wakhulula uJehoyakhini inkosi yakoJuda, wamkhupha entolongweni ngosuku lwamatshumi amabili lanhlanu lwenyanga yetshumi lambili.
024	JER	052	032	Wakhuluma laye ngomusa, wamnika isihlalo esihloniphekayo esasingaphezu kwezamanye amakhosi ayelaye eBhabhiloni.
024	JER	052	033	Ngakho uJehoyakhini wakhupha izigqoko zakhe zasentolongweni, wadla lenkosi izikhathi zonke okwempilo yakhe yonke.
024	JER	052	034	Nsuku zonke inkosi yaseBhabhiloni yayinika uJehoyakhini isabelo esimisiweyo malanga wonke empilweni yakhe, kwaze kwafika ilanga lokufa kwakhe.
#
# BOOK	025	LAM	Lamentations	Izililo
025	LAM	001	001	Kuthule kuthe cwaka! Yeka lelidolobho elalinyakazela abantu! Selinjengomfelokazi, kanti lalilodumo phakathi kwezizwe. Lona elaliyindlovukazi phakathi kwezigodi, khathesi seliyisigqili.
025	LAM	001	002	Linjengowesifazane okhala kabuhlungu ebusuku, inyembezi zithe hlikilili ezihlathini. Kakho phakathi kwazo zonke izithandwa zakhe ongamduduza. Bonke abangane bakhe bamhlamukele; sebeyizitha zakhe.
025	LAM	001	003	UJuda useye ebugqilini ngemva kokuhlupheka lokudonsa nzima. Usehlala phakathi kwabezizwe; akatholi ndawo yokuphumula. Bonke abamzingelayo bamxhumile ephakathi kokuhlupheka kwakhe.
025	LAM	001	004	Iyalila imigwaqo eya eZiyoni, ngoba kasekho ozayo emikhosini yalo emisiweyo. Wonke amasango alo asekhohlakele, abaphristi balo bayabubula, amantombazana alo ayagomela, lona lidabukile kakhulu.
025	LAM	001	005	Izitha zalo sezingababusi balo; ziyaklamasa. UThixo ulehlisele usizi ngenxa yezono zalo ezinengi. Abantwabalo bathunjiwe, baba yizigqili zezitha.
025	LAM	001	006	Kuphelile konke ukubenyezela kweNdodakazi yaseZiyoni. Amakhosana ayo asenjengezimpala ezingatholi amadlelo; zibalekile zilambile zingelamandla zibalekela umzingeli.
025	LAM	001	007	Ngezinsuku zokuhlupheka lokuntula, iJerusalema iyayikhumbula inotho eyayingeyayo ngensuku zayo. Kuthe abantu bayo sebewela ezandleni zezitha, akubanga khona ongayinceda. Zayikhangela nje izitha zayo zahleka ukuchitheka kwayo.
025	LAM	001	008	IJerusalema yonile kakhulu, ngakho isingcolile. Bonke ababeyihlonipha sebeyidelela, ngoba sebebonile ubuze bayo; yona ngokwayo ibubula ize ifulathele.
025	LAM	001	009	Ukungcola kwayo kwabhixa izidwaba zayo; kayinakanga ikusasa yayo. Ukuwa kwayo kwesabeka, kungekho oyiduduzayo. “Oh Thixo, ake ukhangele ukuhlupheka kwami, ngoba isitha sesinqobile.”
025	LAM	001	010	Isitha saphanga yonke inotho yayo; yabona izizwe ezingakholwayo zingena endlini yayo engcwele, bona labo owabanqabela ukungena phakathi kwebandla lakho.
025	LAM	001	011	Bonke abantu bayo bayagomela behamba bedinga ukudla; bathengisa inotho yabo eligugu ngokudla ukuze bangafi. “Oh Thixo, ake ungihawukele ngoba sengidelelwa.”
025	LAM	001	012	“Kakusilutho kini yini lina lonke elidlula lapha? Ake likhangele nje libone. Kambe kukhona ukuhlupheka okulingana lokwami, khona lokhu engakwehliselwayo, nguThixo ngosuku lokuvutha kolaka lwakhe?
025	LAM	001	013	Wehlisa umlilo uvela phezulu, wawehlisela phakathi kwamathambo ami. Wangithiya ezinyaweni ngomambule, wangibuyisela emuva. Wangenza ngaba lesizungu, ngaswela amandla ilanga lonke.
025	LAM	001	014	Izono zami zisongwe zaba lijogwe; ngezandla zakhe wazelukela ndawonye. Zetheswe entanyeni yami, uThixo wangiqeda amandla. Usengifuqele kulabo engingeke ngimelane labo.
025	LAM	001	015	UThixo kabemukelanga bonke abangabebutho lami; usebize impi ukuthi ingihlasele, ichoboze zonke izinsizwa zami. Esihluzweni sakhe sewayini, uThixo unyathelele phansi iNdodakazi yakoJuda eGcweleyo.
025	LAM	001	016	Yikho ngilila, amehlo ami empompoza inyembezi. Kakho oseduze ongangiduduza, kakho ongavusa umphefumulo wami. Abantwabami sebeswela ngoba isitha sinqobile.”
025	LAM	001	017	IZiyoni yelulile isandla sayo kodwa kakho oyiduduzayo. UThixo usekumisile ngoJakhobe ukuthi abakhelene laye babe yizitha zakhe; iJerusalema isiphenduke yaba yinto engcolileyo kubo.
025	LAM	001	018	“UThixo ulungile, kodwa ngaphikisana lomlayo wakhe. Lalelani bantu lonke; khangelani ukuhawula kwami. Izinsizwa lezintombi zami zonke sezaya ekuthunjweni.
025	LAM	001	019	Ngakhala kulabo engidlelana labo, kodwa banginina. Abaphristi bami labadala bami babhubhela phakathi kwedolobho besadinga ukudla, ukuze baziphilise.
025	LAM	001	020	Ake ubone, Oh Thixo, ukuthi ngihlupheka njani! Ngiyatsha ngaphakathi kwami, ngidungekile enhliziyweni yami, ngoba bengilihlongandlebe. Ngaphandle, inkemba iyadabukisa; ngaphakathi, yikufa kodwa.
025	LAM	001	021	Abantu bakuzwile ukububula kwami, kodwa kakho ongangiduduza. Zonke izitha zami zikuzwile ukuhlupheka kwami; ziyathokoza ngalokhu okwenzileyo. Sengathi ungalufikisa lolusuku owalumisayo, ukuze labo babe njengami.
025	LAM	001	022	Abuvele kuwe bonke ububi babo; yenza kubo konke okwenzileyo kimi ngenxa yezono zami zonke. Kunengi ukububula kwami, lenhliziyo yami iphela amandla.”
025	LAM	002	001	UThixo wembese iNdodakazi yeZiyoni ngeyezi lolaka lwakhe! Ubutaklazele phansi ubunkanyankanya buka-Israyeli busuka ezulwini busiya emhlabeni; kasinakanga isenabelo sakhe mhla wentukuthelo yakhe.
025	LAM	002	002	UThixo kabanga lozwelo lapho eginya yonke imizi kaJakhobe; ngolaka lwakhe udilizele phansi izinqaba zeNdodakazi kaJuda. Usewuchithile umbuso wakhe, lababusi bawo wababhuqa phansi, baba lehlazo.
025	LAM	002	003	Ngolaka lwakhe olwesabekayo, usegumule zonke impondo zika-Israyeli. Usegodle isandla sakhe sokunene lapho kuqhamuka isitha. Utshise koJakhobe njengelangabi elihangula konke okuseduze.
025	LAM	002	004	Usethiye idandili lakhe njengesitha; isandla sakhe sokunene sesiqaphile. Njengesitha usebabulele bonke ababebahle ebusweni; usethele ulaka lwakhe olungumlilo phezu kwethente leNdodakazi yeZiyoni.
025	LAM	002	005	UThixo unjengesitha; usemginyile u-Israyeli. Useziginyile zonke izigodlo zakhe, wabhidliza zonke izinqaba zakhe. Usekwandisile ukukhala lokulilela iNdodakazi kaJuda.
025	LAM	002	006	Usetshaye wakhukhula umuzi wakhe njengensimu; usebhidlize indawo yakhe yokuhlanganela. UThixo usenze iZiyoni yakhohlwa imikhosi yayo emisiweyo lamaSabatha ayo; olakeni lwakhe olwesabekayo, ukhukhulele khatshana oyinkosi longumphristi.
025	LAM	002	007	UThixo uselikhalele i-alithari lakhe, wafulathela indlu yakhe engcwele. Usenikele imithangala yezigodlo zakhe ezandleni zesitha; seziklabalala endlini kaThixo sengathi lilanga lomkhosi omisiweyo.
025	LAM	002	008	UThixo wazimisela ukudilizela phansi umthangala ohonqolozele iNdodakazi yeZiyoni. Welula intambo yesilinganiso sakhe, akaze agodla isandla sakhe esibhidlizayo. Wenza izinsika lemithangala kwalila; kanyekanye kwatshabalala.
025	LAM	002	009	Amasango akhe asegqibelekile; izinti zawo zephulwe zabhidlizwa. Inkosi yayo lamakhosana ayo achithizelwe kwabezizwe, umthetho kawusekho, labaphrofethi bakhe kabasayamukeli imibono evela kuThixo.
025	LAM	002	010	Abadala beNdodakazi yeZiyoni bahlezi emhlabathini bathule zwi; bazithele ngothuli emakhanda abo, bazembathisa amasaka. Izintombi zeJerusalema zimbozele amakhanda azo phansi.
025	LAM	002	011	Amehlo ami ayehluleka ngokukhala, ngiyatsha ngaphakathi kwami, inhliziyo yami idabukile, ngoba abantu bakithi babhujisiwe, njalo abantwana lensane ziyaqaleka emigwaqweni yomuzi.
025	LAM	002	012	Zithi kubonina, “Singaphi isinkwa lewayini?” zilokhu ziqaleka njengamadoda alimeleyo emigwaqweni yomuzi, ziphela umphefumulo ezandleni zabonina.
025	LAM	002	013	Kambe ngingathini kuwe na? Ngingakulinganisa lani, wena Ndodakazi yaseJerusalema? Kambe ngingakufanisa lani ukuze ngikududuze, wena Ndodakazi eGcweleyo yaseZiyoni? Inxeba lakho lizike njengolwandle. Ngubani ongakwelapha na?
025	LAM	002	014	Imibono yabaphrofethi bakho yayikhohlisa ingasizi lutho; kabasivezanga obala isono sakho ukuze ungehlelwa yikuthunjwa. Ukuvumisa abalenzela khona kwakungamanga, kulikhohlisa.
025	LAM	002	015	Bonke abedlula eceleni kwakho batshaya izandla ngawe; bahleka iNdodakazi yaseJerusalema baze banikine amakhanda besithi, “Kambe yiwo yini umuzi lo owawuthiwa yibuhle obupheleleyo, igugu lomhlaba wonke jikelele?”
025	LAM	002	016	Zonke izitha zakho zikukhamisele imilomo; ziyakuhleka zikugedlela amazinyo zisithi, “Sesimnqobile. Selize lafika ilanga esasililindele; kade salilindela.”
025	LAM	002	017	UThixo usekwenzile ayekuhlosile; useligcwalisile ilizwi lakhe, alikhuluma kudala. Ukuwisile engakuzweli usizi, uvumele isitha santela phezu kwakho, uluphakamisile uphondo lwezitha zakho.
025	LAM	002	018	Inhliziyo zabantu ziyakhala eNkosini. Awu, mthangala weNdodakazi yaseZiyoni, kazigeleze njengomfula inyembezi zakho, ebusuku lemini; ungaziphi ikhefu, lamehlo akho ungawaphi ukuphumula.
025	LAM	002	019	Phakama, nqongoloza ebusuku, lapho kuqalisa imilindo yebusuku; thulula inhliziyo yakho njengamanzi phambi kukaThixo. Phakamisela izandla zakho kuye, uncengela impilo yabantwabakho, abaqalekiswa yindlala ekuqaliseni kwemigwaqo yonke.
025	LAM	002	020	Ake ukhangele, Thixo, ube lozwelo: Ngubani osewake wamphatha kanje? Abesifazane badle inzalo yabo yini, abantwana ababondlileyo na? Umphristi lomphrofethi babulawe endlini engcwele kaThixo na?
025	LAM	002	021	Abatsha labadala babhazalele ndawonye ebhuqwini lwemigwaqo; izinsizwa zami lezintombi zibulewe ngenkemba. Ubabulele ngosuku lokuthukuthela kwakho; awaze waba lesihawu lapho ubabulala.
025	LAM	002	022	“Njengokunxusela idili, wanginxusela izitha inxa zonke. Ngosuku lolaka lukaThixo, kakho owaphunyukayo loba owasilayo; bonke engangibanakekela lengabondlayo babulewe yisitha sami.”
025	LAM	003	001	Yimi umuntu olubonileyo usizi ngenxa yoswazi lokuthukuthela kukaThixo.
025	LAM	003	002	Ungixotshile, wangiphumputhekisa emnyameni hatshi ekukhanyeni;
025	LAM	003	003	ngempela usengiphakamisele isandla sakhe, waphindaphinda ilanga lonke.
025	LAM	003	004	Usenze ijwabu lami laluphala, wangephula amathambo.
025	LAM	003	005	Ungihanqile wangihonqolozela ngosizi langobunzima.
025	LAM	003	006	Ungenze ngahlala emnyameni njengalabo abafa kudala.
025	LAM	003	007	Ungihonqolozele ngenqaba ukuze ngingaphunyuki; ungibophe nko ngamaketane.
025	LAM	003	008	Kuthi lanxa ngimemeza loba ngidinga usizo, awuvalele phandle umkhuleko wami.
025	LAM	003	009	Uvale indlela yami ngamatshe; waphambukisa izindlela zami.
025	LAM	003	010	Njengebhele licathamile, njengesilwane sicatshile,
025	LAM	003	011	wangihudulela eceleni kwendlela, wangifohloza, wangitshiya ngingelamsizi.
025	LAM	003	012	Wadonsa idandili lakhe, ngaba yikudla kwemitshoko yakhe.
025	LAM	003	013	Wangiciba enhliziyweni ngemitshoko evela emxhakeni wakhe.
025	LAM	003	014	Ngaba yinhlekisa ebantwini bakithi bonke; sengitshona ngiyingoma eyinhlekisa kubo.
025	LAM	003	015	Ungigqibe ngemithi ebabayo, wanginathisa inyongo.
025	LAM	003	016	Ungihlafunise ukhethe ngamazinyo; wangigiqa ebhuqwini.
025	LAM	003	017	Ngincitshiwe ukuthula; angisakwazi ingabe iyini impumelelo.
025	LAM	003	018	Ngakho ngithi, “Sebuphelile ubucwazicwazi bami, lakho konke engangikulindele kuThixo.”
025	LAM	003	019	Ngikhumbula ukuhlupheka lokuntula kwami, ubumunyu lenyongo.
025	LAM	003	020	Konke ngikukhumbula kamhlophe, umoya wami wephukile.
025	LAM	003	021	Kodwa ngikhumbula lokhu ngibe lethemba:
025	LAM	003	022	Ngenxa yothando olukhulu lukaThixo kasibhujiswanga, ngoba isihawu sakhe kasipheli.
025	LAM	003	023	Siba sitsha ukusa kwamalanga; kukhulu ukuthembeka kwakho.
025	LAM	003	024	Ngiyazitshela ngithi, “UThixo uyisabelo sami; ngakho ngizalindela yena.”
025	LAM	003	025	UThixo ulungile kulowo omethembayo, kulowo omdingayo;
025	LAM	003	026	kuhle ukulinda ngokuthula, ukulindela insindiso kaThixo.
025	LAM	003	027	Kuhle ukuthi umuntu alithwale ijogwe ngesikhathi esesemutsha.
025	LAM	003	028	Kahlale yedwa ngokuthula, ngoba uThixo ulibeke phezu kwakhe.
025	LAM	003	029	Kembele ubuso bakhe ethulini, mhlawumbe ithemba lizakuba khona.
025	LAM	003	030	Kaphe isihlathi sakhe kulowo ofuna ukumhlankala, agcwale ihlazo.
025	LAM	003	031	Ngoba uThixo kabalahli abantu kuze kube nini lanini.
025	LAM	003	032	Loba engaletha ubuhlungu, uzatshengisa uzwelo, lukhulu kakhulu uthando lwakhe olungapheliyo.
025	LAM	003	033	Ngoba kehliseli ukuhlupheka losizi ebantwini ngokuthanda.
025	LAM	003	034	Ukuhlifiza ngezinyawo zonke izibotshwa elizweni,
025	LAM	003	035	ukuncitsha umuntu amalungelo akhe phambi koPhezukonke,
025	LAM	003	036	ukungahluleli kuhle, kambe uThixo uyabe engaziboni izinto ezinjalo na?
025	LAM	003	037	Ngubani ongatsho ulutho lwenzakale nxa lungavunyelwanga nguThixo na?
025	LAM	003	038	Akuveli emlonyeni woPhezukonke ukuthi kuyehla inhlupheko lezinto ezinhle na?
025	LAM	003	039	Pho kungani umuntu ophilayo esola nxa ejeziselwa izono zakhe na?
025	LAM	003	040	Kasilingeni njalo sihlole izindlela zethu, sibuyele kuThixo.
025	LAM	003	041	Asiphakamiseleni inhliziyo lezandla zethu kuNkulunkulu ezulwini sithi:
025	LAM	003	042	“Sonile sahlamuka, njalo kawusithethelelanga.
025	LAM	003	043	Uzigubuzele ngolaka waxhumana lathi; ubhubhisile ungelazwelo.
025	LAM	003	044	Uzisibekele ngeyezi ukuze kungafinyeleli mkhuleko kuwe.
025	LAM	003	045	Usenze saba ngamanyala lengcekeza phakathi kwezizwe.
025	LAM	003	046	Izitha zethu zonke zivule imilomo yazo zezwakala zisihoza.
025	LAM	003	047	Sesihlukuluzwe yikuthuthumela lokukhilikithela, ukudilika lokubhidlika.”
025	LAM	003	048	Imifula yezinyembezi iyajuluka emehlweni ami ngoba abantu bakithi babhujisiwe.
025	LAM	003	049	Amehlo ami azajuluka kokuphela, engelakuphumula,
025	LAM	003	050	UThixo aze akhangele phansi esezulwini, angibone.
025	LAM	003	051	Engikubonayo kuthelela usizi emphefumulweni wami ngenxa yabesifazane bonke bomuzi wakithi.
025	LAM	003	052	Labo ababa yizitha zami kungelasizatho, bangizingela njengenyoni.
025	LAM	003	053	Bazama ukuquma impilo yami emgodini bangijikijela ngamatshe;
025	LAM	003	054	amanzi asibekela ikhanda lami, ngabona ukuthi okwami sekuphelile.
025	LAM	003	055	Ngalimemezela ibizo lakho, Oh Thixo, ngisekujuleni komgodi.
025	LAM	003	056	Wezwa ukuncenga kwami: “Ungavali indlebe zakho nxa ngikhalela ukwenyulwa.”
025	LAM	003	057	Wasondela lapho ngikumemeza, wathi kimi, “Ungesabi.”
025	LAM	003	058	Oh Thixo, wasamukela isikhalazo sami; wahlenga ukuphila kwami.
025	LAM	003	059	Ububonile Thixo, ububi obenziwe kimi. Ngisekela kulobubunzima!
025	LAM	003	060	Usubonile ukujula kokusonga kwabo, lamacebo abo wonke ngami.
025	LAM	003	061	Awu Thixo, uzwile inhlamba zabo, wonke amacebo abo ngami,
025	LAM	003	062	ukunyenyeza lokungunguna kwabo ngami ukusa kwamalanga.
025	LAM	003	063	Ake ubabone! Bahlezi kumbe bajamile, bayangihleka ngezingoma zabo.
025	LAM	003	064	Awu Thixo, akubaphindisele ngokubafaneleyo, ngalokho okwenziwe yizandla zabo.
025	LAM	003	065	Basibekele ngelembu ezinhliziyweni zabo, isiqalekiso sakho sehlele phezu kwabo!
025	LAM	003	066	Xhumana labo ngolaka, ubabhubhise ngaphansi kwamazulu kaThixo.
025	LAM	004	001	Yeka igolide eselilahlekelwe yikukhazimula kwalo, igolide elicolekileyo selijujukile! Amatshe aligugu angcwele aselahliwe ekuqaliseni kwemigwaqo yonke.
025	LAM	004	002	Yeka izinsizwa zaseZiyoni ezincomekayo, ezake zaba lesisindo njengegolide, okwamanje sezingathi zimbiza zebumba, umsebenzi wezandla zombumbi!
025	LAM	004	003	Ngitsho lamakhanka asemunyisa abantwabawo emabeleni awo, kodwa abantu bami kabaselazwelo njengezintshe enkangala.
025	LAM	004	004	Ngenxa yokoma, ulimi losane lunamathele elwangeni lomlomo; abantwana bancenga becela isinkwa kodwa kakho obaphayo.
025	LAM	004	005	Labo ababesidla izibiliboco sebeyiziceli emigwaqweni. Labo abondliwa ebutifitifini sebelala esilotheni.
025	LAM	004	006	Isijeziso sabantu bakithi sikhulu kuleseSodoma, yona eyabhujiswa ngomzuzwana, akwaze kwaba lasandla esazama ukunceda.
025	LAM	004	007	Amakhosana abo ayekhazimula kulongqwaqwane, emhlophe nke kulochago, imizimba yabo ibomvana njengamatshe ohlobo lwerubhi, ukubukeka kwabo kunjengelitshe elikhazimulayo.
025	LAM	004	008	Kodwa manje sebemnyama kulomsizi; kabasananzwa langubani emigwaqweni. Isikhumba sabo sesinamathele emathanjeni abo; sesome okogodo.
