041	MAR	004	001	UJesu waphinda njalo wafundisa okhunjini lwesiziba. Ixuku labantu elaqoqana labuthana kuye laba likhulu kakhulu waze wangena esikepeni wahlala kuso siphakathi kwamanzi, kodwa abantu bonke bona bethe gwaqa okhunjini ekucineni kwamanzi.
041	MAR	004	002	Wabafundisa izinto ezinengi ngemizekeliso, ekufundiseni kwakhe wathi:
041	MAR	004	003	“Lalelani! Umlimi waphuma wayahlanyela inhlanyelo yakhe.
041	MAR	004	004	Kwathi eyihaza inhlanyelo, enye yawela endleleni, kwafika izinyoni zayidobha.
041	MAR	004	005	Eyinye yawela okhetheni lapho okwakungela mhlabathi owaneleyo. Yamila masinyane ngoba umhlabathi wawungatshoni.
041	MAR	004	006	Kodwa kwathi ilanga seliphumile, yahanguka yabuna ngoba yayingelampande.
041	MAR	004	007	Enye inhlanyelo yawela emeveni asuka akhula aminya leyonhlanyelo yaze yehluleka ukuthela izikhwebu.
041	MAR	004	008	Eyinye inhlanyelo yawela emhlabathini omuhle. Yamila, yakhula, yathela amabele yanda ngamatshumi amathathu, ayisithupha ngitsho langekhulu.”
