041	MAR	009	046	lapho ‘impethu zakhona ezidlayo zingafi lomlilo ongacitshiyo.’]
041	MAR	009	047	Njalo nxa ilihlo lakho likwenza wone, likopole liphume. Kungcono kuwe ukungena embusweni kaNkulunkulu ulelihlo elilodwa kulokuba lamehlo amabili kodwa uphoselwe esihogweni,
041	MAR	009	048	lapho ‘impethu zakhona ezidlayo zingafi, lomlilo ongacitshiyo.’
041	MAR	009	049	Umuntu wonke uzakuvuvuzelwa itswayi ngomlilo.
041	MAR	009	050	Itswayi lilungile, kodwa nxa lingalahlekelwa yibumunyu balo, ungalivuselela njani na? Wobani letswayi ngaphakathi kwenu, lihlalisane ngokuthula.”
041	MAR	010	001	UJesu wasesuka kuleyondawo waya emangweni waseJudiya langaphetsheya kweJodani. Njalo kweza kuye amaxuku abantu, kwathi njengenjayelo yakhe wabafundisa.
041	MAR	010	002	Abanye abaFarisi beza bamlinga ngokumbuza bathi, “Kusemthethweni yini ukuthi indoda imale umfazi wayo na?”
041	MAR	010	003	Waphendula wathi, “UMosi walilaya wathini?”
041	MAR	010	004	Bathi, “UMosi wayivumela indoda ukuthi ibhale incwadi yokuquma umtshado ibisimxotsha.”
041	MAR	010	005	UJesu waphendula wathi, “Kwakungenxa yokuthi zazilukhuni inhliziyo zenu okwenza uMosi walibhalela umthetho lo.
