041	MAR	010	041	Kwathi abalitshumi bekuzwa lokhu bazondela uJakhobe loJohane.
041	MAR	010	042	UJesu wababizela ndawonye wathi, “Liyakwazi ukuthi labo abangababusi kwabeZizwe bababusa kalukhuni, lezinduna zabo ezinkulu zitshengisa amandla phezu kwabo.
